\id ACT  
\h Nɨ'ariekate 
\toc1 Nɨ'ariekate kememɨte'uyuri 
\toc2 Nɨ'ariekate 
\toc3 Nɨ'a 
\mt1 Nɨ'ariekate kememɨte'uyuri  
\c 1  
\s1 Kememɨte'utahɨawarie 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata memexeiyanikɨ  
\p
\v 1 Neuxei Teukiru, matɨari paitɨ xapa neputawewi naitɨ kemɨtiuyɨ hepaɨtsita tikuxatame, Ketsutsi kemɨtitsutɨa yatiyurienetɨ meta ti'ɨkitatɨ,  
\v 2 mɨpaɨ tiuyurieka 'ana kananutiwitɨkieni, 'aitsika warupitɨaka nɨ'ariekate mɨwaranayexei, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata yati'aitakaku.  
\v 3 Hikɨta tiukwineka mɨkɨ, wahetsɨa 'uyeikatɨ puyuhekɨatakai kemɨrayenierekai mamariwawemekɨ tiyurienetɨ. Huta tewiyari tukari mepixeiyakai. Tiwakuxaxatɨwame kemɨreuyewetse Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku.   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ wahamatɨa tikwatɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani:  
\p —Kerutsaremetsie xepɨka'ayekɨkani, matsi xekeneta'ikwewani tita ne'ukiyari mɨtixatakai kename tixehanɨ'airieni, ketita xemɨte'u'eni netikuxatakaku:  
\v 5 Wani hakɨ xeikɨa katini'ɨyanekaitɨni, xeme matsi 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ xepɨka'ɨyarieni yapaɨmexɨa tukari 'anukayayu.   
\p
\v 6 Hɨkɨ mɨkɨ hamatɨana memuyukuxeɨri mɨpaɨ mekateniku'iwawiyakaitɨni:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ¿hikɨri petihekwatɨani 'Ixaheri mɨra'aitakaitsie?   
\p
\v 7 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xeme xehetsie pɨkatinake xemɨtemaikakɨ kepauka tukari mɨtinake. Ne'ukiyari xeikɨa yakatini'aitani.  
\v 8 Matsi xekanitɨrɨkariyariekuni 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata yuhetsie xehexeiyatɨ. Xemunenierixɨ xepɨhɨkɨtɨni xetehekɨatatɨ nehepaɨtsita Kerutsareme, naitsarie Kureyatsie, Tsamariyatsie meta naitsarie kwie manuniere paitɨ.   
\p
\v 9 Mɨpaɨ tikuxatakaku, mɨkɨ me'ixeiyakaku, kananutiwitɨkieni, hai kaniukuyani memɨka'ixeiyakɨ.  
\v 10 Hikɨ yuheima mehautinenierekaku mexi 'a'utimiekai, yapauka 'ukitsi yuhutatɨ wa'aurie mekaniti'uni mehautuxatɨ.  
\v 11 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Karereyutari, ¿titayari mana xeteti'u muyuawitsie xeheutinenieretɨ? Mɨkɨ Ketsutsi xetsata 'uwetɨ manutiwitɨkie, kexemɨte'ixei muyuawitsie heutimieme, yaxeikɨata tiyuxexeiyatɨ kaninuamɨkɨ.   
\s1 Matiyaxi kemɨranayexeiyarie Kura hetsiemieme  
\p
\v 12 Hikɨ Kerutsareme mekaniu'axɨani yemuri Huriwu mati'u mɨrakutewatsie meheyekɨneka, 'uxipiya tukaritsie tewi kemɨtipitɨarie mana muyeikanikɨ, xeikirumeturuyari petewakai Kerutsareme.  
\v 13 Hikɨ me'u'axɨaka, kiita mekaneutihaxɨani wapaitɨ memayukuxexeɨriwatsie. Muwa mepayetekai Pekuru, Kakuwu, Wani, 'Atɨrexi, Peripe, Tumaxi, Waxiturume, Mateu, Kakuwu 'Aripeu nu'aya, Tsimuni Tseruti kiekame meta Kura Kakuwu nu'aya.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨ yunaitɨ xei'iyariyari mepexeiyakai, meyuxewitɨ nenewierikɨ mepɨ'ayumiemetetɨkai, 'ukarawetsixi yunaitɨ, Mariya Ketsutsi maamaya meta 'iwamama.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ mɨkɨ tukaritsie Pekuru yu'iwama wahixɨapa kaniutakeni, teɨteri memuyuxeɨriekai xeitsienituyari heimana xeitewiyari mekaniyupaɨmekaitɨni,  
\v 16 mɨpaɨ Pekuru katiniwarutahɨawe: «Ne'iwama, kaneuyewekaitɨni 'utɨarika maye'anikɨ, meripaitɨ kemutayɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata, Rawiri mɨpaɨ 'utayɨku Kura hepaɨtsita, mɨkɨ kemɨ'ane mɨwarewitɨ Ketsutsi mɨwiyarienikɨ.  
\v 17 Kura tahamatɨa puyeikakai, meta tahamatɨa pɨti'uximayakai.  
\v 18 (Hikɨ tumini mu'ɨitɨariekɨ kwie kaniunaneni, mana 'atiweka yumu'ukɨ kaniukaweni kaniutatsane, kwinurieya naitɨ kanawiwieni.  
\v 19 Kerutsareme memɨtama yunaitɨ mepɨte'utamari, 'ayumieme mana kwiepa 'Atserirama katinakutewaka waniukikɨ, manɨyɨne “Xuriya Mataxɨri” katinakutewaka).   
\p
\v 20 »Karikɨ Nɨawari xapayari puta'utɨarie mɨpaɨ 'anuyɨtɨ:  
\q1 »“Kiiya 'uyemawetɨ ke'ayani,  
\q2 muwa nixewitɨ pɨka'ayekani”.  
\m Metatsiere mɨpaɨ pɨre'uxa:  
\q1 »“Kemɨtihɨritɨariekai xewitɨ pɨta hetsiena mieme kerayani”.   
\p
\v 21 'Ayumieme, kaneuyeweka xeime temanayexeiya munierixɨ tahamatɨa memu'uwakai tukarikɨ kepauka Ti'aitame Ketsutsi tahetsɨa muyeikakaitsie,  
\v 22 mɨkɨ tukaritsie Wani meka'ɨyaxɨtsie, meta kepauka tatsata manutiwitɨkietsie, peuyewetse mɨkɨ xewitɨ memunenierixɨ tahamatɨa tihekɨatatɨ mayanikɨ kemɨranukuke».   
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ yuhutame mekaniwaranayexeiya Kutse Waritsawaxi mɨtitewakai meta Kutsitu mɨtimatiwakai, metatsiere Matiyaxi panayexeiyarie.  
\v 24 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ mekateniyutanenewieni: «'Ekɨ Ti'aitame yunaime wa'iyari pemɨmate. Ketaneuxeitsitɨa kemɨ'ane pemanuyexeiya 'ikɨ yuhutame wahetsie,  
\v 25 hetsiena mɨtinakenikɨ 'ikɨ hepaɨtsita mɨhɨritɨarienikɨ mɨtanɨ'arienikɨ, Kura mɨtiuhayewaxɨkɨ yu'ɨtɨma metɨakɨ».  
\v 26 'Inɨari mepuwewi kemɨ'ane rahetsie mɨtinakekekai. Matiyaxi hetsie katiniunake. Mɨkɨ nɨ'ariekate wahamatɨa matiwatɨ patɨa tamamata heimana xewi.   
\c 2  
\s1 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata kemɨtinua  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'atahutarieka Tsemana 'ixɨarariyari 'aye'aku, yunaitɨ mepɨyuxeɨriekai yameteyurienike 'auxeikɨa.  
\v 2 Yapauka taheima mieme 'eka hepaɨ 'anetɨ kaniukuyani tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ yemietɨ, mɨkɨ yuariya kiita putahɨnixɨ memuwayetekaitsie.  
\v 3 Hikɨ tai hepaɨ 'anenetɨ puyuhekɨarixɨ yuxexuime wahetsie.  
\v 4 Yunaitɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ meputihɨnixɨ, meta mepitsutɨa me'utiniutɨ hipame niukiyarikɨ, 'Iyari kemɨtiwapitɨakai memɨtiniunikɨ.   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Kerutsareme mepɨtitekai huriyutsixi Kakaɨyari memayexeiya, yunaime nuiwarite watsata memɨ'ayumiemetetɨkai naitsarie muyuawitɨa.  
\v 6 Kepauka yuariya memu'eni yunaitɨ mepuyuxeɨri, mepɨyuxamuriekai yuxexuitɨ yuniukikɨ memɨwa'eniekaikɨ me'utiniukame.  
\v 7 Mepɨ'iyarixiekai meta mepɨhɨxiyakai mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «¿Neuxei, 'ikɨ yunaitɨ memutiniuka mekatekarereyutari?  
\v 8 ¿Ketɨtɨri 'ikɨ tetewa'enie taxexuitɨ taniukikɨ meputiniuka ketemɨte'ununuiwaxɨ?  
\v 9 Parutiyatari, meriyatari, 'eramitatari, Metsuputamiya kiekatari, Kureyatsie, Kaparutsiyatsie, Punitutsie meta 'Atsiyatsie,  
\v 10 Pɨrikiyatsie, Pamɨpiriyatsie, 'Ekipitutsie, Riwiya 'aurie mukumatsie Tsirene temɨtama, xumatari memɨ'iwatatɨwe,  
\v 11 huriyutsixi, hipatɨ huriyutsixi memayuyeitɨa, kɨretatari, 'arawiyatari, tanaitɨ tepɨwa'enie taniukikɨ memutiniuka, Kakaɨyari kemɨtimariwe mekuxatame».   
\p
\v 12 Yunaitɨ mekani'iyarixiekaitɨni, 'atsimekatemaitɨ ketɨtɨ mɨtiyɨanekai, yuxexuitɨ mɨpaɨ meteyɨkɨhɨawetɨ: «¿Ketɨtɨ 'ikɨ pɨtiyɨane?»  
\v 13 Hipatɨ mewananaimatɨ xeikɨa mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni: «Winu makakakɨ xeikɨa mepuhuxa».   
\s1 Pekuru yumɨireme wahɨxie kemɨtikuxatakai  
\p
\v 14 Hikɨ Pekuru 'anukukeka tamamata heimana xewi wahamatɨa, karima kaniutaniuni, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Neuxei huriyutsixi, yunaitɨ Kerutsareme xemɨtama, xeketenemaika ketɨtɨ mɨtiyɨane, hikɨ xekeneneu'eni kenemɨtayɨni.  
\v 15 'Ikɨ mepɨkatarɨwe xeme xemɨteku'eriwa hepaɨ, matsi puximeri 'akuxi 'etsiwa xeikɨa puxɨka.  
\v 16 'Ikɨtsɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni tita mɨtixatsiwakai, tixaxatame Kuheri ya'utainekaku:   
\q1
\v 17 »Mɨpaɨ paine Kakaɨyari: “Tukari 'aye'ayu kepauka mɨtaparirɨmeni mɨpaɨ pɨtiyɨni,  
\q2 ne'iyari nepɨtatuani teɨteri yunaime wahetsie.  
\q1 Xeniwema 'ukitsi meta 'ukari mepɨtetaxata,  
\q2 meta temari heinɨtsi hepaɨ 'anekame mepɨtexeitsitɨarieni,  
\q2 'ukirawetsixi mepɨteheinɨni.   
\q1
\v 18 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie ne'iyari nepɨtatuani,  
\q2 mɨkɨ nete'uximayatsiriwamete 'ukitsi meta 'ukari wahetsie,  
\q2 mepɨtetaxata nehetsiemieme.   
\q1
\v 19 Nepɨwahɨxiyatsitɨani waheima muyuawitsie meta kwiepa 'inɨari nepɨtiyurieni,  
\q2 xuriyakɨ, taikɨ meta haiwitɨri kɨtsiyarikɨ.   
\q1
\v 20 Tau kaniyɨrimɨkɨ,  
\q2 meta metseri xuriya hepaɨ 'anetɨ kanayeimɨkɨ  
\q1 mexi 'akuxi Ti'aitame kanuaweni,  
\q2 kepauka mariwemekɨ mɨtiyurienitsie.   
\q1
\v 21 Yunaitɨ kemɨ'ane Ti'aitame memahɨawe,  
\q2 mɨkɨ mekanitawikweitsitɨariekuni”.   
\p
\v 22 »'Ixaheri teɨteriyari, 'ikɨ niuki xekene'enieka: Kakaɨyari xetsata pitahekɨataxɨ Ketsutsi natsaretitanaka mariwemekɨ tiyurienetɨ tɨrɨkaɨyemekɨ, wahɨxiyatsitɨatɨ meta 'inɨarikɨ tiyurienetɨ mɨkɨ hetsiemieme, Kakaɨyari kemɨtiuyuri xeme xekatenimaika.  
\v 23 'Ikɨ kaniyetuiyani yamɨraye'anikɨ Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ timaitɨ, matɨaripaitɨ, kaneiyenɨ'ani mɨyetuiyanikɨ, teɨteri 'axateyuruwamete xetewaruta'aitɨaka xekaniwiya, kuruxitsie xe'ikawieka xekanimieni.  
\v 24 Matsi Kakaɨyari kanenukuketɨani, 'ixɨnaka kemɨrehɨiyakai mɨkitɨ, mɨkɨ pɨkayɨwekai mɨkitɨ muyuhayewakɨ.  
\v 25 Rawiri mɨpaɨ paine hepaɨtsitana:  
\q1 »“Ti'aitame yuheyemekɨ nehɨxie nepɨxeiyakai,  
\q2 mɨkɨ netserieta mutiwekɨ  
\q2 ne nepɨkahatiweni.   
\q1
\v 26 'Ayumieme ne'iyari puyutemawie, nenetemawietɨ neputakwika,  
\q2 yaxeikɨata newaiyari 'apuyeikani ta'ikwewatɨ.   
\q1
\v 27 'Ekɨ pepɨkanetsiku'eirieni mɨkite wateukiyapa muyuhayewakɨ,  
\q2 'ekɨ pepɨka'ipitɨani 'iyari mɨpatsie mɨkatiuka'eniwanikɨ.   
\q1
\v 28 Pepɨnetsi'uxeiyatsitɨa huye tukariyari nemexeiyanikɨ,  
\q2 waɨkawa pepɨnetsihetemawieritɨani kepauka 'ahɨxie nemeta'ani”.   
\p
\v 29 »Neuxei 'iwamarixi, 'aixɨa kani'aneni heitseriemekɨ mɨtixekuxaxatɨwanikɨ tatewari Rawiri hepaɨtsita, kaniumɨni meta tiukateukie, makateukietsie mana kaniukani tatsata hikɨ 'akuxi.  
\v 30 Tixaxatame pɨhɨkɨtɨkai meta katinimaikaitɨni kename Kakaɨyari 'ɨyɨhɨritɨa heitseriemekɨ mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ, xewitɨ Rawiri hetsie mɨyeyanikekai heitserie pɨpitɨarienikekai Kɨritsitutɨtɨ, pikayenikekai 'uwenieya mɨra'aitatsie.  
\v 31 Matɨaripaitɨ 'ixeiyatɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni, Kɨritsitu kemɨranukuke tikuxatatɨ, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\q1 »“Tukarieya mɨkitɨ pɨka'uku'eiriwaxɨ,  
\q2 waiyarieya pɨka'utapɨnixɨ”.   
\m
\v 32 Hikɨ Kakaɨyari Ketsutsi panukuketɨa, tame tanaitɨ temunenierixɨ tepɨhɨkɨ.  
\v 33 'Anutiwitɨkieka mariwetɨ patɨa, Kakaɨyari tserieta, kanitanaki'erieni tita 'ukiyarieya mɨtiyetuirienikekai, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata hɨkɨtɨme. Mɨkɨ kaniutatuani hikɨ kexemɨte'ixeiya meta kexemɨte'i'enie.  
\v 34 Rawiri muyuawitsie pɨka'anutitɨa, matsi yaputayɨ:  
\q1 »“Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe neti'aitɨwame:  
\q2 Netserieta kenayexi,   
\q1
\v 35 mɨkɨ memɨmetsi'aye'unie  
\q2 'ahɨxie nekaniwa'atɨamɨkɨ”.   
\p
\v 36 »'Ayumieme heitseriemekɨ mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika yunaitɨ 'Ixaheri xemɨtama, kemɨ'ane xeme kuruxitsie xemukawi, Kakaɨyari Ti'aitame meta Kɨritsitu\f + \fr 2:36 \fq Kɨritsitu \ft panuyɨne \fq Manayexeiyarie.\f* peyeitɨa».   
\p
\v 37 Kepauka 'ikɨ niuki memu'eni yunaitɨ yu'iyaritsie mepuhiweritɨarie, Pekuru meta hipame nɨ'ariekate mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —'Iwamarixi, ¿keri teteyurieka?   
\p
\v 38 Pekuru mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Xeketeneuhayewa 'axakexemɨteyurie, meta yuxexuitɨ xepɨka'ɨyarieni Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu hetsie, tita 'axaxemɨte'uyuri, xemɨteheuyehɨwiyarienikɨ, meta 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata xehexeiyatɨ xepakɨne.  
\v 39 'Ikɨ kemutayɨ xehetsie pɨmieme, xetɨriyama wahetsie meta yunaitɨ teewa kɨkamete, tatsɨari, mɨkɨ yunaitɨ Ti'aitame takakaɨyari mɨwaranayexeiya.   
\p
\v 40 Hipame mɨireme niukikɨ kaniwawawiriekaitɨni mɨpaɨ tiwakɨhɨawetɨ:  
\p —Xekeneyutawikweitsitɨa hikɨ miemete 'axamemɨte'u'iyari watsata.   
\s1 Yuri memɨte'erie memakuteitsie  
\p
\v 41 Hikɨ mɨkɨ niukieya memutanaki'eri mekaniuka'ɨyarieni, mɨkɨ tukaritsie mepɨwarutinɨi teɨteri haika miriyari meyupaɨmetɨ.  
\v 42 Yamepɨ'ayumiemetetɨkai nɨ'ariekate kememɨte'ɨkitakai, meyuxewitɨ meyuparewietɨ paa metitaratɨ meta meyunenewietɨ.  
\v 43 Yunaitɨ yu'iyaritsie meheumamatɨ mekanakɨne, waɨkawa mamariwawemekɨ meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨteyuriekaikɨ nɨ'ariekate.  
\v 44 Yunaitɨ yuri memɨte'erie 'axeikɨa mekanikutekaitɨni yunaitɨ meyuxewitɨ, 'axeikɨa naime mepɨtehexeiyakai:  
\v 45 yukwie meta yupiinite mepɨtetuakai, mepɨtewayetuiriwakai yuxexuitɨ memɨteheuyehɨwa.  
\v 46 Tukarikɨ tukita meyukuxexeɨriwatɨ mepɨkatehayewakai. Paa kii meuti'uta mepɨtekwakai meyutemamawietɨ, meta 'aixɨa mete'u'iyaritɨ,  
\v 47 Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita 'aixɨa meputiyuanekai meta yunaitɨ teɨteri 'aixɨa mepɨteku'eriwakai wahepaɨtsita. Tukarikɨ Ti'aitame waxewiriyatɨ mɨkɨ pɨwaxeɨriekai memɨtawikweitsitɨariwakai.   
\c 3  
\s1 Pekuru tiwawame huriekame 'aixɨa kaniuyurieni  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Pekuru meta Wani tuki manuwe mekanekɨne tau kɨa kawiekaku, nenewieri hurayari 'aye'aku.  
\v 2 'Uki hurietɨ mutinuiwaxɨ mana kani'atɨariwakaitɨni, tukarikɨ tuki kitenie Witsimɨ'ane mɨrakutewatsie mekanitiyetsakaitɨni parewiya mɨwaukakɨ, mana tukita memeutahakekai.  
\v 3 Kepauka Pekuru meta Wani mɨwaruxei tukita meheutahaxɨaximekaku, parewiya pɨwawawiriekai.  
\v 4 Pekuru meta Wani me'ixeiyatɨ, Pekuru mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ketaneuxeiya.   
\p
\v 5 Mɨkɨ kaniwaruxeiya tixaɨ mete'iminike 'erietɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Pekuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Pɨrata meta huru nepɨkahexeiya, matsi ketita nemɨrexeiya, mɨkɨ nepɨmatiyetuirieni. Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu natsaretitanaka hetsɨa nemɨmiemekɨ mɨpaɨ nepaine, kenanukukexi meta kenekuyeikani.   
\p
\v 7 Tserietana mamayatsie tiwiereka kanenukuhana. Yapauka 'ɨkateya meta turuteya kaniutitɨrɨkaxɨani.  
\v 8 'Anukutsunaka kaniutakeni, kuyeikatɨ kanayani. Wahamatɨa kaneutahani tukita 'utitsukwakatɨ 'aixɨa 'utaitɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita.  
\v 9 Kepauka yunaitɨ teɨteri memixei kuyeikame Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita 'aixɨa 'utaineme,  
\v 10 mekaneitimani kename mɨkɨ hɨkɨtɨkai tuki kitenie Witsimɨ'ane mɨrakutewatsie mutiyeixakai parewiya wautɨ, waɨkawa mepɨhɨxiyakai mɨyamemɨtenenierekaikɨ.   
\s1 Pekuru Tsarumuni 'etɨpiwarieyatɨa kemɨtikuxatakai  
\p
\v 11 Hikɨ mɨkɨ tewi Pekuru meta Wani pɨkawatauniekai, yunaitɨ teɨteri me'unautsaxɨaximetɨ mehɨxiyatɨ wahetsɨa mepu'axɨa, Tsarumuni 'Etɨpiwarieya meukuwewiya hetɨa.  
\v 12 Pekuru waruxeiyaka mɨpaɨ teɨteri katiniwarutahɨawe: «'Ixaheri teɨteriyari, ¿titayari xetehɨxiya mɨyamɨtiuyɨkɨ? ¿titayari xetatexeiya mɨpaɨ xeteku'eriwatɨ, tatɨrɨkariyakɨ temɨte'uyurieni hepaɨ 'ikɨ tewi 'uyeiweme temayeitɨakɨ?  
\v 13 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki meta Kakuwu tatutsima wakakaɨyari, mariweme yuniwe Ketsutsi mayeitɨa. Xeme xepiyetua meta xepitixani'eri Piratu hɨxie kepauka mɨkɨ mixɨnakekai.  
\v 14 Xeme Mɨpatsie meta Heitserie mexeiya xeputixani'eri, xepitawawiri tiyumemiwame pɨta mɨxɨnarienikɨ.  
\v 15 Tukari tiyupitɨwame xepumi, matsi Kakaɨyari kanenukuketɨani mɨkite watsata, mɨkɨkɨ tame temunenierixɨ tepɨhɨkɨ.  
\v 16 Yuri mɨtiuta'erikɨ Ketsutsi hetsie, mɨkɨ 'ayumieme pitatseiriyaxɨ 'ikɨ xemɨxeiya meta xemimate. 'Ikɨ tewi yuri kemɨti'erie Ketsutsi 'iparewiekaku, mɨpaɨ naime 'aixɨa reu'eriekame kaneyeitɨani yunaime xehɨxie.   
\p
\v 17 »Hikɨ ne'iwama, ne nepɨtimate xeme meta te'aitamete memanuyetei mɨpaɨ xepɨte'uyuri 'atsixekatemaitɨ.  
\v 18 Kakaɨyari meripaitɨ mɨpaɨ putayɨkai yunaitɨ Kakaɨyari niukametemama mɨpaɨ me'utiyuanekaku: kename Kɨritsitu\f + \fr 3:18 \fq Kɨritsitu \ft panuyɨne \fq Manayexeiyarie.\f* tikwinekekai, mɨpaɨ katinaye'atɨarieni.  
\v 19 'Ayumieme xeketeneuhayewa kexemɨteyurie, ta'aurie xekenaxɨrieka manuyeitɨarienikɨ tita 'axaxemɨte'uyuri, xehetsɨa 'uxipiya maye'anikɨ Ti'aitame hetsɨa mieme,  
\v 20 menɨ'anikɨ mɨkɨ Kɨritsitu kemɨ'ane xehetsiemieme mukayerie, Ketsutsi heitserie mupitɨarie.  
\v 21 Peuyewetse mɨtanaki'eriwa, taheima mexi tukari ka'aye'awe kepauka 'aixɨa mɨtiyurieni naime, kememɨtekuxatakai Kakaɨyari niukametemama hetsiena mieme memupatsie meripaitɨ miemete yame'utiyuanekaku.  
\v 22 Muitsexi yurikɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: “Ti'aitame xekakaɨyari tixexaxatɨwame payeitɨani xeime xe'iwama watsata mieme nehepaɨ 'anekame. Xeme xepi'enieka naime kemɨtixetaxatɨani.  
\v 23 Kemɨ'ane mɨkɨ tixaxatame mɨka'enieka, yuteɨterima watsata kanikumaweriyariemɨkɨ”.   
\p
\v 24 »Kamɨtsɨ yunaitɨ texaxatamete, Tsamueri pɨtiukatsutɨa meri, 'arike yunaitɨ memɨtekuxatakai, 'ikɨ tukari hepaɨtsita mekatenihekɨatakaitɨni.  
\v 25 Xeme texaxatamete xepɨwaniwema, xehetsie katiniunake mɨkɨ tɨratu Kakaɨyari mitawewi xetutsima wahamatɨa, Kakaɨyari 'Apɨrahami mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: “Kemɨ'ane 'ahetsie mɨyeyani 'aixɨa mepɨ'itɨarieka yunaitɨ nuiwarite kwiepa memɨtama”.  
\v 26 Kepauka, Kakaɨyari yuniwe 'anukuketɨaka, xehetsɨa meri kaneinɨ'ani 'aixɨa mɨxeyurienikɨ, yuxexuitɨ ta'aurie xemaxɨrienikɨ tita 'axaxemɨteyurie xeteku'eirieme».   
\c 4  
\s1 Pekuru meta Wani 'itsɨkate wahɨxie kememɨte'utahɨawarie  
\p
\v 1 Mexi'akuxi Pekuru meta Wani teɨteri metewakuxaxatɨwakai, yapauka mawari wewiwamete wahetsɨa mekaniu'axɨani, tuki mɨhɨritɨarie meta Tsarutseutsixi wahamatɨa.  
\v 2 Waɨkawa mepɨha'akai teɨteri memɨtewa'ɨkitɨakaikɨ, memɨtewakuxaxatɨwakaikɨ kemɨranukuketɨarie mɨkite watsata, me'utiyuatɨ Ketsutsi mexatatɨ.  
\v 3 Pekuru meta Wani meputiwiyarie mɨkɨyɨrirɨmekaikɨri, mepɨwaranutaxɨri muwa me'ayetetɨ mepukatariyarie.  
\v 4 Yumɨiretɨ niuki memu'eni yuri mepɨte'uta'eri, 'ukitsi xeikɨa me'inɨaritɨ 'auxɨwime miriyari mepɨhɨkɨtɨkai.   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ 'uxa'arieka Kerutsaremetsie mepɨyukuxeɨri wa'ukiyarima, 'ukirawetsixi meta 'inɨari niukiyarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai.  
\v 6 Mana 'Anatsi mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame meta Kaipatsi, Wani, 'Arekanituru meta yunaitɨ 'iwamama.  
\v 7 Mana yuhixɨapa mewati'uitɨaka mekaniwaku'iwawiyakaitɨni mɨpaɨ mekateniwaku'iwawiyakaitɨni:  
\p —¿Ke'anekame tɨrɨkariya xehexeiyatɨ, kemɨ'ane hetsɨa xemiemetɨtɨ mɨya xepɨteyurie xeme?   
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ Pekuru 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ hɨnetɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei teɨteri wa'ukiyarima meta 'ukirawetsixi:  
\v 9 Hikɨ xemɨtatsiku'iwawiya 'aixɨa temiyurikɨ tewi huriekame, mɨkɨ 'aixɨareu'erietɨ matɨakɨ.  
\v 10 Mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika yunaitɨ xeme meta yunaitɨ 'Ixaheri teɨteriyari yameketemaika Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu natsaretitanaka hetsɨa mɨmiemekɨ, mɨkɨtsie tiwiyatɨ 'ena puwe xehɨxie 'aixɨa reu'erietɨ, xeme kuruxitsie xemikawi Ketsutsi, peru Kakaɨyari nenukuketɨani mɨkite watsata.  
\v 11 'Ikɨ Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu kanihɨkɨtɨni:  
\q1 »“Xeme kii wewiwamete tete xemutixani'eri,  
\q2 matsi mɨkɨ tete 'itsikina mieme kanayani”.   
\m
\v 12 Nixewitɨ tawarita 'apɨka'uyeika tatsitawikweitsitɨanike. Xewitɨ mumawekɨ muyuawitɨa tame teɨteri tatsata kɨmana temɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ, mɨkɨ xeikɨa pukayerie».   
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ wa'ukiyarima mewaxeiyatɨ kememɨtekuxatakai Pekuru meta Wani mekamamakame, mɨpaɨ metehetimaika hatsuaku memɨkateyɨ'ɨkitɨakaikɨ meta tixaɨtɨ memɨkatehɨmetɨkaikɨ, mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni, mekaniwaretimani Ketsutsi hamatɨa memu'u'uwakaikɨ.  
\v 14 Me'ixeiyatɨ mɨkɨ tewi 'aixɨamu'itɨariekai wa'aurie 'uweme, mepɨkayɨwawekairi memɨwaniukimakakɨ.  
\v 15 Hikɨ mekaniwarutanɨ'ani memanuyekɨnekɨ 'itsɨkate wahɨxie, mɨkɨ mekaniuyu'enieni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\v 16 «¿Keteteyurieni 'ikɨ teɨteri wahepaɨtsita? Yurikɨ wakɨmana 'inɨari pɨreyɨ, yunaitɨ kememɨtemate, kemɨtimatsiɨkɨ yunaitɨ Kerutsareme memɨtama wahɨxie. Tame tepɨkayɨwawe tema'imawani.  
\v 17 Matsi tawariri mukakuxaxatsiwanikɨ teɨteri watsata, kɨmɨ tepɨwata'imaiya mɨkɨ hepaɨtsita xeime memɨkatekuxaxatɨwanikɨ».   
\p
\v 18 Yuhetsɨa mewarutakwewieka mɨpaɨ mekateniwaruta'imaiya memɨkatekuxatanikɨri meta memɨkate'ɨkitanikɨ Ketsutsi hetsiemieme.  
\v 19 Peru Pekuru meta Wani mɨpaɨ mekateniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —¿'Aixɨa ti'ane Kakaɨyari hɨxie xeme pɨta temɨxe'enieka mɨkɨ teka'enietɨ? Xekeneutimaixɨa kemɨ'ane heitserie mexeiya.  
\v 20 Tame tepɨkayɨwawe temɨtehayewa tetekuxatatɨ tita temɨte'uxei meta tita temɨte'u'eni hepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 21 Mɨkɨ tawarita yametewaruta'imaiyaku mekaniwarutatuani memɨyehukɨ. Teɨteri wahetsie tixaɨtɨ mepɨkate'ukaxei memɨwa'uximatɨakakɨ, yunaitɨ 'aixɨa Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita memutiyuanekaikɨ mete'utamarieka kemɨtiuyɨ.  
\v 22 Mɨkɨ tewi huta tewiyari heimana yapaɨmeme wiyari pexeiyakai 'inɨarikɨ 'aixɨa mu'itɨarie.   
\s1 Yuri memɨte'erie kememɨteyunenewiekai  
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ Pekuru meta Wani me'utatuiyaka yuteɨterima wahetsɨa mekaniu'axɨani, mekateniwarutaxatɨani naime kememɨtewarekɨhɨawekai mawari wewiwametekɨ memɨhɨritɨarie meta 'ukirawetsixi.  
\v 24 Kepauka mewaru'enieka 'axeikɨa meyuxewitɨ Kakaɨyari nenewieri mekaniupitɨani: «Ti'aitame Naitsarie pemɨti'aita, muyuawi meta kwie pemutawewi, haramara meta naime wahetsie mɨtixuawe,  
\v 25 'ekɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata hekɨ, Rawiri tatutsi mɨpaɨ petitaxatɨaku, ti'a'uximayatsiriwame mɨpaɨ putayɨ:  
\q1 »“¿Titayari nuiwarite meteyuti'ɨre,  
\q2 meta titayari teɨteri yakɨ xeikɨa metekuxata?   
\q1
\v 26 Kwiepa te'aitamete mekaneye'unieka,  
\q2 meta kuwexinaruritsixi  
\q1 Ti'aitame mepɨkaha'eriwa,  
\q2 meta kemɨ'ane manayexeiyarie mepɨkaha'eriwa”.   
\m
\v 27 Yurikɨ 'ikɨ kiekaritsie mekaniyukuxeurieni Herurexi meta Punitsiyu Piratu, teɨteri memɨkahuriyutsixiri meta 'Ixaheri teɨteriyari, 'aniwe mɨpatsie 'ahetsiemieme Ketsutsi me'aye'unietɨ, kemɨ'ane pemanayexei,  
\v 28 mekaniyukuxeɨrieni yameteyurienike tita pemɨtiyurienikekai meripaitɨ yapɨtiyɨnikekai.  
\v 29 Hikɨ Ti'aitame keniwaru'eni 'axakememutiyuane, ketaneparewieka tame te'a'uximayatsiriwamete tixaɨtɨ tekateheumakatɨ 'aniuki temukuxatanikɨ.  
\v 30 'Ayumieme 'ekɨta 'amamakɨ keniwaparewieka teɨteri memanayexɨriyanikɨ meta 'inɨarikɨ mamariwaweme petiyurienetɨ 'aniwe Ketsutsi mɨpatsie hetsiemieme».   
\p
\v 31 Hikɨ me'uyutanenewieku mana memayuxeɨrietsie kaniutayuani, yunaitɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ mekaniutihɨne, Kakaɨyari niukieya mekanikuxatakaitɨni tixaɨtɨ mekateheumakatɨ.   
\s1 Yuri memɨte'erie yupiinitekɨ kememɨteyuparewiekai  
\p
\v 32 Yunaitɨ yuri memɨte'erie xei'iyariyari mekanexeiyakaitɨni meta yaxeikɨa mepɨteku'eriwakai. Nixewitɨ piinitɨarika yupiini pɨkarayeitɨwakai, matsi 'axeikɨa naime mekatenexeiyakaitɨni.  
\v 33 Nɨ'ariekate tɨrɨkaɨyemekɨ mekatenihekɨatakaitɨni Ti'aitame Ketsutsi kemɨranukuke hepaɨtsita. Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa katiniyuriekaitɨni yunaime mɨkɨ wahetsie,  
\v 34 xewitɨ reuyehɨatɨ mana pɨka'ukatei. Kemɨ'ane kwie meta kii, memexeiyakai mekanikutuayakaitɨni, kememɨte'ituani tuminiyari mekani'atɨwakaitɨni,  
\v 35 nɨ'ariekate wahetɨa mekanitimanakaitɨni, mɨkɨ yuxexuime kememɨteheuyehɨwa memɨtewayetuiriwanikɨ.   
\p
\v 36 Hikɨ Kutse, rewi tewiyari pɨhɨkɨtɨkai, Tsipɨretsie kiekame, nɨ'ariekate Werunawe mekateniterɨwa (taniukikɨ Tiyɨnɨtɨwame panuyɨne),  
\v 37 mɨkɨ kwie mexeiyakai kaneituani, tuminiyari nɨ'ariekate wahetsɨa kani'atɨani.   
\c 5  
\s1 'Ananiyaxi meta Tsapira 'axakememɨte'uyuri  
\p
\v 1 Xewitɨta tewi 'Ananiyaxi titewatɨ yɨ'ɨitatɨ Tsapira hamatɨa yukwie mekaniutuani,  
\v 2 'ɨyayata yatimaikaku, 'etsiwa kaniyuhayewieni kemɨreituakai, yapaɨmeme xeikɨa, nɨ'ariekate wahetsɨa kani'atɨani.   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ Pekuru mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei, 'Ananiyaxi, ¿titayari kauyumarie 'a'iyari tinɨ'ɨ, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata pemɨtiu'itaikɨ, yapaɨmeme pemauku'ɨikɨ kwie pemetua hetsiemieme?  
\v 4 Kepauka mɨ'akwietɨkai katini'apiinitɨkaitɨni. Peheituaka 'akuxi heitserie pepexeiyakai hepaɨtsitana. ¿Ketitayari 'a'iyaritsie mɨyapetiu'ahɨawixɨ? 'Ekɨ teɨteri pepɨkatiwaru'itai, matsi pɨta Kakaɨyari pekatiniu'itaiya.   
\p
\v 5 'Ikɨ niuki 'u'enieka, 'Ananiyaxi 'atiweka pumɨ. Mepɨmamakai yemekɨ yunaitɨ me'u'enanaka.  
\v 6 Hikɨ temari me'anuku'uka hipatɨ me'iku'eimaka mekaneikweni me'ikateukuke.   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ haika hurayari 'aye'aku 'ɨyaya kaninuani 'atsikatimaitɨ kemɨtiuyɨkai.   
\p
\v 8 Pekuru mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Yakenetineutahɨawi, yukwie mɨyapaɨmemekɨ xeikɨa xetehetua?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Huu, mɨpaɨ kanipaɨmekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 9 Pekuru mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —¿Titayari xeteyu'eni xemita'inɨatakɨ Ti'aitame 'Iyarieya? Neuxei 'akɨna teukumete mana kitenie mekaniuti'uka, 'ekɨta mekamenanukweikuni.   
\p
\v 10 Yapauka mɨkɨ kanatiweni Pekuru hɨxie kaniumɨni. Hikɨ temari meheutahaxɨaka mɨkime mekaniutaxeiya. Meheikweka kɨnaya 'aurie mekaneikateuku.  
\v 11 Waɨkawa mepɨmamakai mana memɨyutixexeɨriwakai, yunaitɨ metehetimaika 'ikɨ kemɨtiuyɨ.   
\s1 Nɨ'ariekate 'inɨari mariwemekɨ kememɨte'uyuri  
\p
\v 12 Nɨ'ariekate wamamakɨ waɨkawa 'inɨarikɨ meta mamariwaweme katiniuyɨni teɨteri wahɨxie, yunaitɨ yurimemɨte'erie 'axeikɨa mekaniu'uwakaitɨni Tsarumuni 'Etɨpiwarieya meukuwewiya hetɨa.  
\v 13 Hipatɨ teɨteri mewamakatɨ wahamatɨa mepɨka'u'uwakai, tsepatɨtɨ yemekɨ 'aixɨa memutiyuanekai wahepaɨtsita.  
\v 14 Yumɨiretɨ mepakɨnirɨmekai yuri memɨte'uta'eriwakaikɨ Ti'aitame hetsie.  
\v 15 Mepɨyuwaɨkawakairi 'ukitsi meta 'ukarawetsixi yaxeikɨata tekwikwikate huyeta meputuarieximekai 'utatsie meta 'itsitsie me'aheitɨ, Pekuru tsikeretsɨ 'etɨrieya mana wahetsie tiunakeke.  
\v 16 Yumɨiretɨta Kerutsareme 'aurie kiekatari tekwikwikate mekaniwa'atɨwakaitɨni, meta kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene memɨwa'uximatɨakai, yunaitɨ 'aixɨa meteheu'erietɨ mepakɨ.   
\s1 Pekuru meta Wani kememɨte'utaweiyarie  
\p
\v 17 Hikɨ mawari wewiwame tiwa'aitɨwame meta mana memɨhɨritɨarie me'anuku'uka, yunaitɨ mɨkɨ memɨtsarutseutsixitɨkai, mekaniwaruti'uxiwe'erieni.  
\v 18 Hikɨ nɨ'ariekate mekaniutiwiyarieni, katsariyanata mepɨwaranutaxɨri.  
\v 19 Matsi tɨkarikɨ niuki tuayame Yawe hetsɨa mieme katsariyanata pɨreuyepiexɨa, pɨwaranuyewitɨ.  
\v 20 Mɨpaɨ tiwakɨhɨawetɨ: «Xekenehu, tuki manuwe muwa xeketeniwakuxaxatɨwani teɨteri naime tewi tukari kemɨrexeiyani hepaɨtsita».   
\p
\v 21 Mɨkɨ me'u'enanaka kememɨte'utahɨawarie, tukita ximeripaɨtɨ mekaneutahaxɨani, muwa mekateni'ɨkitakaitɨni.  
\p Kepauka mawari wewiwame tiwa'aitɨwame meta mana memɨhɨritɨarie, meta wahamatɨa memu'uwakai me'u'axɨaka, 'itsɨkate yunaime 'Ixaheri xiɨyarimama 'ukirawetsixi mekaniwarutaxatɨani. Tupiritsixi mekaniwarutanɨ'ani katsariyanata paitɨ memɨwahapayukɨ.  
\v 22 Tupiritsixi me'u'axɨaka mepɨkawarutaxei katsariyanata. Yu'utɨa me'akunuaxɨaka, mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutaxatɨani:  
\v 23 «Neuxei katsariyana tepetaxei 'aixɨa rekunakame, tehɨwemete kitenie mepeti'ukai, perutsɨ teteheuyepieka nixeime tepɨkahetaxei kiita».   
\p
\v 24 Tupiritsixi tiwa'aitɨwame tukita tihɨweme, meta mawari wewiwamete tewa'atɨwamete me'u'enanaka mekaniuhɨxiyani, 'atsimepɨkatemaikai wahepaɨtsita kemɨtiuyɨ.  
\v 25 'Ana xewitɨ nuaka katiniwarutahekɨatɨani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «Neuxei mɨkɨ 'ukitsi xemɨwaranutaxɨri, mɨkɨ tuki kuraruyarita mepɨtehekuxata teɨteri meteware'ɨkitɨatɨ».   
\p
\v 26 Hikɨ tehɨwemete tiwa'aitɨwame kaneyani meta 'iparewiwametemama, hau'erietɨ mekawarahapatɨ mekaniwa'atɨani, teɨteri memɨwamakarɨkaikɨ tetekɨ mewarutituaxakɨ.  
\v 27 Hikɨ mewa'atɨaka 'itsɨkate wahɨxie mekaniwati'uitɨani, mawari wewiwame mɨhɨritɨarie  
\v 28 mɨpaɨ katiniwarutatieni:  
\p —Tame tamɨ tepɨtexe'uta'imaiyakai xemɨkate'ɨkitanikɨ mɨkɨ kemɨtitewa hetsiemieme. Matsi pɨta, xeme Kerutsareme yɨ'ɨkitɨarikakɨ xepɨte'utihɨniyaxɨ, xeme tahetsie xepɨte'ahɨpa mɨkɨ tewi xuriyayakɨ.   
\p
\v 29 Pekuru meta nɨ'ariekate mɨpaɨ mekateniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Peuyewetse matsi Kakaɨyari temɨ'eniekakɨ, keyuri teɨteri memɨtate'aitɨakakɨ.  
\v 30 Tatutsima wakakaɨyari Ketsutsi kananukuketɨani, xeme xekanimieni kɨyetsie xe'ikuwieka.  
\v 31 Kakaɨyari yɨtɨrɨkariyakɨ kanenutiwitɨni yutserieta kaneyeni Ti'aitame meta Tiyuwikweitsitɨwame, mɨxepitɨanikɨ 'ixaheritsixi xemɨtehayewanikɨ kexemɨteyurie, xemɨteheuyehɨwiyarienikɨ.  
\v 32 Tame tekanihɨkɨtɨni temunenierixɨ temɨtehekɨata 'ikɨ kemɨtiuyɨ hepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨta katinihekɨatani 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata Kakaɨyari mɨwarupitɨa mɨkɨ memi'enie.   
\p
\v 33 Mɨkɨ me'u'enanaka mekaniuyeha'ani mekaniwakwikukaitɨni.  
\v 34 Peru xewitɨ 'anukukeka memayuxeɨrietsie paritseu mɨhɨkɨtɨkai, Kamarieri mɨtitewakai, 'inɨari niukiyarikɨ ti'ɨkitame mɨhɨkɨtɨkai, mariweme memɨ'eriekai yunaitɨ teɨteri, katiniuta'aita memɨwaranuyenɨ'anikɨ takwa paitɨ mɨkɨ teɨteri,  
\v 35 mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Neuxei 'ixaheritsixi, yumarima 'aixɨa kexemɨteyurieni 'ikɨ teɨteri wahepaɨtsita.  
\v 36 Meripaitɨ panukuke Teuraxi, ya'utaitɨ kename yɨwemetɨkai, nauka tsienituyari 'ukitsi yakɨtɨtɨ hetsiena mekateniwiyakaitɨni. Peru mɨkɨ pumierie, yunaitɨ memi'eniekai mepeutaxɨriexɨa, tixaɨ mepɨkate'akɨ.  
\v 37 'Arikeketa kananukukeni Kura karereyatanaka kepauka memaka'utsie, teɨteri yumɨireme kaniwarewitɨni yu'utɨma. Mɨkɨta pumierie, yunaitɨ memi'eniekai mepeutayeixɨa.  
\v 38 Hikɨri mɨpaɨ nepaine, xekeniwaruhayewa 'ikɨ teɨteri, xekeniwarutixɨna. Kememɨteku'eriwa meta kememɨteyurie xɨka teɨteri wahetsɨa miemetɨni mekatenihayewakeyu.  
\v 39 Mexɨka Kakaɨyari hetsɨa miemetɨni, xepɨkayɨwawe xemɨwata'imaiya, tietɨtsɨ Kakaɨyari xe'aye'unieka».  
\p Merikɨtsɨ mekani'enieni.  
\v 40 Yuhetsɨa mewarutahɨaweka nɨ'ariekate mewarutiwaka mɨpaɨ mekateniwaruta'aitɨani memɨkatiniunikɨ Ketsutsi hetsɨa memiemetetɨtɨ. Mekaniwarutixɨna.  
\v 41 'Itsɨkate wahetsɨa mekaniwayenexɨani meyutemamawietɨ, Kakaɨyari meyɨwaweme mɨwa'eriekaikɨ memɨtawe'eriwanikɨ hetsɨana memɨmiemetetɨkaikɨ.  
\v 42 Tukarikɨ tukita yukiiteta mepɨkatehayewakai mete'ɨkitatɨ metekuxatatɨ niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne kename Ketsutsi heitserie hexeiya Kɨritsitutɨtɨ me'utiyuatɨ.   
\c 6  
\s1 'Atahuta teparewiwamete kememɨte'anayexeiyarie  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'ana mepɨtetamɨiriyarɨmekai teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete. Mɨkɨ kɨriyekutsixi waniukikɨ memutiniukakai mepɨniukixiekai mɨkɨ hepɨrayutsixi waniukikɨ memutiniukakai wahepaɨtsita, wiuratsixi wahetsɨa miemete memɨwaratɨmaiyakaikɨ tukarikɨ kepauka memɨwaparewiekai.  
\v 2 Tamamata heimana yuhutatɨ mewarukuxeɨrieka teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe: «'Aixɨa pɨka'anenikeyu tame Kakaɨyari niukieya xɨka tehayewake mexatsie xeikɨa temɨte'apinenikɨ.  
\v 3 Hikɨ ta'iwama, xekeniwakuwawa yutsata 'ukitsi 'atahutame 'aixɨa memɨtehekɨatsie 'Iyarikɨ memɨhɨpɨne memɨtemaiwawe, mɨkɨ tepɨwahɨritɨani 'ikɨ hepaɨtsita kemɨreuyewetse.  
\v 4 Tametsɨ tetanenewietɨ niukikɨ texeparewietɨ tepɨ'ayumiemetetɨni».   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ 'ikɨ niuki pɨwarunakixɨ yunaitɨ memɨyuxeɨriekai. Mepɨwaranuyexei 'Etsitewani, 'uki yuri mɨti'eriekai 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ mɨhɨnekai, Peripe, Purukuru, Nikanuxi, Timuni, Parumenaxi, Nikuraxi huriyu mayuyeitɨa 'Anutiyukiya kiekame.  
\v 6 Nɨ'ariekate wahɨxie mekaniwati'uitɨani, mɨkɨ meyunenewietɨ yamekateniwaruhɨritɨani waheima me'utimetɨ.   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ Kakaɨyari niukieya kanikuxaxatsiwakaitɨni: Teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mepɨtetimɨiriyarɨmekai waɨkawa Kerutsaremetsie meta mawari wewiwamete yumɨiretɨ me'u'enanaka yuri mekateniuta'erieni.   
\s1 'Etsitewani kemɨtiuwiyarie  
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ 'Etsitewani 'aixɨa tiuka'iyaritɨ tɨrɨkaɨyemekɨ tiyurienetɨ waɨkawa katiniyurienekaitɨni teɨteri watsata, 'inɨari mamariwaweme tiyurienetɨ.  
\v 9 Hikɨ tuki 'epuwekai Xɨnariekate titewatɨ, mɨkɨ tsirenetari, 'arekanitɨriya kiekatari, Tsiritsiya meta 'Atsiya miemete hamatɨa mepanuku'ui mehe'iwarɨmetɨ niuki mexɨatɨatɨ 'Etsitewani matɨa.  
\v 10 Mepitexiekai kemɨtikuxatakai mɨtimaiwekaikɨ, 'Iyari miparewiekaikɨ.  
\v 11 Mepɨtewa'aitɨakai hipame teɨteri memɨtekuxatanikɨ 'itarikakɨ: «Tame tepi'enie 'axa'utaineme Muitsexi hepaɨtsita Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita».   
\p
\v 12 Mepɨwaxamuriekai teɨteri, 'ukirawetsixi, mɨkɨ 'inɨari niukiyarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitakai. Yapauka me'u'axɨaka mekaniwiya, mekaneiwitɨni 'itsɨkate wahetsɨa.  
\v 13 Mana mepɨwaruti'uitɨa hipame memɨtehekɨatanikɨ mete'itawatɨ yame'utiyuatɨ: «'Ikɨ tewi pɨkatihayewa 'axa'utaitɨ 'ikɨ 'ena Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme mɨpatsie hepaɨtsita, ta'inɨari niukiyari hepaɨtsita.  
\v 14 Tepi'enie mɨpaɨ 'utaineme kename 'ikɨ Ketsutsi natsaretitanaka 'ikɨ tuki ka'una, kename 'ipata tayeiyari Muitsexi mɨtatsi'upitɨa».   
\p
\v 15 Me'i'ixɨarietɨ yunaitɨ mana memɨtitekai memayuxeɨrietsie, mekanixeiya nierikaya taheima mieme niuki tuayame nierikaya hepaɨ 'anekame.   
\c 7  
\s1 'Etsitewani yuhetsiemieme kemɨtiutaniu  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Mɨpaɨ ti'ane 'ikɨ?   
\p
\v 2 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Neuxei 'iwamarixi meta ne'ukiyarima, xekeneu'enana. Tatutsi 'Apɨrahami 'ixeiyakaku Kakaɨyari witsimɨ'ane matsiɨkɨtɨ kanayuyeitɨani Metsuputamiya 'akuxi 'uyeikakaku Haranitsie kaheyeiwekaku,  
\v 3 Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Keneuku'eiri 'akwie, 'amarema meta 'apaapa kie, kenemie kemɨ'ane kwie nemɨmetsixeitsitɨanitsie”.   
\p
\v 4 »Hikɨ Kariteyutsixi wakwietsie heyeyaka Haranitsie kaniutayerɨni. Manata paapaya 'umɨku Kakaɨyari nipata 'ikɨ kwiepa hakewa xeme'uwa hikɨ.  
\v 5 Kakaɨyari pɨka'imi 'ena mɨtinakeni niyɨ'ɨkakɨ mɨkatakenikɨ, matsi Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe kename 'ipitɨanikekai mɨkɨ, piinieya mɨrayanikɨ, 'arike hetsiena memɨyekɨnekekaita wapiini mɨrayanikɨ, tsepa yuniwe mɨkahexeiyakai 'akuxi.  
\v 6 Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “'Anuiwarima xeime kwieyaritsie mepɨtiteni yapaɨmexɨa, mana waɨriyarika mepɨteta'aitɨarieka meta 'aixɨa mekatexeiyarietɨ, nauka tsienituyari wiyari mepuyurieni.  
\v 7 Nekaniwataxanetamɨkɨ 'iya nuiwari waɨriyarika mepɨtewata'uximayatsitɨani. 'Arikemɨkake mekanayekɨnikuni, ne'uximayatsika mekanexeiyakakuni 'ena”.  
\v 8 Xitekiya 'inɨariyari 'ipitɨatɨ kanitawewirieni tɨratu. Hikɨ kepauka 'Apɨrahami 'Itsahaki memayexei, 'atahairieka tukaritsie pi'inɨaritaxɨ 'ixitetɨ, 'Itsahaki meta Kakuwu pu'inɨaritɨa, Kakuwu meta mɨpaɨ tiwaruyuri tamamata heimana yuhutame tatewarima.   
\p
\v 9 »Mɨkɨ tatewarima me'ita'uxieka Kutse mekaniutuani 'Ekipitutsie manuwitɨkienikɨ, peru Kakaɨyari hamatɨana puyeikakai.  
\v 10 Nitawikweitsitɨani naime kemɨti'uximatɨariekai, pipitɨa 'aixɨa mɨtixeiyarienikɨ mɨtimaiwenikɨ Parahuni hɨxie 'ekipitutari mɨtiwa'aitɨwametɨkai hɨxie. Mɨkɨri 'itsɨkame kaneyeitɨani Kutse 'Ekipitu kwieyari hepaɨtsita naime yukiita mieme hepaɨtsita 'ihɨritɨatɨ.   
\p
\v 11 »Hikɨ pɨhakaxatɨkai naitsarie 'Ekipitutsie Kananitsie, me'uximatɨarieximekaku waɨkawa. 'Ikwai mepɨka'ukaxexeiyakai tatewarima.  
\v 12 'U'enaka Kakuwu kename 'ikwai hexuawekai tɨriku 'Ekipitutsie, kaniwarenɨ'ani tatewarima heiwa.  
\v 13 Hutarieka me'u'axɨaku Kutse puyuhekɨataxɨ yu'iwama wahɨxie. Meta Parahuni kaniwaretimani Kutse maremama.  
\v 14 Kutse tiutanɨ'aka kaniwaruta'inieni yupaapa Kakuwu yunaime yumarema haika tewiyari heimana tamamata heimana 'auxɨwi meyupaɨmeme teɨteri.  
\v 15 Mɨkɨ Kakuwu kaneyani 'Ekipitutsie, mana kanemɨni, tatewarima manata mekanekwini.  
\v 16 Mana Tsikenitsie paitɨ mepewitɨkie, mepukateukiexɨa teukiyapa 'Apɨrahami minanai pɨrata tuminiyarikɨ 'Emuri niwemama tsikenitari me'ituirieku.   
\p
\v 17 »Hikɨ 'ayehurakaku mɨkɨ tukari maye'atɨarienikɨ tita Kakaɨyari yɨhɨritɨatɨ 'Apɨrahami mɨtiutahɨawixɨ kemɨtiyɨnikekai, mɨkɨ teɨteri mepɨtetimɨiriyarɨmekai 'Ekipitutsie.  
\v 18 'Anari panukuke xewitɨ 'ekipitutari tiwa'aitɨwametɨtɨ, mɨkɨ pɨka'imaikai Kutse.  
\v 19 Mɨkɨ kwiepa ti'aitame tateɨterima pɨtiwa'itaiyakai. Waɨriyarika pɨwarupitɨa tatutsima 'ɨtsita memɨwareku'eirienikɨ tɨɨri memutinunuiwaxɨ, memɨkwinikɨ.   
\p
\v 20 »Hikɨ 'ana Muitsexi kaniutinuiwa. Witsipɨ'anekai nunutsi Kakaɨyari hɨxie, mɨkɨ haika metseri puwerekai yupaapa kie.  
\v 21 Kepauka muku'eiriwaxɨ, ti'aitame Parahuni niweya kanitaxeiya, munu'ayatɨni hepaɨ pɨtiweriyaxɨ.  
\v 22 Pɨtiuti'ɨkitɨarie Muitsexi naime kememɨtemaiwawekai 'ekipitutari. Kemɨtixata yapɨtiyurienekai pɨyɨwemetɨkai.   
\p
\v 23 »Hikɨ huta tewiyari wiyari hexeiyatɨ puyuwaɨri mɨwa'iwatamiekɨ yu'iwama 'ixaheritsixi.  
\v 24 Xeime 'uxeiyaka mierieneme, heimana kaniutanuani, 'aixɨa pɨtiuyuri hetsiena mieme, 'ekipitutanaka kaniumieni.  
\v 25 Mɨpaɨ katiniku'eriwakaitɨni kename 'iwamama metemaikakekai Kakaɨyari kemɨtiwatawikweitsitɨanikekai 'iya waparewiekaku, mɨkɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ mepɨkatemaikai.  
\v 26 Hikɨ 'uxa'ariekata kaniwaruxeiya meyukwitɨweme yuhutame 'ixaheritsixi. Niwanɨtɨamɨkɨkaitɨni 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiyanikɨ mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “Neuxei, xeme xekaniyu'iwamaka. ¿Titayari 'axaxeteyuyurie?”   
\p
\v 27 »Kemɨ'ane yu'iwa 'axamɨyurienekai Muitsexi petaimaxɨ mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “¿Kemɨ'anekuta 'ekɨ metsi'utahɨawixɨ 'itsɨkamekɨ tahetsie pemɨti'aitanikɨ?  
\v 28 Kaukatsɨta ne penetsimiemɨtɨ pe'utaine, takai 'ekipitutanaka pemɨtiumi hepaɨ”.  
\v 29 Hikɨ 'i'enieka mɨkɨ niuki Muitsexi kaniyuta'una. Kuyeikame kanayani Mariyani kwieyaritsie. Mana mekaniutinunuiwa niwemama yuhutatɨ.   
\p
\v 30 »Hikɨ huta tewiyari wiyari 'aye'aku, makumawetsie kanixeiya niuki tuayame taipa 'uweme tupiriya matitatawekaitsie yemuri 'aurie Tsinahi mɨrakutewatsie.  
\v 31 Mɨkɨ Muitsexi 'ixeiyaka heinɨtsika hepaɨ 'anekame kanihɨxiyakaitɨni. 'Ahurawa 'ayaku mɨretimanikɨ kemɨtiyɨanekai, Ti'aitame putaniu mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\v 32 “Ne 'atutsima nekaniwakakaɨyaritɨni, 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki meta Kakuwu”. Mɨkɨ Muitsexi 'uyɨyɨakatɨ pɨkayuwaɨriyakai mɨnierenikɨ.   
\p
\v 33 »Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “'Akakai kenanuyexɨnaxɨa 'a'ɨkatetsie, mana pemanuwe kwiepa kanakupatsieka.  
\v 34 Yemekɨ nekaniwaxeiyani neteɨterima kememɨte'uximatɨarie 'Ekipitutsie. Wa'aiwari nekani'enieka, nekaniyuhekɨata mana nemɨwarayewitɨnikɨ. Hikɨtsɨari nepɨmatsi'anunɨ'ani 'a'utɨma 'Ekipitutsie”.   
\p
\v 35 »Mɨkɨ Muitsexi memutixani'eri mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: “¿Kepai tati'aitɨwame ta'itsɨkame pɨmatsi'ayeitɨa?”, mɨkɨtɨme Kakaɨyari kaneyenɨ'ani tiwa'aitɨwame wawikweitsitɨwame, niuki tuayame muxei tupiriyatsie 'uweme 'iparewiekaku yutɨrɨkariyakɨ.  
\v 36 Mɨkɨri kaniwarayewitɨni 'inɨari tiuyurieka mamariwaweme tiuyurieka 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, Haramara Mɨxetatsie, makumawetsieta yatiyurienetɨ huta tewiyari wiyari.   
\p
\v 37 »'Ikɨ Muitsexi kanihɨkɨtɨni kemɨ'ane mɨpaɨ mɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ 'ixaheritsixi: “Ti'aitame mɨxekakaɨyari tixexaxatɨwame nanukuketɨamɨkɨ xe'iwama watsata nehepaɨ 'anekame, mɨkɨ hɨrixɨa xepɨ'enieka”.  
\v 38 'Ikɨ Muitsexi kanihɨkɨtɨni kemɨ'ane meyeikakai memɨyuyexexeɨriwakai wahetsɨa makumawetsie, niuki tuayame matɨa meyeikakai mitahɨawixɨ yemuritsie Tsinahi mɨrakutewatsie, tatutsima wahamatɨa meyeikakai. Mɨkɨta niuki mayeyuri putanaki'eri tatsipitɨanike.   
\p
\v 39 »Mɨkɨ tatewarima mepɨka'i'eniekukai, matsi mepenuyehɨakukai. Yu'iyaritsie ta'aurie mepaxɨrikukai 'Ekipitutsie,  
\v 40 mɨpaɨ 'Aruni metekɨhɨawetɨ: “Peuyewetse kakaɨyarixi temutatiwewirieni memɨtatsi'uwitɨximenikɨ, Muitsexi 'Ekipitu mɨtatsi'ayewitɨ, 'atsitepɨkatemate kemeyɨ kemɨreyunixɨ”.   
\p
\v 41 »'Ana kakaɨyari tsikeru 'ɨkiyari meputawewi, mawari mepiwewiri. Mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni tita yumamakɨ memɨte'utawewi me'ayexeiyatɨ.  
\v 42 Hikɨ Kakaɨyari pɨwaruku'eiri, pɨwayetua muyuawitsie memɨteheukatei memɨtewarayexeiyanikɨ. Mɨpaɨ kemɨraka'utɨarie Kakaɨyari niukametemama waxapayaritsie mɨpaɨ 'anuyɨtɨ:  
\q1 »“Teɨteri 'ixaheritsixi, mawari xepɨkanetsi'uwewiri meta 'imikieri,  
\q2 makumawetsie xe'uhutɨ huta tewiyari wiyari.   
\q1
\v 43 Matsi xepeyexeiyakai Muruki xirikieya,  
\q2 Xemɨpani yukakaɨyari xuraweyari,  
\q2 wahepaɨ tiyuxexeiyame xepɨyuwewiriekai nenewieri xemɨwapitɨanikɨ.  
\q1 'Ayumieme nekanixe'anunɨ'amɨkɨ xemanuhapanienikɨ” Wawiruniya yeta paitɨ.   
\p
\v 44 »Hikɨ 'ixuriki tukiyari hakewa hekɨatsika mayekatei mana kaniuwekaitɨni tatutsima wahetsɨa makumawetsie, kemɨtiu'aitaxɨ mɨkɨ mitahɨawixɨ Muitsexi kename hepaɨna 'anekame ta'aitakekai 'ixuriki tukiyari, 'inɨari muxei hepaɨ 'anekame.  
\v 45 Mɨkɨ tuki meputanaki'eri tatewarima. Kutsuhexi matɨa mekani'atɨani kepauka memɨwareutaweiyaxɨa 'ena memɨtitekai hipame nuiwarite. 'Arikeketa 'aniuyeikakaitɨni Rawiri.  
\v 46 Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa katiniuka'iyarikaitɨni hetsiena mieme. Mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari putawawiri tuki mɨtawewienikɨ hake Kakuwu Kakaɨyarieya mayekanikɨ.  
\v 47 Peru Tsarumuni pɨta kii pitawewiri.   
\p
\v 48 »Tsepanetɨ mɨkɨ 'Amutewi kiita mɨkahayeka mamakɨ mɨwewiyata. Kemaine tixaxatame:   
\q1
\v 49 »“Muyuawi kanine'uwenitɨni,  
\q2 kwie meta hetsiena nemɨnewetɨka kanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\q1 ¿Keri 'anekame kii xepɨnetsitawewirieni?  
\qr ―Ti'aitame kanaineni―.  
\q2 ¿Hakewa nemeka'uxipienikɨ?   
\q1
\v 50 ¿Kamɨtsɨ, ne nemamakɨ 'ikɨ naime nemɨtiutiwewi katihɨkɨ?”   
\p
\v 51 »Xeme xekɨipi pɨtsetse'i, yu'iyaritsie yunakata xepɨka'inɨaritɨariewawe Kakaɨyari 'inɨarieyakɨ, xeme yuheyemekɨ xepeye'unie 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata yututsima wahepaɨ.  
\v 52 ¿Kemɨ'ane Kakaɨyari niukameya xetutsima memɨka'ayewei 'atiuyeika? Mepɨwarukwi mɨkɨ meripai memitahekɨataxɨ 'iya Heitserie Mexeiya 'umamienikekai. Mɨkɨri xepɨyetua, teyukukuyamete xepakɨ hikɨ.  
\v 53 'Inɨari niukiyari xeputanaki'eri niuki tuayamete metexe'aitɨakaku, yaxepɨkatekahu».   
\s1 'Etsitewani kemɨtiumierie  
\p
\v 54 Hikɨ me'i'enieka 'ikɨ, yu'iyaritsie mepuyeha'a. Mepɨyutakewekai me'ihekatɨ.  
\v 55 Peru 'Etsitewani hɨnetɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ, yuheima heutinieretɨ, Kakaɨyari kaniuxeiya witsi'anekame, meta Ketsutsi tiuxei Kakaɨyari tserieta 'utiweme.   
\p
\v 56 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Kamɨ, muyuawi nepɨxeiya 'anakayepiekame, Yuri Tewi Kakaɨyari tserieta 'utiweme netixeiya.   
\p
\v 57 Karima me'utihiwatɨ yunakateta mekaneuyukanaxɨani. Mekaniwiya 'axeikɨa.  
\v 58 Kiekaritsie mekanenuyehɨani, mekaneitituaxixɨani tetekɨ. Memixanetakai yu'ixuriki temaikɨ Tsauru hetɨa mekaniuku'eirieni.   
\p
\v 59 Mexi'akuxi me'itituaxakai, 'Etsitewani kaniyunenewiekaitɨni. Mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Ti'aitame Ketsutsi 'aku, ne'iyari keneutanaki'eri.   
\p
\v 60 'Utitunumakeka karima kaniutahiwa:  
\p —Ti'aitame 'aku, 'ikɨ 'axakememɨteyuriekɨ wahetsie pepɨkarahɨpani.  
\p Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka kaniumɨni.   
\c 8  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Tsauru 'iyarieya 'aixɨa pɨ'anekai 'Etsitewani mumieriekɨ.  
\s1 Tsauru memɨyutixexeɨriwa kemɨtiwataweweiyakai  
\p Hikɨ 'ana Kerutsaremetsie memɨyutixexeɨriwakai waɨkawamekɨ mekaneutaweiyariexɨani memu'uximatɨariekaikɨ, yunaitɨ mekaneutayeixɨani naitsarie kiekari mukumanetsie Kureyatsie meta Tsamariyatsie, nɨ'ariekate xeikɨa mekaniuyuhayewa.  
\v 2 Hipatɨ teɨteri Kakaɨyari memayexeiyakai 'Etsitewani mekanekuteuku, waɨkawamekɨ meyuhiwerietɨ hetsiena mieme.  
\v 3 Tsauru kwini mieme pɨwa'uximatɨakai memɨyutixexeɨriwakai: wakiita peutahakekai, warayehapanatɨ 'ukitsi 'ukari kaniwaranutaxɨrɨwakaitɨni.   
\s1 Niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne Tsamariyatsie kemɨtikuxaxatsiwakai  
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ memeutaxɨriexɨa naitsarie mekaneutayeixɨani niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne mekuxatatɨ.  
\v 5 Hikɨ Peripe nuaka Tsamariya kiekaritsie katiniwahekɨatɨakaitɨni Kɨritsitu heitserie mupitɨarie hepaɨtsita.  
\v 6 Mekani'enieni yunaitɨ kemutainekai Peripe 'axeikɨa me'i'enietɨ me'ixeiyatɨ 'inɨari kemɨtiyurienekai.  
\v 7 Kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene karima me'utihiwatɨ mepɨwarutixɨnaxɨ yumɨireme memɨwawiyakai. Yuwaɨkawatɨ wa'ɨkate mɨtutunikai meta memɨhurietɨkatei 'aixɨa me'anenetɨ mekanakɨne.  
\v 8 Mɨkɨ kiekaritsie yemekɨ mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni.   
\s1 Tsimuni tiyukewaiyame  
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ xewitɨ tewi Tsimuni mɨtitewakai mana puyeikakai mɨkɨ kiekaritsie meripaitɨ wakewaiyatɨ tsamariyatari tiwa'irɨwiyatɨ mɨpaɨ putainekai kename tɨrɨkaɨyekai.  
\v 10 Yunaitɨ 'ukirawetsixi tɨɨri meta mepi'eniekai mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «'Ikɨ Kakaɨyari tɨrɨkariyaya kanihɨkɨtɨni, Mɨmariwe mɨtitewa».   
\p
\v 11 Mepi'eniekai mɨixa mɨtiwa'irɨwiyakaikɨ wakewaiyatɨ.  
\v 12 Kepauka yuri memɨte'ita'eriri Peripe tiwakuxaxatɨwame niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne, kemɨti'ane Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku tikuxatatɨ, kemɨ'ane Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu mɨhɨkɨ kuxatatɨ, 'ukitsi 'ukari mepuka'ɨyarie.  
\v 13 Mɨkɨta Tsimuni yuri katiniuta'erieni, 'uka'ɨyarieka Peripe pɨparewiekai. 'Ixeiyatɨ 'inɨari tɨrɨkaɨyemekɨ waɨkawamekɨ kemɨtiyurienekai pɨ'iyarixiekai.   
\p
\v 14 Hikɨ me'u'enanaka nɨ'ariekate Kerutsareme meme'uwakai kename tsamariyatari me'itanaki'eri Kakaɨyari niukieya, wahetsɨa mepɨwarenɨ'a Pekuru Wani hamatɨa.  
\v 15 Mɨkɨ meheta'axɨaka mekaniyutanenewieni wahetsiemieme 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata mehexeiyatɨ memakɨnekɨ.  
\v 16 'Akuxi 'Iyari mɨkɨ nixewitɨ pɨkahexeiyakai. Mepuka'ɨyariekai xeikɨa Kɨritsitu hetsɨa memɨmiemetetɨnikɨ.  
\v 17 Hikɨ Pekuru meta Wani wahetsie mekaneutimeni, mɨkɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata mehexeiyatɨ mekanakɨne.   
\p
\v 18 Hikɨ Tsimuni kaniwaruxeiya 'Iyari kememɨte'upitɨarie nɨ'ariekate waheima me'utimeku. Tumini kaniwaranu'ɨirienikekaitɨni,  
\v 19 mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Xekeneneupitɨa neta 'ikɨ tɨrɨkariya, kemɨ'ane heima nemutimeni 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata hexeiyatɨ mayanikɨ.   
\p
\v 20 Pekuru mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Atumini 'ahamatɨa ke'ukumawere, tuminikɨ Kakaɨyari 'imikierieya pemɨnanaimɨkɨkaikɨ.  
\v 21 'Ikɨ hepaɨtsita 'ekɨ heitserie pepɨkahexeiya, 'ahetsie pɨkatinakeni. 'A'iyari mɨkaheitseriekɨ Kakaɨyari hɨxie.  
\v 22 Ketineuhayewa kepemɨtiyuriene, pe'iku'eirieme 'ikɨ tita 'axapemɨtiyuriene, Ti'aitame keneutawawiri tsiparatsɨ xɨka pereuyehɨwiyariemɨkɨ mɨpaɨ pemɨti'akɨhɨawekɨ.  
\v 23 Ne nepɨmatsixeiya tsiɨrika hepaɨ pehatsiwime, tita mɨkatiheitseriekɨ penɨkame.   
\p
\v 24 Hikɨ Tsimuni mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Xemetsɨ Ti'aitame xekeneutawawiri nehetsiemieme, 'atsinemɨka'itɨarienikɨ kexemutiyuane.   
\p
\v 25 Hikɨ mɨkɨri mewarutahekɨatɨaka me'itaxataka Ti'aitame niukieya, ta'aurie mepaxɨri, Kerutsareme mekanekɨne. Niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne mekanikuxatakaitɨni naitsarie tsamariyatari wakiekaritetsie.   
\s1 Peripe 'etihupiyatanaka hamatɨa kememɨtekuxatakai  
\p
\v 26 Hikɨ Ti'aitame niukieya tuayame Peripe mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Kenanukukexi, tatserieta kenemie huyeta Kerutsareme mayehane 'utɨma kiekari Kahatsa mɨrakutewatsie mɨye'axe, hakewa makumawe».  
\v 27 Peripe 'anukukeka kaneyani. Tewi 'etihupiyatanaka ti'uximayatame ti'aitame hetsiemieme mɨkaneɨke kananukunake, waɨkawamekɨ mɨhɨritɨariekai 'uka ti'aitame Kanaratse mɨtitewakai hetsiemieme. Katinihɨritɨariekaitɨni naime piiniteya hepaɨtsita. Mɨkɨ tewi Kerutsareme kanekuyeixɨakaitɨni heyukunenewieka,  
\v 28 yukaxetatsie hatikaitɨ, titerɨwatɨ tixaxatame Kitsariyaxi xapaya.  
\v 29 Kakaɨyari 'Iyarieya Peripe mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Mana kenemie, 'ahurawa keneuye'a mɨkɨ kaxeta 'aurie».   
\p
\v 30 Peripe 'unautsarɨmetɨ, kani'enieni tixaxatame Kitsariyaxi xapaya terɨwakame. Mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Pereiti'enietɨyeika 'aku tita pemɨtiterɨwa?   
\p
\v 31 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —¿Ketsɨnereitimani, xɨka xewitɨ kanetsi'utahekɨatɨani?  
\p Hikɨ Peripe kaniuta'inieni manutimakekɨ, 'auriena mayerɨnikɨ.  
\v 32 Mɨpaɨ panuyɨne 'utɨarika pemiterɨwakai:  
\q1 «Muxa hepaɨ kanehanieni mɨmierienikɨ,  
\q2 muxa kaxiriwatɨ mɨka'utatsuaka hepaɨ  
\q2 mɨpaɨta yaxeikɨa pɨka'utatsua.   
\q1
\v 33 Tixaɨ mɨkaratɨakɨ, heitserie pɨka'upitɨarie kemɨreuyewekai kepauka muta'inɨatsie.  
\q2 ¿Kepaikɨ pɨwamaika nuiwarimama?  
\q2 Tukarieya munawaiyariekɨ kwiepa».   
\p
\v 34 Hikɨ tewi mɨhɨritɨarie Peripe mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Yakenetineutaxatɨa 'ekɨ ximɨxi, ¿kepaikɨ pɨraxata tixaxatame, pɨyuxata, nutsu xeime pɨta pɨxata?   
\p
\v 35 Hikɨ Peripe, kanitsutɨani mɨkɨ 'utɨarikatsie tihekɨatɨatɨ tikuxaxatɨwatɨ niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne Ketsutsi hepaɨtsita.  
\v 36 Huyeta me'uhutɨ haa maxuawe mekaniu'axɨani, mɨpaɨ tewi mɨhɨritɨarie kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Neuxei kamɨ haa 'ena. ¿Titari reuyewetse nemɨka'ɨyarienikɨ?   
\p
\v 37 Mɨpaɨ Peripe katinita'eiya:  
\p —Xɨka 'a'iyaritsie yemekɨ yuri peti'erieka, 'aixɨa kaniyɨmɨkɨ.  
\p Mɨkɨta mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Ne yuri nekatini'erieka Kakaɨyari Nu'aya Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu mɨhɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 38 Katiniuta'aita kaxeta mana mɨtakerienikɨ. Yuhutatɨ mekaneukakɨne haapa Peripe mɨkɨ tewi mɨhɨritɨarie kaniuka'ɨya.  
\v 39 Haapa me'anatikɨneku Ti'aitame 'Iyarieya Peripe kanitihana. Tewi mɨhɨritɨarie tawariri pɨka'ixei, yutemawietɨ yuhuyeta kaniumiekaitɨni.  
\v 40 Matsi Peripe 'Atsutu paitɨ kaniuyeikakaitɨni, niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne kanikuxatakaitɨni naitsarie kuyeikatɨ kiekaritetsie, 'arike peta'a Tsetsareya paitɨ.   
\c 9  
\s1 Tsauru kemɨtiuhayewaxɨ  
\r (Nɨ'a 9:1-19 – Nɨ'a 23:3-16, 26:9-18)  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Tsauru 'uxiwa'atɨ 'akuxi mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ mɨwakwinikekai Ti'aitame teyɨ'ɨkitɨwametemama, kaninuani mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame hetsɨa,  
\v 2 kanitawawirieni xapate mɨtiwati'utɨirienikɨ tukita miemete Ramatsikutsie, mɨpaɨ 'utaineme: «Xɨkatsɨ 'ikɨ waretaxeiya hipame mɨkɨ huyeta miemete 'ukitsi 'ukari, kaniwarahapamɨkɨ mehɨatɨkaime Kerutsareme paitɨ».  
\v 3 Hikɨ huyeta 'uyemiekaku, Ramatsiku 'aye'aximekaku, 'auriena kaniukumerɨka taheima miemekɨ.  
\v 4 Kwiepa 'ukaweka kani'enieni xeime mɨpaɨ haineme:  
\p —Tsauru 'aku, Tsauru, ¿titayari penetikuweiyane 'ekɨ?   
\p
\v 5 Mɨkɨ rehɨawe:  
\p —¿'Ekɨ Ti'aitame kemɨ'ane pepetaine?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Netsɨ Ketsutsi nekanihɨkɨtɨni pemɨnetsikuweiyane. Pɨmatsi'ukukuine pemɨka'awaɨriyakɨ, pemɨti'aketsinakɨ pe'anatseiwatɨ titsewemekɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Tsauru 'uyɨyɨakatɨ matɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ti'aitame, tita matinake yanemɨtiyurieni.  
\p Ti'aitame rehɨawe:  
\p —Hikɨ kenanukukexi, kiekaritsie keneutahaki. Manari yapepɨretahɨawarieni kemɨreuyewetse yapemɨtiyurienenikɨ.   
\p
\v 7 Teɨteri hamatɨana memuhukai mehɨxiyatɨ 'ameniti'uni me'i'enietɨ kemɨ'ane mutaniu, peru meka'ixeiyatɨ.  
\v 8 Hikɨ Tsauru kwiepa kananukukeni, yuhɨxita 'anutaniereka tixaɨ pɨkatiuxei, mamayatsie metiwɨtɨ mepeiha, Ramatsiku paitɨ mekani'atɨani.  
\v 9 Haika tukari puyuri kaheunieretɨ katikwatɨ kaharetɨ.   
\p
\v 10 Hikɨ xewitɨ mana kaniuyeikakaitɨni Ramatsikutsie tiyɨ'ɨkitɨwame 'Ananiyaxi titewatɨ, tɨkarikɨ heinɨtsita Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Ananiyaxi.  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ne nekanihɨkɨtɨni.   
\p
\v 11 Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ rehɨawe:  
\p —Kenanukukexi, kenemie kaye Mɨxeuraɨye mɨtitewa 'utɨa, Kura kiita keneta'iwau tarutsutanaka Tsauru mɨtitewa. Mana peyunenewie.  
\v 12 Mɨkɨta heinɨtsita kanixeiya tewi 'Ananiyaxi titewakame mana ye'arɨkame heimana 'utimekame manutanierekɨ.   
\p
\v 13 'Ananiyaxi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Ti'aitame, nepɨwaru'eni yumɨireme metekuxatame 'ikɨ tewi hepaɨtsita, naime 'axakemɨwayurienekai mɨkɨ 'ateɨterima Kerutsaremetsie.  
\v 14 'Enata heitserie mekanipitɨani mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame mɨwaranutaxɨrɨwanikɨ yunaime memɨmatsi'ayexeiya.   
\p
\v 15 Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenemietsɨ. Ne 'ikɨ nepenayexei, mɨtihekɨatanikɨ nehepaɨtsita nuiwarite wahɨxie, kwiepa te'aitamete meta 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie.  
\v 16 Nekatinita'ɨkitɨamɨkɨ kemɨreuyewetse mɨtikwinekɨ nehetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 17 Hikɨ 'Ananiyaxi kaneyani, kiita kaneutahani. Heimana 'utimeka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Ne'iwa Tsauru, Ti'aitame ne kaneneyenɨ'ani, mɨkɨ Ketsutsi pemuxei huyeta pe'aye'aximetɨ, mɨkɨ kaneneyenɨ'ani peheunieretɨ pemayanikɨ, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ pemɨhɨnenikɨ».  
\v 18 Yapauka panayexɨri hɨxitana kunieri hepaɨ 'anenetɨ, heunieretɨ kanayani. 'Anukukeka kaniuka'ɨyarieni,  
\v 19 tiukwakari tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ kanayani. Hikɨ Ramatsikutsie puyeikakai yapaɨmexɨa tukari teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete wahamatɨa.   
\s1 Tsauru Ramatsikutsie meta Kerutsaremetsie kemɨtikuxatakai  
\p
\v 20 Kwitɨwa huriyutsixi watukiteta katinihekɨatakaitɨni Ketsutsi hepaɨtsita: «'Iya Kakaɨyari kaninu'ayatɨni» 'utaitɨ.  
\v 21 Mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni yunaitɨ memi'eniekai, mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni: «'Ikɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni kemɨ'ane mɨwaraye'uniekai mɨkɨ memehɨawe mɨkɨ kemɨ'ane mɨhɨkɨ Kerutsareme kiekatari, 'uwata 'ayumieme kaninuani, mɨwaranuwitɨnikɨ mehɨatɨkaime mawari wewiwamete memɨhɨritɨarie wahetsɨa».  
\v 22 Tsauru yemekɨ kanitɨrɨkariyarieximekaitɨni. Kaniwa'iyarixitɨakaitɨni huriyutsixi Ramatsikutsie memɨtamakai, kaniwarutahekɨatɨani kename Ketsusi Metsiyaxi\f + \fr 9:22 \fq Metsiyaxi\ft . \fq Kɨritsitu\ft  kɨriyekukɨ panuyɨne.\f* hɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ mɨixa tukari 'utixɨku huriyutsixi mekaniyu'enieni me'imienike.  
\v 24 Tsauru katinetimani kememɨteyurienikekai. Kiekari kitenitetsie tukarikɨ meta tɨkarikɨ mekanihupiekaitɨni me'imienike.  
\v 25 Teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete yɨwikɨta kiriwatsie me'ikayeka tetsariya warie mekaneikatuani.   
\p
\v 26 Hikɨ Kerutsareme nuaka pɨtiwiyamɨkɨkai teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete wahetsie. Yunaitɨ mepimakarɨkai yuri mekate'erietɨ kename tiyɨ'ɨkitɨwametɨkai.  
\v 27 Werunawe heiwitɨka kani'atɨani nɨ'ariekate wahetsɨa. Kaniwarutahekɨatɨani ya'utaitɨ kename huyeta Ti'aitame 'uxei, meta 'itahɨawixɨ, kename Ramatsikutsie kamatɨ tikuxatakai Ketsutsi hetsɨa miemetɨtɨ kemɨtixɨnakai.  
\v 28 Hikɨ wahetsɨa kaniuyuhayewa Kerutsaremetsie naitsarie kuyeikatɨ, hekɨakamekɨ tikuxatatɨ Ti'aitame hetsiemieme.  
\v 29 Pɨkamakai mɨtaniunikɨ Ti'aitame hetsɨa mɨmiemetɨkaikɨ. Niuki kanixɨatɨakaitɨni kɨriyekutsixi waniukikɨ memutiniukakai wahamatɨa. Mɨmetsɨ mekanimiekukaitɨni.  
\v 30 'Iwamama yametehetimaika mekaneiwitɨni Tsetsareyatsie paitɨ, Tarutsu paitɨ mekaneitanɨ'ani.   
\p
\v 31 Hikɨ memɨyutixexeɨriwakai naitsarie Kureyatsie, Karereyatsie, Tsamariyatsie mepɨka'uximatɨariekai. Mepɨtɨrɨkariyariekai, Ti'aitame me'ayemakatɨ 'amekaniu'uwakaitɨni, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata mɨiremekɨ kaniwatuikakaitɨni.   
\s1 'Eneyaxi 'aixɨa reu'erietɨ kemɨratɨa meta Rurukaxi  
\p
\v 32 Hikɨ Pekuru naitsarie pukuyeikakai, manata penua Kakaɨyari teɨterimama wahetsɨa Riratsie memɨtamakai.  
\v 33 Mana kanikaxeiya xeime tewi 'Eneyaxi mɨtitewakai 'atahaika wiyari mɨyuriekai yu'utatsie kakaitɨ mɨhuriekaikɨ.  
\v 34 Mɨpaɨ Pekuru katinitahɨawe: «'Eneyaxi 'aku, Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu 'aixɨa pɨmatsi'uyuri. Kenanukukexi, 'a'itsi keneutatuna». Yapauka kananukukeni.  
\v 35 Yunaitɨ Riratsie Tsarunitsie memɨtamakai mekanixeiyakaitɨni, mɨkɨta mete'uhayewaka ke'axamemɨteyuriekai Ti'aitametsie mekateniuwiya.   
\p
\v 36 Hikɨ tiyɨ'ɨkitɨwame 'uka Kupetsie nekateitɨni Tawita titewatɨ (taniukikɨ Rurukaxi titewatɨ, Maxama titewatɨ). Mɨkɨ 'aixɨa ti'aneneme katiniyurienekaitɨni kwini mieme, katiniyukanenimayakaitɨni.  
\v 37 Hikɨ 'ana tiutakwineka kaniumɨni. Me'itahauxika kii taɨta mekaneitateni.  
\v 38 Hikɨ Riratsie pehurakai Kupe, teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete me'u'enanaka kename Pekuru mana heyeikakai, hetsɨana mekaniwarenɨ'ani 'ukitsi yuhutame mɨpaɨ mete'itawawirienike: «Penɨkahɨrixɨa 'areutewini tahetsɨa pemɨnuanikɨ».   
\p
\v 39 Pekuru 'anukukeka wahamatɨa petɨa, nuaku kii taɨta mekaneitiwitɨni. 'Auriena mekaniu'axɨani yunaitɨ 'ukari wakɨnama memukwi, me'utitsuatɨ me'ixeitsitɨatɨ 'ixurikite tetɨata miemete herie miemete miwewiekai Maxama wahetsɨa 'uyeikatɨ.   
\p
\v 40 Yunaime Pekuru kaniwaranuyenɨ'ani, 'utitunumakeka kaniyutanenewieni. Ta'aurie 'aweka kaxari manukatei mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Tawita 'aku, kenanukukexi». Mɨkɨ kananutaniere. Pekuru 'uxeiyaka 'aniutayerɨni.  
\v 41 'Iya mamayatsie tiwiereka kanenukuhana. Yuhetsɨa kaniwarutahɨawe Kakaɨyari teɨterimama 'ukari meta wakɨnama memukwi wahamatɨa, kaniyetuani 'ayeniereme.  
\v 42 Naitsarie Kupetsie kaniutamariwa, yuwaɨkawatɨ yuri mekateniuta'erieni Ti'aitame hetsie.  
\v 43 Mɨixa tukari Kupetsie pekatei Tsimuni hetsɨa nawi 'uayame hetsɨa.   
\c 10  
\s1 Kuxineriyu Pekuru kemɨtiutanɨ'airi  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ tewi Tsetsareyatsie pukatei Kuxineriyu titewatɨ xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨatɨ. Mɨkɨ kuyaxi 'Itariyatsie mepɨkiekataritɨkai.  
\v 2 Mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari 'ayemakatɨ yakatinikamiekaitɨni, meta yunaitɨ kiena kiekatari. Waɨkawa katiniyurienekaitɨni teɨteri wahetsiemieme wanenimayatɨ, Kakaɨyari nenewieri pɨpitɨakai yuheyemekɨ.  
\v 3 Hikɨ xeitukaritsie tau kɨa kakaiku heinɨtsi hepaɨ 'aneme kaniuxeiya. Kakaɨyari niukieya tuayame hepana 'amiekame kaniuxeiya, mɨpaɨ tikɨhɨaweme:  
\p —Kuxineriyu 'aku.   
\p
\v 4 Kuxineriyu 'ixeiyatɨ waɨkamekɨ kanimakaitɨni mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Ketita 'aku neti'aitɨwame?  
\p Niuki tuayame mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Kakaɨyari 'anenewieri kaniu'enieni 'anenimayatsika meta 'a'uximayatsikatsie kepemɨtiyuriene mawari pewewietɨ.  
\v 5 Hikɨ teɨteri Kupe paitɨ keniwaranunɨ'a Tsimuni Pekuru mɨtitewa memɨwitɨyukɨ.  
\v 6 Mɨkɨ Tsimuni nawi 'uayame hetsɨa kanekani, kiya haramara tetsita kaneweni. Mɨkɨ kamatinitaxatɨamɨkɨ kemɨreuyewetse yapemɨtiyurienenikɨ.   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ niuki tuayame tiutaxataka heyaku, Kuxineriyu yuhutame yunɨ'arima yu'aurie pɨwarutahɨawixɨ meta kuya Kakaɨyari mayexeiyakai, memiparewiekai yuheyemekɨ.  
\v 8 Naime tiwarutahekɨatɨaka kemɨtiuyɨkai, Kupe paitɨ kaniwarenɨ'ani.   
\s1 Pekuru tita mɨtiuxei  
\p
\v 9 'Uxa'arieka mexi'akuxi huyeta me'uhukaku kiekari 'aurie me'aye'axɨaximekaku Pekuru kii heima manawerikaitsie kaneutiyani tuka yutanenewienike.  
\v 10 Kanekahakamɨkatɨyani, mexi'akuxi 'ikwai wewiyakai, katiniuheinɨni.  
\v 11 Muyuawi 'anakayepiekame kaniuxeiya meta tsawana hepaɨ ti'anekame katiniuxeiya 'arakamieme, tetsitana naukakɨa tiwiwietɨkaime kwiepa paitɨ kanakatuiyani.  
\v 12 Mɨkɨtsie mekanati'ukaitɨni yunaitɨ kwiepa memɨte'u'uwa nauka 'ɨkayari memexeiyatɨka, kuterixi meta memɨte'awɨwawe.   
\p
\v 13 Xewitɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Pekuru kenanukukexi, keniwarukwika meta keniwarutikwa'i.   
\p
\v 14 Pekuru mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Ti'aitame pɨkatixaɨxuari. Hatsuaku nepɨkatitikwaiwe 'axamɨti'anene mɨkati'itiyatɨka.   
\p
\v 15 Hutarieka mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Tita Kakaɨyari mɨti'itie 'axati'anenekame pepɨkati'erieka.   
\p
\v 16 Haikakɨa mɨpaɨ katiniuyɨni, hikɨta kwitɨwa tsawana panutihanie taheima.   
\p
\v 17 Pekuru 'atsipɨkaretimaitɨyeikakai titakɨ mɨti'ayumiemetɨkai heinɨtsi. Hikɨ mexi'akuxi teɨteri Kuxineriyu mɨwareyenɨ'akai, kitenie me'u'axɨaka Tsimuni kiya hepaɨtsita mekaniuta'iwauni.  
\v 18 Meku'iwawatɨ mekaniutiniere xɨka Tsimuni Pekuru mɨtitewa muwa 'ayekateitɨni.   
\p
\v 19 Mexi'akuxi Pekuru yu'iyaritɨakai kemɨtiunierekai hepaɨtsita, 'Iyari mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Neuxei Tsimuni, teɨteri yuhaikatɨ mepɨmatsiwautɨwe.  
\v 20 Mexuima, mana keneukaye'a, wahamatɨa kenemie peka'a'iyaritɨatɨ, netsɨ nepɨwareyenɨ'a».   
\p
\v 21 Pekuru 'anakayaka hake memeti'ukai teɨteri mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Ne nekanihɨkɨtɨni, xeme xemɨnetsiwautɨwe. ¿Tita xetehayexeiyatɨ xetekɨyɨa?   
\p
\v 22 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'eiya:  
\p —Kuxineriyu xeitsienituyari kuyaxi mɨtiwa'aitɨwame tatsiheyenɨ'aku tepeyekɨ, mɨkɨ heitseriemekɨ yapɨtiyuriene meta Kakaɨyari kanayemakaxeni, yunaitɨ huriyutsixi mekaneyemakaxekaitɨni. Kakaɨyari niukieya tuayame mɨpaɨ katinita'aitɨani 'ekɨ kiena pemɨmiekɨ, mɨmatsi'enienikɨ niuki 'ekɨ pemitaxatɨanikɨ.   
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ Pekuru kiita kaniwareuta'inieni, muwa memayehenikɨ.  
\s1 Pekuru Kuxineriyu kemɨreku'iwataxɨ  
\p 'Uxa'arieka 'anukukeka wahamatɨa kaneyani. Hipatɨta 'iwamarixi Kupetsie kiekatari wahamatɨa mekanekɨne.  
\v 24 'Uxa'ariekake Tsetsareya paitɨ mekaneta'axɨani. Kuxineriyu kaniwakwewiekaitɨni yumarema meta yuhamikuma mɨwanaki'eriekai wahamatɨa.  
\v 25 Pekuru 'aye'aximekaku kiena, Kuxineriyu kanayeyani 'enunakeke. Hetɨana 'ukatunumakeka nenewieri kanipitɨani.  
\v 26 Matsi Pekuru kanenukuketɨani mɨpaɨ tikɨhɨawetɨ:  
\p —Kenanukukexi. Netsɨ 'ahepaɨ nekanitewitɨni.   
\p
\v 27 Pekuru hamatɨana tikuxatatɨ kitana kaneutahani, kaniwaretaxeiya yuwaɨkawa meyuxeɨriekame.   
\p
\v 28 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xeme mɨpaɨ xepɨtemate, kemɨ'ane huriyu tewiyari mɨhɨkɨ pɨkatauniwa mɨtiwiyanikɨ xeime nuiwaritsie, wa'aurie mamienikɨ. Perutsɨ Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ pɨnetiutahekɨatɨa tewi mɨkayɨwe mɨpaɨ mɨtayɨni kename tewi 'axa'ane kename ka'itiya.  
\v 29 'Ayumieme nekaneku'imawatɨ nekaninuani kepauka nemeyewitɨkie. Hikɨ nekanixeku'iwawiyanikeyu ¿titayari xenete'utanɨ'airi?   
\p
\v 30 Kuxineriyu mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ranuka'atu nepɨnehakiekai 'epauka. Tau kɨa kakaiku ne ninenenewiekaitɨni nekiita. Yapauka xewitɨ nehɨxie putake 'ixuriki merɨkaɨyeme 'anakatɨtɨ  
\v 31 mɨpaɨ kanetiniutahɨawe: “Kuxineriyu 'aku, Kakaɨyari 'anenewieri pu'eni meta yapɨretima kepemɨti'uximaya peti'akanenimayatɨ.  
\v 32 'Ayumieme, ketineutanɨ'a Kupe paitɨ. Tsimuni Pekuru mɨtitewa munuanikɨ. Mɨkɨ Tsimuni nawi 'uayame kie kanekani haramara tetsita. Nuame pɨmatitaxatɨani”.  
\v 33 Hikɨ kwitɨwa nekatiniutanɨ'ani. 'Ekɨtsɨ 'aixɨa pekatiniuyurieni pemunuakɨ. Hikɨtsɨari tanaitɨ 'uwa tepɨtaxeɨrie Kakaɨyari hɨxie, temi'enienikɨ naime Ti'aitame kemɨmati'aitɨa yapemɨtatitaxatɨanikɨ.   
\p
\v 34 Hikɨ Pekuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yurikɨ hikɨrixɨa mɨpaɨ nepɨretima, Kakaɨyari teɨteri yɨkɨ pɨkatiwaxeiya,  
\v 35 matsi yuxexuime nuiwarite watsata kemɨ'ane me'eyemakatɨ meta kemɨ'ane heitseriemekɨ yameteyurietɨ memu'uwa mɨkɨ pɨwaxeiya.  
\v 36 Kakaɨyari yuniuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne kaneyenɨ'ani 'ixaheritsixi wahetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ hainekame kename Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu yu'iyaritsie memɨka'uximatɨariekakɨ wapitɨani. Mɨkɨ Ketsutsi yunaime tiwa'aitɨwame mɨhɨkɨ.  
\v 37 Xemeri xepɨtemate naitsarie Kureyatsie kemɨtiuyɨ, Karereyatsie tiutsutɨarieku kepauka Wani mɨtihekɨatakai kememɨteka'ɨyarienikekai.  
\v 38 Ketsutsi natsaretitanaka kanihɨkɨtɨni, kemɨ'ane Kakaɨyari mikawiri 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata meta 'itɨrɨkariyatɨ. Mɨkɨ 'aniuyeikakaitɨni 'aixɨa tiyurienetɨ, yunaime Kauyumarie mɨwa'uximatɨakai 'aixɨa meteheu'eriekame kaniwarayeitɨwakaitɨni, Kakaɨyari hamatɨana muyeikakaikɨ.  
\v 39 Tame tepɨhɨkɨ temunenierixɨ temɨtehekɨata naime hepaɨtsita kemɨtiuyuri huriyutsixi wakwiepa Kerutsaremetsie. Mɨkɨ mekanimieni kɨyetsie me'ikawiwatɨ.  
\v 40 Kakaɨyari kanenukuketɨani hairieka tukaritsie, kanipitɨani matsiɨkɨtɨ mayanikɨ,  
\v 41 yunaitɨ teɨteri meka'ixeiyakaku, tehekɨatamete xeikɨa Kakaɨyari mɨwaranuyexei matɨari paitɨ mekanixeiya, tame hamatɨana tekateniukwani meta tekateniu'ieni mɨkite watsata 'anukukeku.  
\v 42 Mɨkɨ pɨtatiuta'aitɨa teɨteri temɨtewakuxaxatɨwanikɨ, temɨtehekɨatanikɨ kename 'ikɨ hɨkɨ kemɨ'ane Kakaɨyari mikaye memayeneniere meta mɨkite wa'itsɨkame mayanikɨ.  
\v 43 Hepaɨtsitanata yunaitɨ Kakaɨyari niukametemama mekatenihekɨatani mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ, mɨkɨ hetsiena yuri memɨte'erie katiniwareuyehɨwirieni tita 'axamemɨte'uyurikɨ hetsɨana memɨmiemetetɨnikɨ.   
\p
\v 44 Hikɨ Pekuru mexi'akuxi niuki kuxatakaku, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata wahetsie katiniuwiya, yunaitɨ niukieya memu'eni wahetsie.  
\v 45 Yuri memɨte'eriekai Pekuru hamatɨa memu'axɨa memɨhuriyutsixitɨkai mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni memɨkahuriyutsixi mɨpaɨ memɨte'umikiekɨ, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata wahetsie mutatuiyakɨ.  
\v 46 Mepɨwa'eniekai niukitekɨ metekuxatame, 'aixɨa me'utiyuaneme Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 47 Hikɨ Pekuru mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Kepaitsɨ haa pɨwatikweririeni, 'ikɨ memɨka'ɨyarienikɨ? 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata meputanaki'eriexɨa tahepaɨ.   
\p
\v 48 Katiniuta'aita memɨka'ɨyarienikɨ Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu hetsiemieme. Hikɨ mekaniwarutawawirieni wahetsɨa 'akuxi yapaɨmexa tukari memuyuhayewanikɨ.   
\c 11  
\s1 Pekuru kemɨtiwarutahekɨatɨa memɨyutixexeɨriwa Kerutsaremetsie  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ nɨ'ariekate meta 'iwamarixi Kureyatsie memu'uwakai mekateniutamarieni kename mɨkɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi Kakaɨyari niukieya me'utanaki'eriekai.  
\v 2 Kepauka Pekuru Kerutsaremetsie meutiyunixɨ, mɨkɨ xitekiya 'inɨariyaritsie miemekɨ mekaniniukimakaitɨni  
\v 3 mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —¿Titayari 'ekɨ teɨteri xitekiya 'inɨariyari memɨkahexeiya wahetsɨa petinua meta wahamatɨa perekwakai?   
\p
\v 4 Pekuru katiniwarutixatɨatɨyani xexuime kemɨreyɨkai hepaɨtsita:   
\p
\v 5 —Ne kiekari Kupe mɨrakutewatsie nehekaitɨ. Nekaneyunenewiekaitɨni, heinɨtsi hepaɨ 'anekame nekanexeiya, taheima 'akamieme tetsitana naukakɨa hawiwietɨkaime tsawana 'amɨyewa hepaɨ tiyuxexeiyame, nemanukateitsie 'aurie kaniuteni.  
\v 6 Nekaniwaxeiyakaitɨni mana memɨte'atitekai, nauka 'ɨkateyari memexeiya kwiepa miemete, yeutari, kuterixi meta memɨte'awɨwawe nekaniwaruxeiya.  
\v 7 Hikɨ xeime nekaniu'enieni mɨpaɨ netikɨhɨaweme: “Pekuru kenanukukexi, keniwarukwika keniwarutikwa'i”.  
\v 8 Ne mɨpaɨ nekaniutayɨni: “Ti'aitame pɨkatixaɨ, tita 'axamɨti'anene mɨkati'itiyatɨka hatsuaku neteta pɨkareutahawe”.  
\v 9 Hutarieka mɨpaɨ kanetiniuta'eiya kemɨ'ane taheima mutaniukakai: “Tita Kakaɨyari mɨti'itie 'ekɨ 'axati'anenekame pepɨkati'erieka”.  
\v 10 Haikakɨa mɨpaɨ katiniuyɨni, hikɨta naitɨ taheima kananutihanieni.   
\p
\v 11 »Hikɨ 'ana yuhaikatɨ teɨteri nekie nemɨwayekateitsie mekaniu'axɨani, nehetsɨa memeyenɨ'arie Tsetsareyatsie meheyekɨneka.  
\v 12 'Iyari mɨpaɨ pɨnetiutahɨawixɨ: “Wahamatɨa kenemie tixaɨtɨkɨ pekati'a'iyaritɨatɨ”. Meta ta'iwama 'ataxewitɨ nehamatɨa mekanekɨne, mɨkɨ tewi kiita tekaneutahaxɨani.  
\v 13 Mɨkɨ katatiniutahekɨatɨani niuki tuayame kemɨtiuxei yukiita mɨpaɨ tikɨhɨaweme: “Xeime keneutanɨ'a Kupe paitɨ Tsimuni Pekuru mɨtitewa mɨwitɨkiemiekɨ.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨ niuki pɨmatsitaxatɨani kɨmana 'ekɨ meta 'akie kiekatari yunaitɨ xemɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ”.   
\p
\v 15 »Kepauka netiutsutɨaku netikuxatatɨ, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata wahetsie pɨtiuwiyaxɨ tahepaɨ tsutɨapai tahetsie mɨtiuwiyaxɨ hepaɨ.  
\v 16 Hikɨ ne nepaye'eri Ti'aitame niukieya kemainekai: “Wani hakɨ pɨtiuka'ɨyakai, xeme pɨta 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ xepɨka'ɨyarieni”.  
\v 17 'Ayumieme, xɨka Kakaɨyari wayetuirieni mɨkɨ 'imikieri yaxeikɨa tame kemɨtatiupitɨa Ti'aitame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu hetsie yuri tete'uta'erieku, ¿Ne ketsɨ netiyɨwekai Kakaɨyari nema'imaiyanikɨ?   
\p
\v 18 Hikɨ 'ikɨ me'u'enieka, kayuwatɨ mekaniutamare, 'aixɨa mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Mɨkɨta Kakaɨyari katiniwarupitɨani memɨkahuriyutsixi memɨtehayewanikɨ kememɨteyuriekai matsi tukari memexeiyanikɨ.   
\s1 'Anutiyukiyatsie memuyutixexeɨriwa  
\p
\v 19 Hikɨ mɨkɨ memeutaweiyariexɨakai 'umierieku 'Etsitewani, Penitsiyatsie, Tsipɨretsie meta 'Anutiyukiyatsie mekaneta'axɨani, hipame niuki mepɨkawakuxaxatɨwakai, huriyutsixi xeikɨa.  
\v 20 Hipatɨ mɨkɨ Tsipɨre meta Tsirene mekanikiekataritɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨ 'Anutiyukiya me'u'axɨaka niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne mekaniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni kɨriyekutsixi Ti'aitame Ketsutsi hepaɨtsita.  
\v 21 Mɨkɨ Ti'aitame tɨrɨkariyaya kaniwaparewiekaitɨni, yuwaɨkawatɨ yuri mekateniuta'erieni, Ti'aitame hetsie mekateniuwiya.   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ wahepaɨtsita mepu'enana mɨkɨ Kerutsaremetsie memɨyutixexeɨriwakai, Werunawe 'Anutiyukiya paitɨ mekanenɨ'ani.  
\v 23 Nuaka, nieretɨ Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa kemɨtiuka'iyarikai, kaniyutemawiekaitɨni. Yunaime kaniwatuikakaitɨni Ti'aitame hetsie memɨtewiyanikɨ, wa'iyari ya'anekaku.  
\v 24 Mɨkɨ tewi 'aixɨa pɨtiyurienekai, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ pɨhɨnekai, meta yuri pɨti'eriekai. Yumɨiretɨ teɨteri Ti'aitame hetsie mekateniuwiya.   
\p
\v 25 Manata Werunawe Tarutsu paitɨ kaneyani Tsauru kuwaunetɨ, kepauka mitaxei 'Anutiyukiya paitɨ kaneiwitɨni.  
\v 26 Mana xeiwiyari mepuyuri memɨyutixexeɨriwakai wahamatɨa meyukuxexeɨriwatɨ. Yumɨireme mekateniwa'ɨkitɨakaitɨni, 'Anutiyukiyatsie teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete “Kɨritsitiyanutsixi” mepɨte'utaterɨwarie matɨari.   
\p
\v 27 Hikɨ 'ana Kakaɨyari niukametemama kerutsaremetari 'Anutiyukiya paitɨ mekanakanexɨani.  
\v 28 Mɨkɨ xewitɨ 'anukukeka 'Akawu mɨtitewakai katiniutahekɨata, 'Iyari mɨpaɨ titahekɨatɨaku kename hakaxa 'ayanikekai waɨkawa naitsarie teɨteri mematitekaitsie, mɨpaɨ pɨtiuyɨ kepauka Kɨrauriyu mɨti'aitametɨkai mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie.  
\v 29 Yuxexuitɨ teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete kememɨteheixeiyakai, mekaniyuwaɨriyakaitɨni tixaɨtɨ memɨte'anunɨ'anikɨ memɨwaparewienikɨ yu'iwama Kureyatsie memɨtamakai.  
\v 30 Mɨpaɨtsɨ mepɨte'uyuri, 'imikieri mawariyari mepukuxeɨri, Werunawe meta Tsauru mekaniwaru'ɨitɨani 'ukirawetsixi memɨwareyetuirienikɨ.   
\c 12  
\s1 Kakuwu 'umierieku meta Pekuru kemɨranutahɨiya  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'ana Herurexi mɨti'aitametɨkai mɨkɨ kwiepa, kanitsutɨani memɨyutixexeɨriwakai 'aixɨa katiwaxeiyatɨ.  
\v 2 Kakuwu Wani 'iwaya, kaniuta'aita 'ixiparakɨ mɨmierienikɨ.  
\v 3 Retimaika kememɨteyutemamawiekai huriyutsixi, mɨpaɨta 'arike Pekuru kaniuwiya. 'Ikɨ pɨtiuyɨ paa mɨkakuxaxani 'ixɨarariyari mewewiekaku.  
\v 4 Hikɨ Pekuru 'uwiyaka kanenutahɨani, kuyaxi kaniwaruhɨritɨani tamamata heimana 'ataxewime yunanaukakatɨ memi'ɨwiyanikɨ. Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari 'aye'ayu teɨteri wahɨxie mekani'atɨarienikekaitɨni Pekuru mɨmierienikɨ.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ ni'ɨwiyariekaitɨni katsariyanata. Memɨyutixexeɨriwakai mekatehayewatɨ nenewieri mepipitɨakai Kakaɨyari hetsiena mieme.   
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ kepauka Herurexi Pekuru mɨwayehanakekaitsie teɨteri wahɨxie mɨmierienikɨ, mɨkɨ tɨkaritsie Pekuru kanikutsukaitɨni yuhutatɨ kuyaxi naitsata me'uti'ukaku, meta huta tepɨayarikɨ 'akuwietɨ. Hipatɨta tehɨwemete katsariyana kitenie hɨxie mekanihɨkaitɨni.  
\v 7 Yapauka Ti'aitame niukieya tuayame mana kaniutakeni. Kiita paitɨ pukumerɨkaxɨ. 'Akitana 'iwaka Pekuru kananutahɨtɨani mɨpaɨ rehɨawetɨ: «Xeiya kenanukukexi». Tepɨa puxɨnixɨa Pekuru mamateyatsie.  
\v 8 Mɨpaɨta niuki tuayame katinitahɨawe: «Kene'atikemaritɨa meta 'akakaitsie keneukexɨa». Mɨpaɨ pɨtiuyuri. Mɨpaɨta katinitahɨawe: «'A'ɨkarikɨ kenanayuku'eimaka kenenanuweiya».   
\p
\v 9 Pekuru 'utɨmana kaneyani, 'atsikatimaitɨ xɨka yuritɨkaitɨni niuki tuayame kemɨtiyurienekai. Heinɨtsika xeikɨa 'erietɨ.  
\v 10 Xeimetsie meri mekaniuyekɨne, hutariekata tehɨwemete wa'aurie, tepɨa 'itupariyaritsie meuwietsie mekaniye'axɨani kiekari muyenenatsie. 'Itupari yɨkɨmana kaneuyepiere wahetsiemieme. Mana xeime kayetsie me'anuyenexɨaka. Yapauka niuki tuayame kaneyani yuxaɨtame 'iku'eirieka.   
\p
\v 11 Hikɨ Pekuru yutamaixɨaka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Hikɨrixɨa yurikɨ nepɨretima Ti'aitame yuniuki tuayame meyenɨ'a mɨnetsitawikweitsitɨanikɨ, Herurexi mɨkanetsimienikɨ meta huriyutsixi yunaitɨ kememɨteta'ikwewakai».   
\p
\v 12 Hikɨ kepauka mɨpaɨ mɨretima, Mariya kie kaninuani Wani Marikuxi mɨtitewa maamaya. Muwa yumɨiretɨ mekaniyuxeɨriekaitɨni meyunenewietɨ.  
\v 13 Takwa 'utiwetɨ 'itupari kaneyuitɨani. 'Ɨimari Xute mɨtitewakai kaneyani hei'enimieka.  
\v 14 Pekuru mɨniukieyatɨkaikɨ heitimaika, waɨkawa kaniyukatemawieni kareuyepieka kaniutanautsa yu'utɨma pɨta. Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutaxatɨani:  
\p —Pekuru kitenie petiwe.   
\p
\v 15 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Yakɨ pekaniutaineni.  
\p Matsi mɨkɨ pehɨkɨ, mɨkɨ katiniwakɨhɨawekaitɨni. Mɨkɨta mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni:  
\p —Niuki tuayameya kaneyɨaneni.   
\p
\v 16 Matsi Pekuru pɨkatihayewakai 'itupari heuyuitɨwatɨ. Kepaukake memɨteheuyepi mekanixeiya, mekaniuhɨxiyani.  
\v 17 Pekuru yumamakɨ kaniwaru'inɨaritɨani kayuwatɨ memɨtamarekɨ, katiniwarutahekɨatɨani Ti'aitame katsariyanata kemɨtiwayewitɨ. Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kakuwu meta ta'iwamarixi xeketeniwaretahekɨatɨa kemɨtiuyɨ hepaɨtsita.  
\p 'Anuyeyaka xaɨtsie kaneyani.   
\p
\v 18 Hikɨ 'ukatareku kuyaxi yemekɨ mekaniyuxamurietɨwekaitɨni keri tiuyunixɨ Pekuru me'utiyuatɨ.  
\v 19 Herurexi heikuwauka pɨkaheitaxei. 'Ayumieme kaniwaruta'iwawiya tehɨwemete, katini'aitakaitɨni memɨkwi'iwakɨ. Hikɨ Herurexi Kureya heyeyaka Tsetsareyatsie yapaɨmexɨa mana kaniukateitɨni.   
\s1 Herurexi kemɨtiumɨ  
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ Herurexi Tiru kiekatari meta Tsiruni kiekatari wahetsiemieme pɨha'akai, mɨkɨ matsi mete'utaxataka hetsɨana mekaniu'axɨani, Puratsitu me'itihamikutaka kemɨ'ane kwiepa ti'aitame kiita mɨhɨritɨariekai, 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiyanikɨ mekanitawawirieni, wakwieyari mɨra'aitatsie mɨrawiyakaikɨ yu'ikwaite memɨtehexeiyanikɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Tukari ma'inɨaritakaitsie Herurexi ti'aitame 'aixɨa tiyukemaritɨaka, yu'uweniesie kanayerɨni, teɨteri wahɨxie katiniutaxata.  
\v 22 Teɨteri mɨpaɨ mekateniuhiwakaitɨni: «Tewi pɨka'utaine, kakaɨyari putaine».  
\v 23 'Ana yapauka Ti'aitame niukieya tuayame katinikwinitɨani, Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita 'aixɨa mɨka'utainekaikɨ, hikɨ Herurexi 'utakwitsieka kaniumɨni.   
\p
\v 24 Peru Ti'aitame niukieya naitsarie pɨ'enieriekai mepɨtamɨirirɨmekai.   
\p
\v 25 Kepauka Werunawe meta Tsauru yu'uximayatsika memaye'atɨa, Kerutsareme mekanakunuaxɨani, Wani me'awitɨtɨ Marikuxi mɨtitewakai.   
\c 13  
\s1 Werunawe meta Tsauru kememɨte'utateutɨarie  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'Anutiyukiyatsie memɨyutixexeɨriwakai hipatɨ Kakaɨyari niukametemama mekanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni meta mekateni'ɨkitametetɨkaitɨni Werunawe, Tsimuni Nikeri mɨtitewakai, Rutsiyu tsirenetanaka, Manaheni ti'aitame Herurexi hamatɨa memutiwawerixɨ meta Tsauru.  
\v 2 Mexi'akuxi mɨkɨ mana me'u'uwakai meyuhakietɨ meta Ti'aitame 'uximayatsikayatsie yameteyurietɨ, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Nehetsiemieme xekeniwarupata Werunawe meta Tsauru, mɨpaɨ memɨte'uximayakakɨ kenemɨtiwatahɨawe».   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ me'uyuhakieka mekaniyutanenewieni waheima me'utimetɨ, mekaniwarutateutɨani.   
\s1 Nɨ'ariekate Tsipɨretsie kememɨtekuxatakai  
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ Werunawe meta Tsauru 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata kaniwarewitɨni, Tsereutsiyatsie mekaniye'axɨani, manata Tsipɨre paitɨ kanuwa 'amɨpatsie mekanekɨne.  
\v 5 Tsaramina me'u'axɨaka Kakaɨyari niukieya mekanikuxatakaitɨni huriyutsixi watukiteta. Meta Wani mepa'iniekai mɨwaparewiekakɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Hapa kwie mɨyematsie Papuxi paitɨ mekaniuyekɨne. Mana xeime huriyu mɨtiyukewaiya mekaniutaxeiya, ti'itawatɨ mɨtixaxatametɨkai, Waxiketsutsi mutitewakai,  
\v 7 mɨkɨ Tserikiyu Pauru mɨtitewakai hetsɨa kaniukateitɨni. Kuwexinaruri mɨrakumate, Werunawe meta Tsauru katiniwarutanɨ'airieni, Kakaɨyari niukieya kani'enimɨkɨkaitɨni.  
\v 8 Peru mɨkɨ tiyukewaiyame 'Erimatsi (kɨriyekutsixi waniukikɨ panuyɨne) wahepaɨtsita kani'uxiwa'akaitɨni kanikununuitɨwakaitɨni kemɨ'ane kwiepa mɨhɨritɨariekai yuri mɨkatita'erienikɨ.  
\v 9 Hikɨ Tsauru, Papuru mɨtitewa meta, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ hɨnetɨ, 'ixeiyatɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\v 10 «Kari 'ekɨ pepɨhɨne naime 'irɨmarikɨ meta 'axamɨti'anekɨ. Kauyumarie nu'aya pekanihɨkɨtɨni, naime mɨtiheitserie pekanaye'unieka, ¿pekatihayewa 'ekɨ pe'itunatɨ Ti'aitame huyeya mɨxexeurawi?  
\v 11 Hikɨ Ti'aitame yumamakɨ 'axapɨmetsiyurieni. Pekaheunieretɨ pekanayeimɨkɨ tau hekɨariyaya pekaxeiyatɨ yapaɨmexɨa».  
\p Yapauka puku'etɨrixɨ meta pukuyɨrixɨ hetsiena. Kumenetɨ xeime kanikuwaunekaitɨni menuhanakɨ.  
\v 12 Mɨpaɨ tiuniereka kuwexinaruri yuri katiniuta'erieni, Ti'aitame 'ɨkitsikaya hepaɨtsita kanihɨxiyakaitɨni.   
\s1 Papuru meta Werunawe 'Anutiyukiya Pitsiriya kwieyaritsie kememɨtekuxatakai  
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ Papuru meta hamatɨana memu'uwakai Papuxitsie mekanekɨne, Perɨke Pamɨpiriya kwieyaritsie mekaniye'axɨani. Wani mana kananayeyani wahamatɨa 'uyeikatɨ, yu'ɨtɨma pɨta Kerutsareme kaneyani.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨtsɨ Perɨke mekaniyekɨne, 'Anutiyukiyatsie Pitsiriya kwieyaritsie mekaniu'axɨani. 'Uxipiya tukaritsie huriyutsixi watukita meheutahaxɨaka muwa mekanayaxe.  
\v 15 'Utiterɨwarieku 'inɨari xapayari meta Kakaɨyari niukametemama waxapayari, tukita te'aitamete niuki mekanenɨ'ani wahetsɨa mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Ta'iwama xɨka niuki xehexeiyani teɨteri xemɨwaparewienikɨ, xeketeneutaxata».   
\p
\v 16 Papuru 'anukukeka yumamakɨ waru'inɨaritɨaka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Neuxei xekeneu'enana 'ixaheritsixi, xeme meta xemɨkahuriyutsixi Kakaɨyari xemayemakaxe:  
\v 17 'Ikɨ 'Ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari wakakaɨyari kaniwaranuyeteɨxɨ tatutsima. Teɨteri wahetsiemieme 'aixɨa pɨtiuyuri kepauka ku'uwamete 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie. Yɨtɨrɨkariyakɨ kaniwarayewitɨni mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie.  
\v 18 Huta tewiyari wiyari yakɨtɨtɨ katiniwamikwakaitɨni makumawetsie me'u'uwakaku.  
\v 19 Manata 'atahutame nuiwariyari waruka'unaka Kanani kwieyaritsie kaniwayetuirieni wakwie mɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ.  
\v 20 'Ikɨ naitɨ nauka tsienituyari heimana huta tewiyari heimana tamamata wiyari katineutere.  
\p »Manaketa 'itsɨkate kaniwarupitɨani Tsamuheri tixaxatame hɨkɨtɨkaku.  
\v 21 Hikɨ 'ana kwiepa ti'aitame mekanitawawirieni. Kakaɨyari kaniwayetuirieni Tsauri Tsixi nu'aya Wenikamini nuiwarieyatsie mieme. Huta tewiyari wiyari 'anukayaku  
\v 22 Kakaɨyari kanipata. Rawiri pɨta kananukakeni, kwiepa ti'aitame mayanikɨ wahetsiemieme. Mɨpaɨ katiniutahekɨata hepaɨtsitana: “Rawiri Kitsahi nu'aya nekaniutaxeiya, tewi kenemɨre 'iyari hepaɨ yatikamieme. Naime kemɨnetinake yakatiniyuriemɨkɨ”.   
\p
\v 23 »'Ikɨ nuiwarieyatsie, Kakaɨyari kemainekai 'ixaheritsixi wawikweitsitɨwame Ketsutsi kaneyenɨ'ani.  
\v 24 Meripaitɨ mɨkɨ 'akuxi kanuawekaku, Wani katiniwahekɨatɨakaitɨni yunaime 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari metehayewatɨ 'axakemɨteyurie memɨka'ɨyarienikɨ.  
\v 25 Kepauka Wani yu'uximayatsika nɨximetɨ, mɨpaɨ kaniutainekaitɨni: “¿Kexeteku'eriwa kemɨ'ane nepɨhɨkɨ? Netsɨ nepɨkahɨkɨ. Kamɨ xewitɨ ne'utɨma 'upamie. Ne 'aixɨa nepɨkatiuka'iyari nehetsie mɨtinakenikɨ meta kakaiteya nemenuyehunieriexɨanikɨ”.   
\p
\v 26 »Neuxei 'iwamarixi, 'Apɨrahami xemɨxiɨyarimama, meta xeme xemɨkahuriyutsixi Kakaɨyari xehayemakatɨ xemu'uwa, xehetsiemieme peyenɨ'arie 'ikɨ niuki kexemɨtetawikweitsitɨarieni manuyɨne.  
\v 27 Kerutsareme memɨtama meta wakuwexinarurima Ketsutsi mepɨkahetima, 'ayumieme mepɨkaheye'atɨa Kakaɨyari niukametemama waniuki 'uxipiya tukaritsie mutiterɨwarɨwakai, matsi mepeye'atɨa mɨkɨ niuki me'enutahɨatɨ.  
\v 28 Tsepanetɨ tixaɨtɨ memɨkate'ukaxei hetsiena, Piratu mekaniutawawirieni mɨmierienikɨ.  
\v 29 Mete'aye'atɨaka naime hepaɨtsitana kemɨre'ukai, kuruxitsie me'ekaxɨnaka teukiyapa mekaneikateuku.  
\v 30 Peru Kakaɨyari mɨkite watsata kanenukuketɨani.  
\v 31 Mɨixa tukari mɨkɨ hamatɨana Karereyatsie memɨyekɨ Kerutsareme paitɨ mepɨye'axɨa, mɨkɨ mekanihɨkɨtɨni. Memunenierixɨ hikɨ mekanihekɨatani teɨteri wahɨxie.   
\p
\v 32 »Tameta niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne xeme tepɨxekuxaxatɨwa, mɨpaɨ mɨtiuyɨkɨ tatutsima kemɨtiwarutahɨawekai.  
\v 33 Kakaɨyari Ketsutsi 'anukuketɨaka mɨpaɨ pɨraye'atɨa tame temɨnuiwarimama. Mɨpaɨta hutarieka mieme Nɨawari Xapayaritsie mɨpaɨ pɨre'uxa:  
\q1 »“'Ekɨ neniwe pekanihɨkɨtɨni,  
\q2 hikɨ nekameniutinuiwitɨani”.   
\m
\v 34 Kakaɨyari penukuketɨa mɨkite watsata, hatsuakuri tawarita mɨkatapɨnekɨ. Mɨpaɨ katinaye'ani 'ikɨ niuki:  
\q1 »“Ne 'aixɨa nekanixeyurimɨkɨ xemɨpatsiekakɨ yurikɨ Rawiri kenemɨtiutahɨawixɨ”.   
\m
\v 35 'Ayumieme xeime kwikaritsie mɨpaɨ paine:  
\q1 »“Kemɨ'ane 'ahetsiemieme pemipataxɨ, mɨkɨ pepɨkapitɨani mɨtapɨnekɨ”.   
\p
\v 36 »Hikɨ Rawiri yatiuyurieka yunuiwarima wahetsiemieme, Kakaɨyari kemɨtinake kemɨtiyɨkɨhɨawekai, Rawiri kaniumɨni, yututsima wahamatɨa kaniukateukieni, waiyarieya kaniutapɨne.  
\v 37 Peru mɨkɨ matsi kemɨ'ane Kakaɨyari menukuketɨa, mɨkɨ yuwaiyaritsie pɨka'utapɨnixɨ.   
\p
\v 38 »'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika xeme ne'iwama, Ketsutsi hetsiemieme mɨpaɨ tepɨtexehekɨatɨa, tita 'axaxemɨteyurie xemɨteheuyehɨwiyarienikɨ,  
\v 39 'aitsika Muitsexi hetsɨa mieme pɨka'ɨyɨwekaxɨa 'aixɨa mɨxeyurienikɨ 'axaxeteyuriekaku, peru yunaitɨ Ketsutsi hetsie yuri memɨte'erie 'aixɨa mekani'itɨarieka.  
\v 40 Yumarima 'aixɨa Kakaɨyari niukametemama kememaitɨkatei mɨpaɨ tiuyɨni:   
\q1
\v 41 »“Neuxei teyukatawe'eriekate.  
\q2 Xekenemamaka meta xekenekwi'ini.  
\q1 Kenemɨtiyurieni ne mexixe'u'uwa,  
\q2 xeme hatsuaku yuri xepɨkateta'erieni,  
\q2 tsepanetɨ xewitɨ mɨtixe'utahekɨatɨa”».   
\p
\v 42 Hikɨ huriyutsixi watukiiteta me'ayenexɨaka, mɨkɨ mekaniwarutawawirieni 'ikɨ niuki memɨkuxatanikɨ tawarita 'uxipiya tukaritsie.  
\v 43 Mete'utahayewaku xeɨripa, yumɨiretɨ huriyutsixi meta waɨkawa memɨte'ayexeiyakai Papuru meta Werunawe mekaniwareweiya, mɨkɨ mekaniwatuikakaitɨni yuri mete'erietɨ memuyuhayewanikɨ Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa tiuka'iyarikaku wahetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 44 Hikɨ tawarita 'uxipiya tukaritsie yunaitɨ kiekatari mekaniyukuxeɨrieni Kakaɨyari niukieya memɨ'enienikɨ.  
\v 45 Huriyutsixi mewaruxeiyaka mɨkɨ memɨyukuxeɨri yɨmɨireme, mekaniwaruti'uxiwe'erieni. Papuru niukieya hepaɨtsita 'axamekaniutiyuanekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 46 Papuru meta Werunawe mɨpaɨ mekateniwaruta'eiya mekamamatɨ: «Peuyewekai xeme meri Kakaɨyari niukieya temɨxetaxatɨanikɨ. Xeme xepɨka'itanaki'eri, tukari mɨkaxɨwe xehetsie mɨtinakenikɨ. 'Ayumiemeri 'ikɨ, memɨkatanuiwari wahetsɨa tekaniyehuni.  
\v 47 Mɨpaɨ Ti'aitame pɨtatiuta'aitɨa:  
\q1 »“Ne hekɨariwiwame nepɨmatsi'ayeitɨa nuiwarite wahetsiemieme,  
\q2 Pemɨwatawikweitsitɨanikɨ naitsarie kwie manunieretsie paitɨ”».   
\p
\v 48 Hikɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi me'i'enieka mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni. 'Aixɨa mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni Kakaɨyari niukieya hepaɨtsita. Yunaitɨ tukari mɨkaxɨwe memupitɨariekɨ yuri mete'uta'erieka.   
\p
\v 49 Mɨkɨ kwiepa naitsarie Ti'aitame niukieya pɨ'enieriekai.  
\v 50 Huriyutsixi mepɨwarutaxamuri 'ukari memɨtehayexeiyakai memɨmariwakai, kiekatari memanuyetei yukwiepa Papuru meta Werunawe mekaniwarayeweiya.  
\v 51 Mɨkɨ mekaneikatsixɨani tumuanari yu'ɨkatetsie 'inɨari meyurietɨ wahepaɨtsita, 'Ikuniyu pɨta mekanekɨne.  
\v 52 Teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete waɨkawa mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ mekanihɨpɨnekaitɨni.   
\c 14  
\s1 Papuru meta Werunawe 'Ikuniyutsie kememɨte'uyuri  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'Ikuniyutsie Papuru meta Werunawe mekaneutahaxɨani huriyutsixi watukita kememɨte'iyamakai, muwa mekatenikuxatakaitɨni, 'ayumieme yuri mekateniuta'erieni yumɨiretɨ huriyutsixi meta kɨriyekutsixi.  
\v 2 Huriyutsixi yuri memɨkate'eriekai mepɨwarukunuitɨa mepɨwahaxɨatɨakai mɨkɨ memɨkahuriyutsixitɨkai ta'iwama wahepaɨtsita.  
\v 3 Mɨkɨ matsi mɨixa 'amepɨtitekai mekamamatɨ Ti'aitame hetsɨa memɨmiemetetɨkaikɨ. 'Iya katinihekɨatakaitɨni niuki 'aixɨa kemɨtiuka'iyari manuyɨne hepaɨtsita. Pɨwarupitɨaxɨa yumamakɨ 'inɨari mamariwaweme memɨteyurienikɨ.  
\v 4 Hikɨ kiekatari hixɨata mepɨyutsanaxɨ: hipatɨ huriyutsixi wahetsie mekateniwiyakaitɨni, hipatɨta nɨ'ariekate wahetsie mepɨtewiyakai.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ memɨkahuriyutsixitɨkai huriyutsixi wahamatɨa wa'ukiyarima wahamatɨa mekanitsutɨani 'axamewayuriekutɨ mewatuaxikutɨ.  
\v 6 Nɨ'ariekate yametehetimaika, mekaniyuta'una kiekaritetsie Ritsitɨratsie meta Rerɨwetsie mana hurawa Rikahuniya kwieyaritsie.  
\v 7 Mana mepu'uwakai niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne mekuxatatɨ.   
\s1 Papuru Ritsitɨratsie kemɨreutituaxiexɨa  
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ tewi Ritsitɨratsie pekatei nunutsiyari paitɨ ka'uyeiwetɨ mutinuiwaxɨ. Muwa kaniutikateitɨni,  
\v 9 Papuru tikuxatame kani'eniekaitɨni. Mɨkɨ 'ixeiyatɨ, yatimaitɨ yuri mɨti'eriekaikɨ 'aixɨa tiuyeikatɨ mayanikɨ,  
\v 10 karima mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenanukukexi, 'a'ɨkate keneutixutsera.  
\p Mɨkɨ kaniutitsuna, kuyeikatɨ kanayani.  
\v 11 Teɨteri me'ixeiyaka Papuru kemɨtiuyuri, me'utihiwatɨ rikahuniyatari waniukikɨ, mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Kakaɨyarixi tahetsɨa mepu'axɨa teɨteri wahepaɨ meteyuxexeiyatɨ.   
\p
\v 12 Werunawe Tsehuxi mepute'uterɨwaxɨ, meta Papuru 'Eximetsi mɨkɨmeri niuki mukuxatakaikɨ.  
\v 13 Kupiteri tukieya kiekari 'aurie manuwe, mawari wewiwameya turutsixi kaniwa'atɨani wa'awate xuturiyatɨkaime kitenietsie kaniuku'uitɨani. Teɨteri yumɨireme wahɨxie, mɨkɨ mawari kaniwaweriemɨkɨkaitɨni.   
\p
\v 14 Me'u'enanaka nɨ'ariekate Werunawe meta Papuru, yu'ixuriki metitsanatɨ me'unautsaxɨaximetɨ mekaniu'axɨani teɨteri wahetsɨa me'utihiwatɨ, mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:   
\p
\v 15 —Xeme teɨteri 'aku ¿titayari mɨpaɨ xeteyurie? Tame xehepaɨ tekaniteɨteritɨni, xehepaɨ tekateniu'iyarini. Niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne temɨxekuxaxatɨwa xemɨtehayewakɨ yakɨ xeikɨa xemɨteyurie, Kakaɨyari mayeyuritsie xemɨtewiyanikɨ. Mɨkɨ muyuawi, kwie meta haramara putiwewi, meta naime wahetsie memɨtexuawetɨka.  
\v 16 Meripaitɨ xeteɨterima mepɨwarupitɨa nuiwarite yuhuye memanukuweiyakɨ.  
\v 17 Tsiere pɨkayuhayewakai kaheixeiyatɨ kemɨ'ane mitahekɨatake. 'Aixɨa katiniyurienekaitɨni, wiyeri muyuawitsie mieme pɨtatsipitɨakai, meta 'ikwaxi puxuaweriyakai. Xe'iyari muyutemawiekakɨ xetekwakaku.   
\p
\v 18 Mɨpaɨ me'utiyuaka hawerimiemete xeikɨa mekaniwarukunuitɨani, teɨteri mawari memɨkawawewirienikɨ.   
\p
\v 19 Hikɨ huriyutsixi mana mekaniu'axɨani 'Anutiyukiyatsie meta 'Ikuniyutsie meheyekɨneka. Teɨteri mekaniwarukunuitɨani. Papuru mekaniutituaxixɨani. Mekaneihana kiekari tetsie mɨkime me'erietɨ.  
\v 20 Teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete 'auriena mehaketɨkɨneku, kananukukeni. Kiekaritsie kaneyani. 'Uxa'ariekata Werunawe hamatɨa Rerɨwe mekanekɨne.   
\s1 'Anutiyukiya Tsiriya kwieyaritsie kememɨte'u'axɨa  
\p
\v 21 Mana niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne mekaniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni kiekatari, yuwaɨkawame mekateniwa'ɨkitɨakaitɨni. 'Ariketa me'akunuaxɨaka, Ritsitɨratsie, 'Ikuniyutsie meta 'Anutiyukiyatsie meniuyekɨne.  
\v 22 Teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete wa'iyari mekaniutuikaxɨani metewakuxaxatɨwatɨ para yuri mete'erietɨ memɨyuhayewanikɨ, mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Peuyewetse waɨkawa te'uximatɨarieme temeutahaxɨanikɨ Kakaɨyari mɨra'aitatsie».  
\v 23 Naitsarie memɨyutixexeɨriwatsie wa'ukiyarima mekananayexeiyarieni. Meyutanenewieka me'uyuhakieka mepihɨritɨa Ti'aitame, mɨkɨ yuri memɨte'uta'erikɨ hetsiena.   
\p
\v 24 Hikɨ Pitsiriya kwieyaritsie me'uyekɨneka, Pamɨpiriya kwieyaritsie paitɨ mekaniu'axɨani.  
\v 25 Mete'utahayewaka niuki me'utaxataka Perɨketsie, 'Atahariyatsie mekaneukayune.   
\p
\v 26 Mana kanuwa 'amɨpatsie mekanekɨne 'Anutiyukiyatsie paitɨ hakewa memayenɨ'arie Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyarinikɨ wahetsiemieme, memɨte'uximayakakɨ kememɨteheye'atɨa.  
\v 27 Me'u'axɨaka mekaniwarukuxeɨrieni memɨyutixexeɨriwa. Mekateniwarutaxatɨani kehepaɨ mɨreyuriekai Kakaɨyari wahamatɨa 'uyeikatɨ, mɨpaɨta yuri mekateneta'erieni nuiwarite memɨkahuriyutsixi.  
\v 28 Mɨkɨ teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete wahetsɨa mɨixa tukari mana mekaneyuhayewa.   
\c 15  
\s1 Kerutsaremetsie kememɨte'uyu'eni  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ hipatɨ Kureya meheyekɨneka mekateniwa'ɨkitɨakaitɨni ta'iwama mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Xeme xɨka xitekiyakɨ xeka'u'inɨaritɨarieni kemaine Muitsexi yeiyarieya, xepɨkayɨwawe xemɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ».  
\v 2 Papuru meta Werunawe yemekɨ mekaniniukixiekaitɨni mɨiremekɨ wahepaɨtsita. 'Aixɨa mekaniyurieni Papuru Werunawe hamatɨa meta hipatɨ yuri memɨte'erie mɨkɨ yunaitɨ Kerutsareme mekanekɨne, nɨ'ariekate meta 'ukirawetsixi wahetsɨa 'ikɨ niuki hepaɨtsita memɨtehetixatakɨ.  
\v 3 Mana memɨyutixexeɨriwakai mepɨwarenɨ'a. Penitsiyatsie meta Tsamariyatsie mepuyekɨ metekuxatatɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi wahepaɨtsita kename yuri mete'uta'eriwakai. Mɨkɨ niuki me'enietɨ yuri memɨte'erie 'iwamarixi waɨkawamekɨ mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni.  
\v 4 Kerutsareme me'uta'axɨaku, mana memɨyutixexeɨriwakai, nɨ'ariekate meta 'ukirawetsixi yunaitɨ mekaniwarutanaki'erieni. Memɨtewarutaxatɨakɨ naime Kakaɨyari kemɨtiyurienekai wahamatɨa 'uyeikatɨ.   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ hipatɨ paritseutsixi wahepaɨ memɨteku'eriwakai mekananuku'uni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Peuyewetse memɨkahuriyutsixi temɨwata'aitɨanikɨ memɨ'inɨaritɨarienikɨ xitekiyakɨ, 'inɨari niukiyari Muitsexi 'aitsikayatsie yamemɨtekahunikɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ nɨ'ariekate meta 'ukirawetsixi mekaniyukuxeɨrieni 'aixɨa meteyurienike 'ikɨ niuki hepaɨtsita.  
\v 7 Waɨkawa niuki mexɨatɨakaku, Pekuru 'anukukeka mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei 'iwamarixi, xeme mɨpaɨ xepɨtemate, Kakaɨyari meripaitɨ pɨnetsi'anayexei xetsata, mɨkɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne memi'enienikɨ ne ne'utaniukakaku, mɨkɨkɨ memɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ.  
\v 8 Kakaɨyari ta'iyari mɨmatekɨ katiniwarutahekɨatɨani wapitɨatɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata tame tahepaɨ.  
\v 9 Yɨkɨ katatixeiyatɨ mɨkɨ meta tame. Yuri mete'uta'erieku wa'iyaritsie kaniwaru'itieni.  
\v 10 Hikɨ kamɨtsɨ, ¿ketitayari Kakaɨyari xete'inɨatatɨwe, yuyeiyari xetewaranuyetekirie teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete turutsixi kwietsanamete wahepaɨ? Tatutsima meta tameta tepɨtatexiekai yuku temanuyetenikɨ.  
\v 11 Matsi Ti'aitame Ketsutsi 'aixɨa tiuka'iyarikaku tame yuri tepɨte'erie temɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ.   
\p
\v 12 Hikɨ yunaitɨ muwa memuyuxeɨriekai kayuwatɨ meputamarixɨ, memɨwa'enienikɨ Werunawe meta Papuru metehekɨatame 'inɨari mamariwaweme Kakaɨyari kemɨtiyurienekai memɨkahuriyutsixi watsata mɨkɨ metekuxatakaku.  
\v 13 Mete'utahayewaka metekuxatatɨ, Kakuwu mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Ne'iwamarixi xekeneneu'eni.  
\v 14 Tsimuni katiniutahekɨata Kakaɨyari meripaitɨ kemɨtiyuwaɨri menuyexeiyakɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi watsata hetsɨana memɨmiemetetɨnikɨ.  
\v 15 Yaxeikɨa paine Kakaɨyari niukametemama waniuki, mɨpaɨ kemɨre'utɨarie hepaɨ:   
\q1
\v 16 »“'Arike mana nepɨnuani,  
\q2 Rawiri kiiya nepɨtawewieni mu'unikai.  
\q1 Kɨyexiyari mana meutihe naime nepanuku'uitɨani,  
\q2 nepitseiriya,   
\q1
\v 17 teɨteri memɨyuhayewa Ti'aitame memukuwaunikɨ,  
\q2 yunaitɨ nuiwarite nemɨwaranayexei nehetsɨa memɨmiemetetɨnikɨ.   
\q1
\v 18 Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ paine”  
\q2 matsiɨkɨme meyeitɨa 'ikɨ matɨari paitɨ.   
\p
\v 19 »'Ayumieme ne mɨpaɨ nepɨtiku'eriwa, tepɨkawa'uximatɨaka mɨkɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi Kakaɨyaritsie yuri memɨte'uta'erikɨ.  
\v 20 Matsi 'aixɨa pɨyɨni temɨtewata'utɨirienikɨ memɨyukweriwayuriekakɨ, tita kakaɨyarixi memɨtemawiyarie mɨkɨ hepaɨtsita, memɨkawakumaɨwanikɨ mɨkayɨ'ɨya mɨkayɨkɨna, 'ukawiyayu waiyarieya hepaɨtsita memɨyukweriwayuriekakɨ meta xuriya memɨkakwa'anikɨ.  
\v 21 'Iya Muitsexi meripaitɨ hikɨke pɨwarexeiya mɨkɨ memitahekɨata kiekari mukumanetsie watukiteta yamemɨte'ititerɨwa 'uxipiya tukaritsie.   
\s1 Memɨyutixexeɨriwa metehaka'utɨaka mekaneinɨ'ani  
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ nɨ'ariekate meta 'ukirawetsixi wahamatɨa yunaitɨ memɨyutixexeɨriwakai wahamatɨa 'aixɨa 'anekame mekani'eriekaitɨni yutsata memɨwaranuyexeiyakɨ hipame, memɨwaranunɨ'anikɨ 'Anutiyukiya paitɨ Papuru meta Werunawe wahamatɨa. Mekaniwaranuyexeiya Kura Warɨtsawaxi mɨtitewakai, meta Tsiraxi. Mɨkɨ mepɨte'aitametetɨkai yu'iwama watsata.  
\v 23 Mɨpaɨ mete'u'utɨaka xapatsie mekaneinɨ'ani:  
\pmo Nɨ'ariekate meta 'ukirawetsixi 'iwamarixi,  
\pmo Tekanixewaɨritɨaka,  
\pmo meta ta'iwamarixi xemɨkahuriyutsixi 'Anutiyukiyatsie, Tsiriyatsie meta Tsiritsiyatsie xemɨtama.   
\b  
\pm
\v 24 Tepu'enana kename hipatɨ tahetsɨa miemete mexexamurietɨwekai yuniukikɨ xe'iyari meyuitɨatɨwetɨ mexe'aitɨatɨ xemɨyu'inɨaritɨanikɨ xitekiyakɨ, 'inɨari niukiyaritsie yaxemɨtekahunikɨ. Tame tepɨkatewa'aitɨa.  
\v 25 Hikɨ, 'axeikɨa te'uta'enieka temɨwaranayexeiyakɨ hipame 'iwamarixi xehetsɨa temɨwaranunɨ'anikɨ Werunawe meta Papuru temɨwanaki'erie wahamatɨa.  
\v 26 Mɨkɨ yutukari mekaniyetuakaitɨni Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu Tati'aitɨwame hetsɨa memɨmiemetekɨ.  
\v 27 'Ayumieme, tepɨwarenɨ'a Kura meta Tsiraxi. Mɨkɨta yuniukikɨ yaxeikɨa mepɨtexehekɨatɨani.  
\v 28 'Aixɨa pɨtiyurie, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata, meta tame waɨriyarika temɨkaxepitɨakakɨ, 'ikɨ hepaɨtsita kemɨreuyewetse:  
\v 29 xemɨka'ikwakakɨ tita kakaɨyarixi memɨtemawiyarie, xuriya, mukawiya waiyarieya, kemɨ'ane mɨkaxe'ɨya mɨkaxekɨna xemɨkawakumaɨwanikɨ. Xeme xɨka mɨkɨ xeka'umayɨani, 'aixɨa xepɨyɨaka.  
\pmc Mɨpaɨ xeikɨa kani'aneni.   
\p
\v 30 Hikɨ mɨkɨ memeyenɨ'arie 'Anutiyukiyatsie mekaniu'axɨani. Yunaime mewarukuxeɨrieka xapa mekaniyetuani.  
\v 31 'Iwamarixi me'itaterɨwaka mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni memɨtuikariekaikɨ.  
\v 32 Kura meta Tsiraxi Kakaɨyari niukametemama mekanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni, waɨkawa metekuxatatɨ mekaniwatuikakaitɨni yu'iwama, mekaniwatseiriyakaitɨni.  
\v 33-34 Yapaɨmexɨa tukari me'uyurieka, yu'iwama wahetsɨa mekanekɨne 'aixɨa metewaxeiyatɨ. Mɨkɨ memɨwareyenɨ'a wahetsɨa mekaniu'axɨani.\f + \fr 15:33-34 \ft RV60 meta hipatɨ mepenanɨitɨa \fq Matsi Tsiraxi kaniyuwaɨriyakaitɨni mana muyuhayewakɨ.\f*  
\v 35 Papuru meta Werunawe 'Anutiyukiyatsie mekaniuyuhayewa mete'ɨkitatɨ, Ti'aitame niukieya 'aixɨa manuyɨne mekuxatatɨ meta hipame yumɨireme wahamatɨa.   
\s1 Papuru meta Werunawe kememɨkateyu'eniexɨa  
\p
\v 36 Hikɨ yapaɨmexɨa tukari 'anukayaku, Papuru Werunawe mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Kɨmɨtsɨari hutarieka tepɨyehu, ta'iwamarixi tepɨwa'iwatayu naime kiekaritetsie hakewa Ti'aitame niukieya temetaxatsie, kemetehe'uwa tepɨwaxeiyayu».  
\v 37 Werunawe Wani Marikuxi mɨtitewakai kani'iniekaitɨni.  
\v 38 Papuru hepaɨtsita 'aixɨa pɨka'anekai memenuwitɨnikɨ mɨwareku'eiriekaikɨ Pamɨpiriyatsie, wahamatɨa mɨkahetɨakɨ mɨti'uximayakakɨ.  
\v 39 'Ayumieme mepɨka'uyu'eniexɨa, mepautayeixɨa yuxexuitɨ. Werunawe Marikuxi hawitɨtɨ kanuwa 'amɨpatsie Tsipɨre paitɨ mekanekɨne.  
\v 40 Matsi Papuru Tsiraxi 'anayexeiyaka kaneyani. Ta'iwamaxi Ti'aitame mekaniuhɨritɨani 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyarinikɨ mɨkɨ hetsiemieme.  
\v 41 Tsiriyatsie meta Tsiritsiyatsie puyetɨa watuikatɨ mana memɨyutixexeɨriwakai.   
\c 16  
\s1 Timuteu Papuru meta Tsiraxi kemɨtiwarutinɨi  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Papuru Rerɨwe kaniye'ani meta Ritsitɨratsie, mana tiyɨ'ɨkitɨwame Timuteu titewakame pukaxei. Maamaya huriyu yuri mɨti'erie kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni, paapaya kɨriyeku tihɨkɨtɨkai.  
\v 2 'Iwamarixi ritsitɨratari meta 'ikuniyutari Timuteu 'aixɨa mekatenihekɨatakaitɨni.  
\v 3 Papuru kanita'inieni hamatɨana mɨyemiekɨ. 'Inɨari xitekiyari kaniwewirieni huriyutsixi wayeiyari kemaine, yunaitɨ memimaikaikɨ paapaya kɨriyeku mɨhɨkɨtɨkaikɨ.  
\v 4 Meku'uwatɨ kiekaritetsie mekaniwahɨritɨakaitɨni yamemɨtekahunikɨ, 'aitsikatsie kememɨte'aitakai nɨ'ariekate 'ukirawetsixi kerutsaremetari.  
\v 5 Memɨyutixexeɨriwakai mekanitɨrɨkariyariekaitɨni yuri mete'erietɨ. Tukarikɨ mekanitamɨirirɨmekaitɨni.   
\s1 Papuru yuheinɨtsita matseruniyatanaka kemɨtiuxei  
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ Pɨrikiyatsie meta Karatsiya kwieyaritsie mekaniuyekɨne. 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata pɨwaruta'imaiyakai 'Atsiyatsie niuki memɨkakuxatanikɨ.  
\v 7 Mitsiya kwieyari tetsita me'u'axɨaka Witiniyatsie mekaneuyeyunekekaitɨni. Ketsutsi 'Iyarieya pɨkawarupitɨa.  
\v 8 Mitsiya kwieyari tetsita me'uyekɨneka Tɨruhatsi paitɨ mekaneukakɨne.  
\v 9 Yɨwikɨta Papuru yuheinɨtsita tewi kaniuxeiya matseruniyatanaka, muwa 'utiwekame 'iwawiriekame mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «Kenanaye'a 'anataɨye Matseruniya paitɨ, ketaneparewieka».  
\v 10 Yuheinɨtsita tiuxeiyaka kwitɨwa tekaniyukuha'aritɨani ketemɨte'anukɨnekɨ 'anutaɨye Matseruniya paitɨ, mɨpaɨ tetehetimaika Kakaɨyari mɨtatsi'uta'ini niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne temɨwaretaxatɨanikɨ.   
\s1 Kememɨte'anutaxɨriya Piriputsie  
\p
\v 11 Hikɨ Tɨruhatsi tehekɨneka heitseriemekɨ tekaneta'axɨani Tsamutɨratsiyatsie, 'uxa'arieka Kiekari mɨhekwatsie paitɨ tekaneta'axɨani,  
\v 12 manaketa Piriputsie paitɨ tekanekɨne. Mɨkɨ kiekari 'amɨyewa kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni 'etsimɨyeyeu hetsiena mɨtiwiya Matseruniya kwieyaritsie. Xumatari kaniwakuruniyatɨkaitɨni. Yapaɨmexɨa tukari tekaniuyurieni mɨkɨ kiekaritsie.   
\p
\v 13 'Uxipiya tukaritsie kiekari tetsita paitɨ tepanuyekɨ. Mana hatɨa tetsita mɨrayutinenewitɨre puwekai. Mana tetiyaxeka 'ukarawetsixi tekateniwarutaxatɨani mana memɨyuxeɨriekai.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨ xewitɨ Ririya mɨtitewakai, Kakaɨyari kanayexeiyakaitɨni. Tiyatira kiekariyaritsie kanikiekametɨkaitɨni meta 'ixuriki mɨyɨtsikimawi kanituakaitɨni. Ti'aitame kanenutiyepieni 'iyarieya mexi mɨkɨ ta'enakai, mi'enienikɨ Papuru kemɨtikuxatakai.  
\v 15 Mɨkɨ puka'ɨyarie meta kiena kiekatari. Hikɨ kataniuta'inieni mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «Xeme xɨka Ti'aitame hetsie yuri neti'eriekame xenetsihayeitɨani, hikɨmɨ nekiita, xemayehenikɨ». Mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ waɨriyarika kataniupitɨani.   
\s1 Papuru meta Tsiraxi memanutaxɨriya  
\p
\v 16 Hikɨ mɨrayutinenewitɨre teheukɨneka, 'ɨimari waɨriyarika mɨti'uximayatame katananukunake, 'iyari 'axamɨ'ane minɨkai kɨmana mɨtimaiwekai. Mɨkɨ tikuxatatɨ kemɨtiyɨnikekai waɨkawa pɨti'iwakai yukutsiyarima wahetsiemieme.  
\v 17 Mɨkɨ pɨtatsi'uweiyakai Papuru meta tame. Putahiwakai mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Ikɨ teɨteri Kakaɨyari 'Amutewi te'uximayatsiriwamete mepɨhɨkɨ, mɨkɨ wikweitsitɨarika huyeyari xeme mepɨxekuxaxatɨwa.   
\p
\v 18 Mɨpaɨ mɨixa tukari katiniyurienekaitɨni. Hikɨ Papuru 'uxiwa'atɨ, ta'aurie 'aweka mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe 'iyari 'axamɨ'ane kaniutatieni:  
\p —Ketsutsi Kɨritsitutsie netiwiyatɨ nepɨmetsi'aitɨa, hetsiena pemayeyanikɨ.  
\p Hikɨ 'ana kwitɨwa 'iyari 'axamɨ'ane kanihayewa.   
\p
\v 19 Kepauka kutsiyarimama mɨpaɨ memɨtehetima mɨwaruku'eiriekaikɨ kɨmana memɨte'iwakai, 'ayumieme Papuru meta Tsiraxi mekaniutiwiyarieni, meta kiekari hixɨapa mepɨwarehapa hakewa 'itsɨkate memɨteha'aitatsie.  
\v 20 'Itsɨkate wahɨxie mewa'atɨaka, mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —'Ikɨ teɨteri mekanihuriyutsixitɨni, mepɨwaxamurietɨwe tahetsɨa kiekatari.  
\v 21 Yeiyari mekani'ɨkitani tame xumatari temukunamiyarie temitanaki'erieni yatɨni yatemɨteyuriekakɨ.   
\p
\v 22 Yunaitɨ mekaniyukuxeɨrieni wahepaɨtsita. 'Itsɨkate mekateniuta'aita wa'ixuriki memanutihɨniyariexɨanikɨ, meta kɨyekɨ memɨtiweiyanikɨ.  
\v 23 Waɨkawamekɨ mewarutiwaka, katsariyanata mekaniwaranutaxɨrieni, meta tihɨweme mekaniuhɨritɨani 'aixɨa mɨtiwa'ɨwiyanikɨ.  
\v 24 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ tiuta'aitɨarieka, mutanieretsie paitɨ kaniwaranutaxɨrieni. Wa'ɨkate tiyɨxɨrɨwametsie kaniuye'uitɨani.   
\p
\v 25 Hikɨ tɨkari hixɨapa yakɨtɨtɨ Papuru meta Tsiraxi meyunenewietɨ Kakaɨyari mekaninɨawakaitɨni. Wahamatɨa memanutaxɨriyakai mekaniwa'eniekaitɨni.  
\v 26 Yapauka kwie karima kaniutayuani, katsariyana tenariyari kaniutayuani. Naitɨ kiteniete pɨreuyepierixɨa. Yunaitɨ pɨretsutsixi watepɨate kanakaxɨnixɨani wamamatetsie wa'ɨkatetsie.  
\v 27 Tihɨweme 'anutaniereka, katsariyana kitenie heuyepiekame 'uxeiyaka, yunawaxa kaniwatihana yumienike, memanutaxɨriyakai meyuta'unaxɨame 'erietɨ. Papuru karima kanitahiwieni mɨpaɨ rehɨawetɨ:   
\p
\v 28 ―Penɨkahɨrixɨa peti'akwinitɨani. Tame tanaitɨ 'uwa tekanayeteni.   
\p
\v 29 Hikɨ tihɨweme kɨxeme kaniuta'iwauni, yumexuitɨatɨ kiita kaneutaweni 'uyɨyɨakatɨ. Papuru meta Tsiraxi wahetɨa kaniukaweni.  
\v 30 Takwa waranuyewitɨka mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'iwawiya:  
\p —Neuxei, ¿titari reuyewetse yanemɨtiyurienikɨ nemɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ?   
\p
\v 31 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'eiya:  
\p —Ti'aitame Ketsutsi hetsie, yuri ketineuta'eri mɨkɨkɨ pekanitawikweitsitɨariemɨkɨ 'ekɨ meta 'akie kiekatari.   
\p
\v 32 Kakaɨyari niukieya mekanitaxatɨani mɨkɨ, meta yunaime kitana memɨye'uwakai hamatɨana.  
\v 33 Mɨkɨ yɨwikɨta warewitɨka, kaniwarahauxixɨani memaweiyatɨkateitsie. Kwitɨwata puka'ɨyarie mɨkɨ, meta yunaitɨ kiena kiekatari.  
\v 34 Tihɨweme yukie warewitɨka katiniwaremini, meta yunaitɨ yuri memɨte'uta'eri Kakaɨyari hetsie 'axeikɨa yunaitɨ mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 35 Hikɨ 'ukatareku 'itsɨkate yutupiritsixi mekaniwarenɨ'ani tihɨweme mɨpaɨ memɨteta'aitɨanikɨ: «Keniwarutixɨna mɨkɨ teɨteri».  
\v 36 Hikɨ tihɨweme Papuru mɨpaɨ katiniutaxatɨani:  
\p —'Itsɨkate mɨpaɨ mekateneta'aita xemɨtixɨnarienikɨ. Hikɨtsɨari xekenehu, xeka'uximatɨarietɨ.   
\p
\v 37 Papuru tehɨwemete mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Mɨkɨ mepɨtatsi'utiwa yunaime wahɨxie tsepanetɨ 'itsɨkame mɨkatatsi'uta'iwawiyaxɨ, tsepanetɨ temɨxumanutsixi. Mepɨtatsi'anutaxɨri. Kaukatsɨari hikɨ 'awie metatsi'anuyenɨ'ani. Pɨkatixaɨtsietɨ, 'uwa me'u'axɨame, mɨkɨ meketatsi'anuyewitɨni.   
\p
\v 38 Tupiritsixi 'itsɨkate mekateniwarutaxatɨani kememetiyua. Kepauka mɨkɨ memu'enana kename Papuru meta Tsiraxi Xumanutsixi mehɨkɨtɨkai mekaniutimamani.  
\v 39 Me'u'axɨaka mekaniwanɨtɨakaitɨni, mewaranuyewitɨka mekaniwarutawawirieni memɨyehukɨ mɨkɨ kiekaritsie.  
\v 40 Hikɨ katsariyanata mewayekɨneka Ririya hetsɨa mekaniu'axɨani. Mewaruxeiyaka 'iwamarixi mekaniwatuikakaitɨni. 'Arikeketa mekanekɨne.   
\c 17  
\s1 Tetsarunikatari kememɨteyuxamuriekai  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'Amipipuritsie meta 'Apuruniyatsie me'uyekɨneka Papuru meta Tsiraxi Tetsarunikatsie paitɨ mekaneta'axɨani, huriyutsixi watuki mana kaniuwekaitɨni.  
\v 2 Papuru kemɨtiyeiyarieyatɨkai, muwa tukita kaneutahani, haikakɨa 'uxipiya tukaritsie katiniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni  
\v 3 'utɨarikatsie mieme wahekɨatɨatɨ watuikatɨ kename heuyewekai mɨkɨ Kɨritsitu heitserie mupitɨarie mɨtikwinekɨ mɨkite watsata manukukenikɨ, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «'Ikɨ nemɨxehekɨatɨa, 'ikɨ kemɨ'ane heitserie mupitɨarie Kɨritsitu kanihɨkɨtɨni».  
\v 4 Hipatɨ huriyutsixi yuri mekateniuta'erieni, Papuru meta Tsiraxi mekaniwarutinɨni, yumɨiretɨ 'ukarawetsixi waɨkawa memeuyewetse meta kɨriyekutsixi Kakaɨyari memayexeiyakai.   
\p
\v 5 Huriyutsixi yuri memɨkate'eriekai mewa'uxietɨ, hipame 'axamemɨteyurie kiekari hixɨapa memu'uwa mekaniwaruta'inieni, mewaruxeɨrieka yumɨireme kiekatari mekaniwareutaxamuriexɨani. Katsuni kiita mekateniunawani Papuru meta Tsiraxi mewawautɨwetɨ memɨwaranuhapanikɨ yumɨireme wahɨxie.  
\v 6 Memɨkawarutaxeikɨ, Katsuni meta hipame 'iwamama mepɨwarehapa 'itsɨkate wahɨxie mɨpaɨ mete'uhiwatɨ: «'Ikɨ naitsarie teɨteri mekaniwaxamurietɨweni, 'uwata mekaniu'axɨani.  
\v 7 Katsuni yukiita kaniwarupitɨani. Mɨkɨ yunaitɨ yamepɨkatekahu Tsetsaxi kemɨti'aita, mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ kename xewitɨ ti'aitame 'a'uyeika Ketsutsitɨtɨ».  
\v 8 Mɨpaɨ mete'u'enanaka, teɨteri memɨyumɨire meta 'itsɨkate kiekatari mekaniuyeha'ani,  
\v 9 Katsuni meta hipatɨ mekaniukwetatɨarieni 'uxa'atɨni warie 'atsimemɨkatiyuanikɨ, mekaniutixɨnarieni.   
\s1 Papuru meta Tsiraxi Wereyatsie kememɨtekuxatakai  
\p
\v 10 Hikɨ kwitɨwa 'ukuyɨreku teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete Papuru meta Tsiraxi mepɨwarenɨ'a Wereyatsie paitɨ. Mana me'u'axɨaka huriyutsixi watukita mekaneutahaxɨani.  
\v 11 Mana memɨtamakai huriyutsixi yemekɨ 'aixɨa mepɨte'u'iyarikai, tetsarunikatari yamekate'u'iyarikaku. Mekanitanaki'erieni niuki waɨkawa meyuwaɨriyatɨ. Tukarikɨ mekateniwautɨwekaitɨni 'utɨarika xapayaritsie, yamemɨtehetimanikɨ xɨka'aku yuritɨni kememɨtekuxatakai.  
\v 12 Yumɨiretɨ huriyutsixi yuri mekateniuta'erieni, meta yuwaɨkawatɨ kɨriyekutsixi, 'Ukarawetsixi waɨkawa memeuyewetse, meta 'ukitsi yuwaɨkawatɨ yuri mepɨte'uta'eri.   
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ kepauka memɨte'utamari huriyutsixi tetsarunikatari, kename Papuru Wereyatsie Kakaɨyari niukieya hekuxatakai. Mana mekanekɨne mewaxamurienike teɨteri yumɨireme.  
\v 14 Kwitɨwata 'iwamarixi Papuru haramara tetsita mekanitanɨ'ani mɨyemiekɨ. Tsiraxi meta Timuteu Wereyatsie mekaniyuhayewa.  
\v 15 Mɨkɨ Papuru memaweiyakai 'Atenaxi paitɨ mekaneiwitɨni. Mana mekanitinuaxɨani mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ tiwaruta'aitɨaku, Tsiraxi meta Timuteu hetsɨana memɨ'axɨanikɨ mexɨima xɨka tiyɨwenike memɨyehukɨ.   
\s1 Papuru 'Atenaxitsie kemɨtiuyeikakai  
\p
\v 16 Hikɨ Papuru wakwewietɨ 'Atenaxitsie, yu'iyaritsie kaniyɨhɨawekaitɨni waxeiyatɨ kiekaritsie kakaɨyarixi waɨkawa memayexeiyariekaikɨ.  
\v 17 Tukita niuki kanixɨatɨakaitɨni huriyutsixi wahamatɨa, meta kɨriyekutsixi Kakaɨyari memayexeiyakai wahamatɨa. Kiekari hixɨapata tukarikɨ niuki kanikuxatakaitɨni mana memu'uwakai wahamatɨa.  
\v 18 Hipatɨ 'Epikureyutsixi meta 'Etsituikutsixi temaiwawemete mekaniti'eiyarɨmekaitɨni. Hipatɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni: «¿Titakuta tixatanikeyu 'ikɨ niukiwiwame?» Hipatɨta mɨpaɨ mete'utiyuanekai: «Wa'atɨtɨ kakaɨyarixi xaɨtsie miemete puwakuxata». Mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni Papuru Ketsutsi niukieya 'aixɨa manɨyɨne mukuxatakaikɨ, meta mɨkite kememɨte'anuku'uni.  
\v 19 Hikɨ mekaneiwitɨni 'itsɨkate 'Arexi yemuriyaritsie memɨyutixexeɨriwakai wahɨrɨpa, mɨpaɨ mete'iku'iwawiyatɨ:  
\p —¿Tsipara 'ikɨ 'ɨkitsika mɨhekwa pemukuxata tihɨkɨ, tame tepeitimani?  
\v 20 Ketemɨkateheye'enakare pepɨtikuxata. 'Ayumieme tekatenetimaikuni ketɨtɨ manɨyune.   
\p
\v 21 'Atenaxitari yunaitɨ, meta ku'uwamete mana memɨ'iwatatɨwe 'atsimepɨkateyuriekai, tixaɨtɨ mɨtihekwa mepɨtexatakukai meta mepɨte'eniekukai xeikɨa.   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ Papuru 'itsɨkate wahixɨapa 'utakeka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Neuxei 'atenaxitari. Nekanixexeiyani xeme waɨkawamekɨ xekateniwarayexeiyani.  
\v 23 Mana ne'uyemietɨ nekatiniuxeiya tita xemɨtewarayexeiya, xeime nekaniutaxeiya mɨrayutimawatɨre, hetsiena mɨpaɨ re'uxame: \sc KAKAƗYARI MƗKAMATIWATSIE 'IKƗ PƗMIEME\sc*. Hikɨ, kemɨ'ane xemayexeiya xeka'imaitɨ, ne mɨkɨ hepaɨtsita nekatinixekuxaxatɨwani.   
\p
\v 24 »Mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari kwie mutawewi, meta naitɨ hetsiena mɨtixuawe, mɨkɨ Ti'aitame muyuawi meta kwie pɨtipiinieya. Mɨkɨ tuki mamakɨ mɨwewiyata pɨka'ayeka,  
\v 25 teɨteri yumamakɨ mepɨka'eyexeiya, tixaɨtɨ mɨkareuyehɨwakɨ. Mɨkɨ yunaime tukari pɨwapitɨa, wa'iya meta naitɨ mɨtixuawe.  
\v 26 Xeime tewi wapaapa 'ayeitɨaka, pɨwarutiwewi yunaime nuiwarite naitsarie kwie manuniere memɨtamakakɨ. Wakwie 'inɨariyari tiukaye meta memeixeiyanikɨ hakewa meuye'atɨka.  
\v 27 'Ikɨ Kakaɨyari mɨyakatiniuyurieni yunaitɨ memikuwaunikɨ, tsikeretsɨ mekumetɨwetɨ memitaxeiyakɨ. Yurikɨ, mɨkɨ 'ateewa pɨka'uyeika tame taxexuime tahetsɨa.  
\v 28 “Mɨkɨtsie tetewiyatɨ tekanayeneniereni, tekanikuyuaneni meta tekaniu'uwani”. Mɨpaɨ kememutiyuane hepaɨ hipatɨ teyɨnɨnɨawamete xehetsɨa miemete: “Mɨkɨ tame nuiwarimama tepɨhɨkɨ, me'utiyuatɨ”.   
\p
\v 29 »Hikɨ, xɨka Kakaɨyari hetsie teyekɨne, 'aixɨa pɨka'ane para mɨpaɨ temɨte'ixeiyani huru hepaɨ, pɨrata hepaɨ yatɨni tete hepaɨ 'anekame: tewi wewiyaya hepaɨ 'anekame, tita tewi mɨtiyɨkɨhɨawe hepaɨ 'anekame.  
\v 30 Hikɨ Kakaɨyari 'axapɨkatixeiyakai tita memɨteyuriekai kepauka 'atsimemɨkatemaikai, peru hikɨri pɨwahekɨatsitɨa yunaime teɨteri naitsarie memɨtama memɨtehayewanikɨ kememɨteyurie.  
\v 31 Xeime tukari pukaye mɨwa'inɨatanikɨ kwiepa memɨtama heitseriemekɨ yɨanetɨ, 'iya 'uki manuyexei yatiyurienekaku. Kakaɨyari yurikɨ niwarutahekɨatɨani yunaime, 'enukuketɨaka mɨkɨ mɨkite watsata».   
\p
\v 32 Hikɨ me'u'enanaka mɨkite kememɨte'anuku'uni, hipatɨ mekaninanaimakaitɨni, hipatɨta mɨpaɨ mekatenikɨhɨawekaitɨni:  
\p —Hutarieka 'arikeketa tepɨmatsi'enieni 'ikɨ hepaɨtsita petikuxatame.   
\p
\v 33 Hikɨ Papuru tiutahayewaka xeɨripa, kanewayeyani.  
\v 34 Hipatɨ Papuru mekaniutinɨni meta yuri mekateniuta'erieni. Riyunitsiyu mɨ'itsɨkametɨkai 'Arexi yemuriyaritsie miemetɨtɨri, meta xewitɨ 'ukaratsi Ramaritsi mɨtitewakai, metatsiere hipatɨ yuri memɨte'eriekai.   
\c 18  
\s1 Papuru Kurinitutsie kemɨtiuyeikakai  
\p
\v 1 Manaketa 'Atenaxi yeyaka Kurinitutsie kaniye'ani.  
\v 2 Mana xeime huriyu 'Akira titewakame kananukunake, Punitutsie metinuiwaxɨ meta 'ɨyaya Pɨritsira mɨtitewa. 'Apɨkareutewikai 'akuxi 'Itariya kwieyaritsie heyeyaka, Kɨrauriyu pɨtiuta'aitakai yunaitɨ huriyutsixi Xumatsie memɨtitekai memɨtaweiyarienikɨ. Papuru mɨkɨ wahetsɨa kaninuani,  
\v 3 mɨkɨta wahepaɨ 'ixuriki kiyari pɨwewiwametɨkai, wahamatɨa kaniuyuhayewa memɨteta'uximayatakɨ yunaitɨ.  
\v 4 Xexuime 'uxipiya tukaritsie tukita katinikuxatakaitɨni, huriyutsixi meta kɨriyekutsixi yuri katiniwa'eritɨamɨkɨkaitɨni.   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Tsiraxi meta Timuteu Matseruniyatsie meheyekɨneku, me'u'axɨaku, Papuru niukikɨ 'ayumiemetɨtɨ kanayani xeikɨa, tiwahekɨatɨatɨ huriyutsixi kename Ketsutsi hɨkɨ kemɨ'ane heitserie mupitɨarie Kɨritsitutɨtɨ.  
\v 6 Kepauka huriyutsixi Papuru memiti'uxiwe'eri meta 'axamekatenikɨhɨawekaitɨni, Papuru yu'ixuriki 'utakatseka 'inɨari 'ayeitɨaka, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xeme yuhetsie xepɨtehahɨpa xɨka xe'ukwini. Ne pɨta nepɨ'itiya. Hikɨri 'ena nemɨyeyani memɨkahuriyutsixi wahetsɨa nepɨyemie».   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ Papuru tukita wayeyaka xeime kie kaninuani Kutsitu mɨtitewakai hetsɨa. Kakaɨyari mɨkɨ kanayexeiyakaitɨni, meta kiena pehurakai tuki manuwekai.  
\v 8 Kɨritsipu tukita mɨti'aitakai yuri katiniuta'erieni Ti'aitametsie, meta yunaitɨ kiena kiekatari. Yumɨiretɨ kurinitutari me'u'enanaka Papuru kemɨtikuxatakai yuri mekateniuta'erieni meta mekaniuka'ɨyarieni.   
\p
\v 9 Xeitɨkaritsie Ti'aitame Papuru heinɨtsitana mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Pepɨkaheumaka, matsi ketinekuxatani pekatihayewatɨ,  
\v 10 ne 'ahamatɨa nepuyeika, nixewitɨ 'axapɨkamatsiyurieni. 'Ikɨ kiekaritsie yuwaɨkawame teɨteri nekaniwarexeiyani».  
\v 11 'Ayumieme Papuru xeiwiyari heimana 'ataxewime metseri mana kaniuyurieni, Kakaɨyari niukieya wa'ɨkitɨatɨ.   
\p
\v 12 Hikɨ, Kareuni kuwexinaruri, 'Akaiya kwieyaritsie mɨhɨritɨariekai, huriyutsixi 'axeikɨa me'uyukuxeɨrieka Papuru me'iniukimatɨ, mekaneiwitɨni 'itsɨkame mɨrewa'aitatsie.   
\p
\v 13 Mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —'Ikɨ tewi yuri katiniwa'eritɨaka teɨteri Kakaɨyari memayexeiyanikɨ 'inɨari niukiyari kemɨkahaine.   
\p
\v 14 Papuru 'ari taniuximekaku, Kareuni mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei huriyutsixi, 'ikɨ xɨka kwinimieme 'axareyurienike, yurikɨ nepɨxe'enienikeyu.  
\v 15 Mexɨka yakɨ xeikɨa xe'utiyuaneni yuhetsiemieme, niuki hepaɨtsita xe'inɨari hepaɨtsita xeikɨa, 'aixɨa xeketeneuyuri xemetɨtɨ. 'Itsɨkame nepɨkahɨkɨ mɨpaɨ ti'anekamekɨ.   
\p
\v 16 Hikɨ katiniuta'aita memɨwayeweiyarienikɨ mɨrewayutixanetsiwatsie.  
\v 17 Mɨkɨ yunaitɨ Tsutsitenexi tukita ti'aitame mɨhɨkɨtɨkai mekaniuwiya, meta mekaneikuwaxɨani 'itsɨkame 'uwenieya hɨxie. Kareuni 'atsipɨkahainekai mɨkɨ hepaɨtsita.   
\s1 Pɨritsira, 'Akira meta 'Apuruxi 'Epetsutsie mepu'uwakai  
\p
\v 18 Hikɨ Papuru mɨixa tukari mana puyuhayewaxɨ. Manaketa yu'iwama warutateutɨaka Tsiriya kwieyaritsie kaneyani kanuwa 'amɨpatsie. Pɨritsira meta 'Akira hamatɨana mekanekɨne. Meripaitɨ mɨyɨhɨritɨakaikɨ, 'ayumieme Tsenikɨreyatsie paitɨ pukaxiriekai yumu'utsie.  
\v 19 Hikɨ 'Epetsutsie me'uta'axɨaka, mana Papuru memeweiyakai kaniwareku'eirieni, mɨkɨ tukita kaneutahani muwa niuki kaniutaxata huriyutsixi wahamatɨa.  
\v 20 Mɨkɨ mekanitawawirieni yapaɨmexɨa tukari mɨyurienikɨ wahetsɨa 'akuxi, mɨkɨ pɨkayuwaɨriyakai.  
\v 21 Matsi wateutɨatɨ mɨpaɨ pɨtiuyɨhɨritɨa: «Xɨka Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ tinakeni nepayeneni». Hikɨ 'Epetsutsie kaneyani.  
\v 22 Hikɨ Tsetsareya paitɨ nuaka, Kerusareme neutiyune memɨyutixexeɨriwa watahɨaweke, manaketa 'Anutiyukiyatsie kanakayune.   
\p
\v 23 Yapaɨmexɨa tukari mana 'uyurieka Papuru kaneyani, wareu'iwatamieka memayutixexeɨriwatɨkatsie Karatsiya kwieyaritsie meta Pɨrikiyatsie yunaime teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete watuikatɨ.   
\p
\v 24 Hikɨ huriyu tewiyari kaniuyeikakaitɨni 'Apuruxi titewatɨ 'Arekanitɨriya metinuiwaxɨ. 'Epetsutsie kaninuani. 'Aixɨa pɨ'anekai niukamekɨ. 'Utɨarika xapayaritsie waɨkawa pɨrayemaikai.  
\v 25 Mɨkɨ Ti'aitame huyeya hepaɨtsita katiniuti'ɨkitɨariekaitɨni. 'Aixɨa 'iyarikɨ yuwaɨriyatɨ, katinikuxatakaitɨni ti'ɨkitatɨ heitseriemekɨ Ketsutsi hepaɨtsita, tsepanetɨ mɨtimaikai Wani kemɨtiu'ɨyakai xeikɨa.  
\v 26 Tukita kanitsutɨani tikuxatatɨ kaheumatɨ. Me'i'enieka Pɨritsira meta 'Akira mekanita'inieni, heitseriemekɨ matsi mekateni'ɨkitɨakaitɨni Kakaɨyari huyeya hepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 27 Mɨkɨ kaniyeimɨkɨkaitɨni 'Akaiya kwieyaritsie. 'Iwamarixi me'ituikatɨ mekateniwaruta'utɨirieni teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete memitanaki'erienikɨ. Henuaka waɨkawa kaniwaparewiekaitɨni mɨkɨ yuri memɨte'uta'eri Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa tiuka'iyarikaku.  
\v 28 Yunaime huriyutsixi wahɨxie tɨrɨkaɨyemekɨ katinikuxatakaitɨni, 'utɨarika xapayaritsie tiwahekɨatɨatɨ kemɨ'ane heitserie mupitɨarie Ketsutsi metsiyaxi mɨhɨkɨ.   
\c 19  
\s1 Papuru 'Epetsutsie kemɨtiuyeikakai  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'Apuruxi Kurinitutsie 'akuxi 'uyeikakaku, Papuru hɨri 'utɨa 'uyeyaka 'Epetsutsie kaneta'ani. Hipame teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mana kaniwaretaxeiya.   
\p
\v 2 Mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Xeme 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata xete'utanaki'eri yuri xemɨte'uta'eritsie?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'eiya:  
\p —Hawaikɨ matsi 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata hepaɨtsita tepɨka'enanawawe.   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Titatsie xetewiyatɨ xete'uka'ɨyarie?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'eiya:  
\p —Wani kemɨtiuka'ɨyakai xeikɨa teniuka'ɨyarieni tame.   
\p
\v 4 Papuru mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Wani kaniwaruka'ɨyakaitɨni metehayewakaku ke'axamemɨteyuriekai, mɨpaɨ tiwakuxaxatɨwatɨ teɨteri yuri memɨteta'erienikɨ kemɨ'ane 'utɨmana 'umamiekaitsie. Mɨkɨ Ketsutsi kanixatakaitɨni Kɨritsitu.   
\p
\v 5 Me'u'enanaka mekaniuka'ɨyarieni Ti'aitame Ketsutsi hetsiemieme.  
\v 6 Papuru waheima kaniutimeni, 'ana 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata mehexeiyatɨ mekanakɨne, hipame niukitekɨ me'utiniutɨ mekanakɨne meta Kakaɨyari niukieya mekanikuxatakaitɨni.  
\v 7 Yunaitɨ teɨteri tamamata heimana huta mepɨyupaɨmekai.   
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ Papuru huriyutsixi watukita kani'axekaitɨni tikuxatatɨ kamatɨ haika metseri puyuri. Niuki kanikuxatakaitɨni, yuri memɨteta'erienikɨ, Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku tikuxatatɨ.  
\v 9 Hipatɨ mekanitsetse'ikaitɨni, yuri mepɨkate'uta'eri, 'axame'utiyuatɨ mɨkɨ huye hepaɨtsita yumɨireme wahɨxie. Papuru waruku'eirieka teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete kaniwaranuyewitɨni. Tukarikɨ Tiranu mɨti'ɨkitakaitsie niuki kanikuxatakaitɨni.  
\v 10 Mɨpaɨ huta wiyari katiniyurienekaitɨni, yunaitɨ 'Atsiyatsie memɨtamakai huriyutsixi meta kɨriyekutsixi Ti'aitame niukieya mekaniu'enieni.   
\p
\v 11 Hikɨ Kakaɨyari 'inɨari tɨrɨkawime katiniyurienekaitɨni Papuru yatiyurienekaku.  
\v 12 Tekwikwikate watuwaxate meta wapetserate mepɨwarehuririwakai Papuru mimayuanikɨ, mɨkɨkɨ yukwiniyakɨ 'aixɨameteheu'erietɨ mepakɨkakai, meta kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene wahetsie mepayekɨkakai.   
\p
\v 13 Hipatɨ ku'uwamete huriyutsixi kakaɨyarixi memɨwaranuyenɨ'awakai, mɨkɨ Ti'aitame Ketsutsi mekanitixatatɨkɨne, kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene memɨwanɨkai teɨteri wahepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Ne nepɨxe'aitɨa Ketsutsi hetsiemieme Papuru mikuxata hetsɨa, nepɨxewawirie xemayekɨnekɨ».  
\v 14 'Ikɨ huriyu 'Itsikewa mɨtitewakai mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame, mɨkɨ 'atahutame yuniwema kaniwarexeiyakaitɨni mɨpaɨ meteyuriekame.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ 'iyari 'axamɨ'ane mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya, Ketsutsi nepɨmate: «Meta Papuru nepetima, peru xeme, ¿kemɨ'ane xepɨyɨa?»  
\v 16 Mɨkɨ tewi 'iyari 'axamɨ'ane miwiyakai waheima kaniutiweni, kaniwara'iwa yunaime tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ. Mɨkɨtsɨ memamawetɨ meheuxitekietɨkaitɨ mekaniyuta'una kiita.   
\p
\v 17 Kepauka memɨte'utamari kemɨtiuyɨ yunaitɨ huriyutsixi meta kɨriyekutsixi 'Epetsutsie memɨtamakai. Waɨkawa yunaitɨ mekanimamakaitɨni. Kemɨ'ane Ti'aitame Ketsutsi mɨhɨkɨ 'aixɨa tikuxaxatsiwatɨ kanayani.  
\v 18 Yumɨiretɨ yuri memɨte'uta'eri mekaniu'axɨani meyuhekɨatatɨ 'axakememɨteyuriekai.  
\v 19 Yumɨiretɨ mɨkɨ memɨteyukewaiyakai, yuxapate me'ukuxeɨrieka yunaime wahɨxie mekanititaiya. Hikɨ mekaniti'inɨata 'axeikɨa kepaɨmemetsie naitɨ mɨ'akai xapayari, huta tewiyari heimana tamamata miriyari pɨrata tuminiyari kanayani.  
\v 20 Mɨpaɨ tiuyɨku, Ti'aitame niukieya tɨrɨkaɨyemekɨ kaniutimɨire, kaniutɨrɨkare.   
\p
\v 21 Hikɨ mɨya tiuyɨku, Papuru yu'iyaritsie kaniyuwaɨriya Matseruniyatsie meta 'Akaiyatsie 'uyeyame Kerutsaremetsie meta'anikɨ, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «Mana neheta'ame, peuyewetse Xumatsie nemeumiekɨ».  
\v 22 Hikɨ yuhutame yuparewiwamete Timuteu meta 'Eratsitu Matseruniyatsie kaniwarenɨ'ani, mexi'akuxi 'Atsiyatsie yapaɨmexɨa tukari 'ukatei.   
\s1 'Epetsutari kememɨteyuxamuriekai  
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ 'ana waɨkawamekɨ mepɨyumuinakai teɨteri mɨkɨ huye hepaɨtsita.  
\v 24 Xewitɨ Remetɨriyu mɨtitewakai pɨrata wewiwame mɨhɨkɨtɨkai, pɨrata kakaɨyarixiyari pɨwawewiekai Riyana hepaɨ tiyuxexeiyame. Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ tiyurienetɨ waɨkawa 'iwarika kaniwapitɨakaitɨni tewewiwamete.  
\v 25 Hikɨ warukuxeɨrieka mɨkɨ, wahepaɨ te'uximayatamete wahamame, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Neuxei, xeme xekatenimaika tame temɨte'iwa 'ikɨ ta'uximayatsikakɨ.  
\v 26 Mɨpaɨ xepɨtexeiya, mɨpaɨ xepɨte'enana, Papuru yuri kemɨtiwa'eritɨa kemɨtiwarukunuitɨa yumɨireme teɨteri, 'ena 'Epetsutsie xeikɨa pɨkatixaɨ, matsi naitsarie 'Atsiyatsie. Mɨpaɨ katinikuxatani, mɨkɨ mamakɨ memɨwewiyatɨka kakaɨyarixi mepɨkahɨkɨ 'utaitɨ.  
\v 27 Mɨkɨ meta, tita temɨtehexeiya tame pɨkweriwa'ane kapa yakɨ'ayanikɨ. Matsi meta, 'ikɨ kakaɨyari mɨtɨrɨkaɨye Riyana tukieya, tixaɨ katihɨkɨtɨme teɨteri me'erietɨ. Yunaitɨ 'atsiyatari, naitsarie kwiepa memɨtamata, kemɨ'ane memayexeiya, 'ikɨ tɨrɨkariyaya pɨka'unariexime.   
\p
\v 28 Hikɨ me'u'enanaka mepuyeha'a. Mekaniutihiwakaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Kanitɨrɨkaɨyeni 'epetsutari takakaɨyari Riyana.   
\p
\v 29 Naitsarie kiekaritsie mepuyuxamurietɨwekai. 'Axeikɨa mepekɨ me'unautsaxɨaximetɨ xeɨripa, mewarutiwiyaka Kayu meta 'Aritsitariku matseruniyatari Papuru teɨtametemama memɨhɨkɨtɨkai.  
\v 30 Papuru kanihamɨkɨkaitɨni yumɨiretɨ teɨteri memayuxeɨrie wahɨxie, peru teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mepɨka'ipitɨa.  
\v 31 Hipatɨ 'Atsiya kwieyaritsie kiekatari 'itsɨkate, hamikumama memɨhɨkɨtɨkai, xapa mekaneinɨ'airieni waɨkamekɨ me'iwawirietɨ xeɨripa mɨkamiekɨ.   
\p
\v 32 Hikɨ hipatɨ yɨkɨ mete'uhiwatɨ hipatɨta yɨkɨ pɨta mekateniuhiwakaitɨni. Mana xeikɨa mekaniyukuxeɨrieni yunaitɨ, yumɨiretɨ 'atsimepɨkatemaikai titayari muwa memɨte'u'axɨakai.  
\v 33 'Amemu'uwakai watsata mekanenuyexeiya 'Arekanituru, huriyutsixi me'itakeku wahɨxie. 'Arekanituru yumamakɨ waru'inɨaritɨaka kaniniumɨkɨkaitɨni yuhetsiemieme memɨyukuxeɨri wahɨxie.  
\v 34 Meheitimaika Huriyu mɨhɨkɨtɨkaikɨ, karima mekaniutihiwakaitɨni 'axeikɨa yunaitɨ huta hurayari mepuyuri mɨpaɨ mete'uhiwatɨ:  
\p —Kanitɨrɨkaɨyeni 'epetsutari takakaɨyari Riyana.   
\p
\v 35 Hikɨ kiekaritsie ti'aitame ti'utɨwame waku'imaiyatɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe memuyuxeɨriekai:  
\p —Neuxei 'epetsutari, ¿hakewatsɨ tewi 'atsimɨkatimate kename 'Epetsu kiekatari Riyana mɨtɨrɨkaɨye tukita temɨte'aita, Kupiteritsɨa makane tete kakaɨyariyari hɨwemetemama?  
\v 36 Hikɨ, xɨka mɨpaɨ 'aneni, xɨka kayuxamurieka 'ikɨ niuki, kaneuyeweka kayuwatɨ xemɨtamarekɨ 'axaxemɨkateyu'eniwanikɨ.  
\v 37 Xekaniwa'atɨani 'ikɨ teɨteri, tsepa 'axamemɨkate'uyuri tuki hepaɨtsita, tsepa 'axamemɨkatekuxata xekakaɨyari hepaɨtsita.  
\v 38 'Ayumieme Remetɨriyu, tewewiwamete hamatɨana memu'uwa xɨka tixaɨ metehexeiya xeime hepaɨtsita, tukari puxuawe kepauka 'itsɨkate 'amemɨtiteni, mɨkɨ kwiepa memɨhɨritɨarie 'amekaniu'uwani. Mana yuxanetsika mekehe'atɨani.  
\v 39 Xɨkatsɨ matsi 'akuxi xetekuwauni, 'aixɨa pɨyɨni kepauka kiekatari memɨyuxeɨrie, 'inɨari niukiyari kemaine.  
\v 40 Hikɨmɨtsɨari tepɨkweriwa'aka kapa tahetsie rahɨiyanikɨ 'axatemɨtewakɨhɨawekɨ hikɨ, tsepa mɨkareuyewekai. Tame tepɨkayɨwawe yɨkɨ temaitɨkani tahetsiemieme 'ikɨ xamurikakɨ.   
\p
\v 41 Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka memayuxeɨrietsie kaniwaranuyenɨ'ani memɨyehukɨ.   
\c 20  
\s1 Papuru Matseruniyatsie meta Kɨretsiyatsie kemɨretɨa  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ xamurika kayuwatɨ 'utamareku, Papuru teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete yu'aurie katiniwarutanɨ'airieni, waruparewieka memɨkatehayewanikɨ 'imatɨrieka warutateutɨaka Matseruniya paitɨ kaneyani.  
\v 2 Mana 'uyeikatɨ wahetsɨa, kaniwatuikakaitɨni waɨkawa niukikɨ. 'Ariketa Kɨretsiya kwieyaritsie kaneta'ani.  
\v 3 Haika metseri yuriekaku, huriyutsixi mekaniyu'enieni me'imienike kepauka Tsiriya paitɨ mɨyemiekai. 'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ katiniyumaikaitɨni Matseruniya pɨta muyeyunekɨ.  
\v 4 'Atsiyapaitɨ hamatɨana mekaniu'uwakaitɨni Tsupateri wereyatanaka, 'Aritsitariku meta Tsekunitu memɨtetsarunikataritɨkai, Kayu rerɨwetanaka, Timuteu, Tikiku meta Tɨrupimu memɨ'atsiyataritɨkai.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ meripaitɨ mehekɨneka Tɨruhatsi paitɨ mekatanekwewiekaitɨni.  
\v 6 Tametsɨ Piriputsie kanuwa 'amɨpatsie tekaneyekɨne, paa mɨkakuxanariyarie 'ixɨarariyari 'anutiyaku. Wahetsɨa tekaneta'axɨani Tɨruhatsi paitɨ 'auxɨwime tukari 'anukayaku. Mana 'atahuta tukari tepuyuri.   
\s1 Papuru kemɨtiwaruteutɨa Tɨruhatsi kiekatari wareku'iwataka  
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ mexɨakame tukari tsemanatsie tekanitakuxeɨrieni paa temɨtitarakɨ. Papuru katiniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni, 'uxa'arieka mɨyemiekaikɨ, 'ayumieme 'apɨreuterixɨ tikuxatatɨ tɨkari hixɨapake.  
\v 8 Waɨkawa kɨxemete pɨti'ukai kii taɨta haikakɨa heutitewakaku temɨwayuxeɨriekaitsie.  
\v 9 Xewitɨ temaikɨ 'Eutiku titewatɨ 'etsimayewa mɨranenieritɨretsie kanayekateitɨni. Mɨkɨ kanekakumɨkatɨyani. Papuru waɨkawa tikuxatakaku, kepauka yemekɨ waɨkawa meuku, haikatɨ kii yuheima 'a'ukametsie kaneukaweni, mɨkitɨ kaniutikweiyani.  
\v 10 Papuru 'anukayaka, temaikɨ hepa heyaka 'itapatɨ, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Kayuwatɨ xepɨkayumuinani. 'Iyarieya 'upɨyeka».  
\v 11 Hikɨta Papuru kaneutiyani. Paa 'utitaraka, tiukwaka, mana katinikuxatakaitɨni waɨkawa. Tau 'anatinekuke kaneyani.  
\v 12 Temaikɨ 'ayeniereme mekanewitɨni kiena, waɨkawamekɨ yunaitɨ mekaniunɨtɨarieni.   
\s1 Kememɨteheta'axɨa Miretu Tɨruhatsi meheyekɨneka  
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ tame kanuwatsie tepekɨ te'anuhaitɨtɨatɨ, 'Atsunitsie tekaniye'axɨani. Papuru hamatɨa mɨpaɨ temɨte'uxatakaikɨ. Mɨkɨ yu'ɨkama kaneta'anikekaitɨni.  
\v 14 Kepauka mɨtatsi'anukunakixɨ 'Atsunitsie, kanuwatsie tekaneitɨni, Mitirene paitɨ tekanekɨne.  
\v 15 Manata 'uxa'arieka tekanekɨne teheta'axɨanike Kiuxi hɨxie, 'uxa'ariekaketa Tsamutsie tepeta'axɨa, 'arike Turukiriyu teheta'axɨaka 'uxa'arieka Miretu paitɨ tekaneta'axɨani.  
\v 16 Papuru yapɨtiu'eriekairi, 'Epetsu 'aurie xekɨa temuyekɨnekekai, muixa tukari mɨkayurienikekaikɨ 'Atsiya kwieyaritsie. Kaniyumexɨitɨakaitɨni xɨka yɨwenike Kerutsareme meyeikanikɨ 'ixɨarari 'atahutarieka tsemanatsie mieme 'aye'ayu.   
\p
\v 17 Hikɨ Papuru Miretutsie 'uyeikatɨ, 'ukirawetsixi 'Epetsutsie memuyutixexeɨriwa, katiniwarutanɨ'airieni.  
\v 18 Kepauka memu'axɨa mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xeme xepɨtemate kenemɨtiuyeikakai xehamatɨa ne'uyeikatɨ, matɨari paitɨ nenuaka 'Atsiya kwieyaritsie.  
\v 19 Ti'aitame hetsiemieme nekatini'uximayaka tixaɨtɨ nekarayuyeitɨatɨ, ne'utatsuatɨ, ne'inɨatsienetɨ, huriyutsixi kememɨteyu'eniekai nehepaɨtsita.  
\v 20 Nepɨkaneku'imawakai, nepɨnewaɨriyakai nemɨtixetahekɨatɨanikɨ tita mɨreuyewekai, teɨteri wahɨxie meta xekiiteta nekatinixe'ɨkitɨakaitɨni.  
\v 21 Huriyutsixi meta kɨriyekutsixi mɨpaɨ nepɨtixehekɨatɨakai xetehayewame kexemɨteyurie Kakaɨyaritsie xemɨtewiyanikɨ, yuri xemɨteta'erienikɨ Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi hetsie.   
\p
\v 22 »Hikɨ ne Kerutsareme nepɨyemie 'Iyari waɨriyarika netsipitɨakaku. 'Atsinekatimaitɨ mana keneme'itɨarieni.  
\v 23 Mɨpaɨ xeikɨa nekatinimaika, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata mɨpaɨ netihekɨatɨakaku naime kiekaritetsie, kename kaunarite meta 'uximatɨarika mana netsihetakwewie.  
\v 24 Matsi, netukari raye'akame nepɨka'erie nehetsiemieme. Nepinɨni xeikɨa nehɨritɨarika nenetemawietɨ, 'uximayatsikatsie yanepɨtiyurieni Ti'aitame Ketsutsi kemɨnetiuhɨritɨa, nemɨtihekɨatanikɨ niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne hepaɨtsita Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa kemɨtiuka'iyari.   
\p
\v 25 »Hikɨ ne nepɨtimate yunaitɨ xeme hatsuakuri nenierika xepɨkaxeiya, Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku nehekɨatatɨ kenemutiuyeikakai xetsata.  
\v 26 'Ayumieme 'ikɨ tukaritsie nekatinixe'utahekɨatɨani kename ne ne'itiya, nixeime xuriyayakɨ nehetsie karahɨiwa.  
\v 27 Hatsuaku nepɨkaneku'imawakai, nepɨnewaɨriyakai nemɨtixetaxatɨanikɨ naime Kakaɨyari mɨtiutsutɨa.  
\v 28 Xekeneyukweriwayurieka xeme, xekeniwakweriwayurieka mɨkɨta muxatsi wakɨmana 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata xehɨritɨariekame mɨxe'ayeitɨa, xemɨwa'ɨwiyanikɨ mɨkɨ yunaime Ti'aitame hetsɨa miemete memɨyutixexeɨriwa, mɨkɨ mɨwarunanai yuxuriyakɨ.  
\v 29 Netsɨ nekatinimaika neyemieyu 'arike 'ɨrawetsixi xetsata mekaneutahaxɨakuni teyu'uximatɨwamete. Muxatsi mekaniwatixɨtɨakuni.  
\v 30 Xetsatatɨtɨ mekananuku'uikuni hipatɨ tutunimekɨ me'utiniutɨ, yu'utɨma memɨwaranuhapanikɨ teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete.  
\v 31 'Ayumieme xekenayeneniereni, xekena'eriwani haika wiyari tukarikɨ tɨkarikɨ kenemɨkatihayewakai nexeku'imaiyatɨ yuxexuime, ne'utatsuatɨ.   
\p
\v 32 »Hikɨ xehepaɨtsita Kakaɨyari nekanihɨritɨaka, niukiyarita. Mɨkɨ niuki 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyari manuyɨne, mɨkɨ kaniyɨweni mɨxetseiriyani, mɨxepitɨani xehetsie mɨtinakenikɨ yunaime Kakaɨyari mɨwarupataxɨ yuhetsiemieme, mɨkɨ wahetsie kemɨtinakeni.  
\v 33 Ne xeime tuminieya pɨrataya, huruya meta 'ixurikieya nepɨka'ihiwe'eririekai.  
\v 34 Matsi xeme xekatenimaika 'ikɨ nemamakɨ nepɨtinepitɨakai tita ne nemɨreuyehɨakai, meta nehamatɨa memu'uwakai tita memɨteheuyehɨakai nepɨtiwapitɨakai.  
\v 35 Ne 'ɨkitsika ne'ayuyeitɨatɨ nekatinixehekɨatɨakaitɨni mɨpaɨ xete'uximayatɨ xemɨwaparewienikɨ mɨkɨ memɨkatɨrɨkawi, xeme xeme'eriwanikɨ Ti'aitame Ketsutsi niukieya kemutayɨ: “Kemɨ'ane ti'uximayatɨ mɨtiyetua kaniyutemawieka, kemɨ'ane mɨtimikie 'etsiwa xeikɨa kaniyutemawieka”».   
\p
\v 36 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka, Papuru 'utitunumakeka, yunaime wahamatɨa kaniyutanenewieni.  
\v 37 Yunaitɨ waɨkawa mekaniutitsuanakaitɨni me'ikutapatɨ meta me'iku'itsewetɨ  
\v 38 meyuhiwerietɨkaitɨ yemekɨ niukieya kemainekaikɨ, kename nierikaya mekaxeiyanikekai tawariri. Kanuwa 'amɨpatsie paitɨ mekaneikutuani.   
\c 21  
\s1 Papuru Kerutsaremetsie kemɨretɨa  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ tewarutateutɨaka tekanekɨne, heitserie te'erietɨ kanuwa 'amɨpatsie Kuhutsi paitɨ tekaneta'axɨani, 'uxa'arieka Ruraxitsie paitɨ, manaketa Pataratsie paitɨ tekaneta'axɨani.  
\v 2 Mana kanuwa 'amɨpa 'ayeyeiximekame tekaniuxeiya Penitsiyatsie heyaka. Te'akayaxeka tenekɨne.  
\v 3 Tsipɨre kwieyari haramara hixɨapa mɨyeka te'uxeiyaka ta'utata te'uku'eirieka, Tsiriyatsie tekaneta'axɨani. Mana Tirutsie tekaniuyekɨne kanuwa 'amɨpa mana mɨti'ikapiyanikekaikɨ.  
\v 4 Mana teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete tekaniwaretaxeiya, 'atahuta tukari tekaniuyurieni mɨkɨ wahamatɨa. Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ Papuru mekateneye'eritɨani 'Iyari mɨpaɨ tiwa'ɨkitɨakaku Kerutsareme paitɨ mɨkaye'axenikɨ.  
\v 5 Yapaɨmexɨa tukari te'uyurieka wahamatɨa, tekanekɨne ketemɨtehukai. Yunaitɨ teyu'ɨkitɨwamete, 'ukarawetsixi meta tɨɨri mepɨtatsi'uweiyakai kiekari manu'axe paitɨ, mana haramara tetsita te'utitunuma'uka, tekaniyutanenewieni,  
\v 6 hikɨta tetatateutɨaxɨaka, tame kanuwa 'amɨpatsie tekanatiyaxe, mɨkɨta yukie mekaneutayeixɨani.   
\p
\v 7 Tirutsie teheyekɨneka mɨkɨ kanuwa 'amɨpatsie, tawarita tekanekɨne, Turemaira tekaneta'axɨani. Mana tewarutawaɨritɨaka 'iwamarixi, xeitukari tepuyuri wahamatɨa.  
\v 8 Tehayekɨneka Papuru hamatɨa, 'uxa'arieka Tsetsareya tekaneta'axɨani. Peripe niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne mukuxata hetsɨa tekaniu'axɨani, mɨkɨ xewitɨ kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni 'atahuta meyupaɨmetɨ memɨte'uximayakai.  
\v 9 Mɨkɨ yunaukame yuniwema pɨwarexeiyakai 'ɨimarixi texaxatamete.   
\p
\v 10 Hikɨ yapaɨmexɨa tukari teyuriekaku, xewitɨ Kureyatsie heyeyaka mana kaninuani, Kakaɨyari niukameya 'Akawu titewatɨ.  
\v 11 Tahetsɨa nuaka, Papuru hɨiyameya 'utihurieka, yɨ'ɨkate meta yumamate kaniuhɨaxɨani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Iyari Mɨtiyupata mɨpaɨ kanaineni: “'Ikɨ hɨiyame kutsiyarieya, huriyutsixi Kerutsaremetsie mɨpaɨ mekatenihɨakuni, mɨkɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi mekaniwayetuiriekuni”.   
\p
\v 12 Mɨyatete'u'enanaka, tame meta mana kiekatari wahamatɨa Papuru tekaniwawiriekaitɨni Kerutsareme mɨka'uyeyeikanikɨ.   
\p
\v 13 Papuru mɨpaɨ katatiniuta'eiya:  
\p —¿Titayari xe'utitsuatɨ ne'iyari xeteweranariya? Ne nepɨha'aritsie Kerutsaremetsie nemɨhɨiyanikɨ meta nemɨmɨnikɨ Ti'aitame Ketsutsi hetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 14 Yamɨkatinaki'eriekaikɨ temikununuitɨwani, tekateniuhayewa mɨpaɨ tete'ikɨhɨawetɨ:  
\p —Kamɨtsɨ yaketiuyɨni Ti'aitame kemɨtinake.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ yapaɨmexɨa tukari 'utixɨku tetakuha'aritɨaka Kerutsaremetsie tekaneutiyune.  
\v 16 Hipatɨ teyu'ɨkitɨwamete Tsetsareya kiekatari tahamatɨa mepekɨ, mɨkɨ mekatanewitɨni Mɨnatsuni kie mana temukuhenikɨ, tsipɨretanaka mɨkɨ tiyɨ'ɨkitɨwame kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni matɨari mieme.   
\s1 Papuru Kerutsaremetsie kemɨtinua  
\p
\v 17 Kepauka Kerutsaremetsie temu'axɨa, 'iwamarixi mekataniutanaki'erieni meyutemamawietɨ.  
\v 18 'Uxa'arieka Papuru tahamatɨa kaneyani Kakuwu metahɨawekɨ, meta yunaitɨ 'ukirawetsixi mana mekaniyuxeɨriekaitɨni.  
\v 19 Hikɨ warutawaɨritɨaka, katiniwahekɨatɨakaitɨni naime kemɨtihɨritɨariekai hepaɨtsita Kakaɨyari kemɨtiuyuri memɨkahuriyutsixi watsata.   
\p
\v 20 Mɨkɨ me'u'enanaka 'aixɨa Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni. Papuru mɨpaɨ mekateniutahɨawe: «Neuxei ta'iwama, pekaniwaxeiyani keyupaɨmetɨ miriyari huriyutsixi yuri memɨte'erie, mɨkɨ yunaitɨ yemekɨ 'inɨari niukiyaritsie mepɨtewiya.  
\v 21 Hikɨtsɨari, mɨpaɨ mekateni'enanaka 'ahepaɨtsita, kename mɨpaɨ peti'ɨkita Muitsexi 'inɨarieya yunaitɨ huriyutsixi meke'iku'eirieni memɨkahuriyutsixi watsata memu'uwa. Yapetiwakɨhɨawetɨ memɨka'inɨaritɨarienikɨ tɨɨri xitekiyakɨ, yuyeiyaritsie yamemɨkatekahunikɨri.  
\v 22 ¿Keriteteyurieka? Yumɨiretɨ xɨari mepɨyukuxeɨrieni. Mepɨ'enanani pemunuakɨ.  
\v 23 'Ayumieme, mɨpaɨ ketineuyuri ketemɨmetetahɨawe. 'Uwa tatsata 'ukitsi yunaukatɨ mepɨye'uwa, paye'axime memeye'atɨanikɨ kememɨteyɨhɨritɨakai.  
\v 24 Keniwaranuwitɨki, keneu'a'itieka wahamatɨa, ketineuyutua wakɨpa mɨkaxirienikɨ 'inɨari mayanikɨ hɨritɨarika maye'akɨ. Mɨpaɨ petiyurieyu yunaitɨ mepɨtehetimani kename katiyuri kememɨtekɨhɨawarɨwa 'ahepaɨtsita, matsi 'inɨari niukiyaritsie yapetikamietɨ 'apemuyeika.  
\v 25 Mɨkɨtsɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi yuri memɨte'uta'eri, niuki tepɨwarenɨ'airi tewa'aitɨatɨ mɨpaɨ 'anenemetsie yamemɨkatekahunikɨ, matsi memɨka'ikwakakɨ tita tetexi memɨtexatɨarie, xuriya, tewá yukawieyu waiyarieya meta kemɨ'ane mɨkayɨ'ɨya mɨkayɨkɨna memɨkawakumaɨwanikɨ».   
\p
\v 26 Hikɨ 'uxa'arieka Papuru mɨkɨ 'ukitsi kaniwarewitɨni, mɨkɨta wahamatɨa yu'itieka tukita kaneutahani, mɨpaɨ tihekɨatatɨ kename tukari 'aye'a memuyu'itienitsie, meta mɨkɨ yuxexuitɨ wamawari pɨyetuiyani.   
\s1 Papuru kemɨtiuwiyarie  
\p
\v 27 Kepaukari 'atahuta tukari 'aye'aximekaku, huriyutsixi 'Atsiya kiekatari Papuru tukita mekaniuxeiya. Mekaniwaruxamurieni yunaime mana memu'uwakai meta mekaniwiya,  
\v 28 mɨpaɨ mete'uhiwatɨ: «'Ixaheritsixi xeketaneuparewi. 'Ikɨ tewi kanihɨkɨtɨni kemɨ'ane yunaime teɨteri naitsarie 'axamɨtiwa'ɨkitɨa, 'inɨari niukiyari hepaɨtsita meta 'ena takiekaritsie. Matsi 'akuxi kɨriyekutsixi 'uwa tukita kaniwaratahatɨwani, 'ikɨ 'ena ka'akupatsiekame kanayeitɨani».   
\p
\v 29 Meripaitɨri Tɨrupimu Papuru hamatɨa 'uyeikame kiekaritsie mepuxeiyakai 'epetsutanaka, tukita Papuru hetawitɨme mepɨ'eriekai.   
\p
\v 30 Yunaitɨ kiekatari mepuyuxamuri. Teɨteri me'unautsaxɨaximetɨ mekaniu'axɨani, Papuru mekaniuwiya, mekanenuyehana tuki takwa, yapauka 'itupari meuwɨtsie kaneunarixɨani.  
\v 31 Hikɨ 'ari me'imieximekaku, kepauka niuki munua xeimiriyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame hetsɨa kename yunaitɨ Kerutsareme kiekatari meyuxamuriekai.  
\v 32 Kwitɨwa kuyaxi xeitsienituyari tewa'aitɨwamete yukuyaxima mewaruwitɨkɨme pɨwarewitɨ, meta mɨkɨ mana kaniutanautsa wahetsɨa. Kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame me'uxeiyaka meta kuyaximama, Papuru metiwayatɨ mekateniuhayewa.   
\p
\v 33 'Ahurawa 'ayaka kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame, kaniwiya meta katiniuta'aita memihɨanikɨ huta tepɨayarikɨ. Manata kaniwaruta'iwawiya kemɨ'ane mɨhɨkɨtɨkai meta kemɨtiuyuriekai.  
\v 34 Hipatɨ yɨkɨ mekateniuhiwakaitɨni, hipatɨta yɨkɨ me'utiyuatɨ. 'Atsimɨkaretimaiwekaikɨ meyuxamurietɨ kememutiyuanekai kemɨ'ane yuri mutainenikeyu, 'ayumieme katiniuta'aita kuyaxi wakie memenuhanakɨ.  
\v 35 Kepauka Papuru 'imumuitɨa mɨye'a, peuyewekai kuyaxi me'enuyewietɨ memenuhanakɨ waɨriyarika, teɨteri memɨtsaipɨnekaikɨ.  
\v 36 Yumɨiretɨ mekaniweiyakaitɨni mɨpaɨ mete'uhiwatɨ: «Ke'umierieni».   
\s1 Papuru yuhetsiemieme teɨteri wahɨxie kemɨtiutaniu  
\r (Nɨ'a 22:3-16 – Nɨ'a 9:1-22, 26:9-18)  
\p
\v 37 Hikɨ kepauka kuyaxi wakiita meheitahatɨaximekaku, Papuru kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame mɨpaɨ katiniuta'iwawiya:  
\p —Pekanetipitɨa nemɨmetitaxatɨanikɨ.  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —'Ekɨ kuta kɨriyekutsixi waniukikɨ petiniuwe.  
\v 38 ¿Mɨkɨ 'ekipitutanaka pekatihɨkɨ meripaitɨ kuya pematɨa, meta makumawetsie nauka miiriyari yukukuyamete pemɨwarewitɨ?   
\p
\v 39 Papuru mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Netsɨ nekanihuriyutɨni, Tarutsu nepɨnuiwakame Tsiritsiya kwieyaritsie nemiemetɨtɨ, kiekari 'amɨyewatsie nekanikiekametɨni. Hikɨ nepɨmatsiwawirie, keneneupitɨa teɨteri nemɨtiwataxatɨanikɨ.   
\p
\v 40 Kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame 'ipitɨaku, Papuru 'imumuitsie 'utiwetɨ teɨteri yumamakɨ kaniwaru'inɨaritɨani. Kepauka yunaitɨ kayuwatɨ me'utamareku, 'arameu niukiyarikɨ kaniutaniuni, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:   
\c 22  
\p
\v 1 «Neuxei 'iwamarixi meta ta'ukiyarima. Xekeneneu'eni nehetsiemieme hikɨ xehɨxie kenemɨtitaniuni».   
\p
\v 2 Hikɨ me'i'enieka 'arameu niukiyarikɨ tikuxatame, matsi waɨkawa kayuwatɨ mepumakai.  
\p Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\v 3 «Ne nekanihuriyutɨni, Tarutsutsie Tsiritsiya kwieyaritsie nekanetinuiwa. Matsi 'ikɨ kiekaritsie nekaniutawere, Kamarieri hetsɨa netinineta'ɨkitɨani heitseriemekɨ tatutsima wa'inɨari niukiyari hepaɨtsita, ne yemekɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita nepɨ'ɨtetsakai, hikɨ xeme hipatɨ xemutiyuane hepaɨ.  
\v 4 'Ikɨ huye memuweiyakai newaranukuweweiyatɨ nepɨwatakukuyakai, newatihɨayatɨ 'ukitsi meta 'ukari katsariyanata nepɨwaranutaxurɨwakai,  
\v 5 mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame, meta naime 'ukirawetsixi kememɨtehekɨata. Mɨkɨ menetsi'uhuritɨaku xapa ta'iwama wahetsiemieme, Ramatsikutsie nekaneyani newarahapanike Kerutsaremetsie mehɨatɨkaime kemɨ'ane nemɨwaretaxeiya, memanutaxɨriyanikɨ.   
\p
\v 6 »Hikɨ tuka mana ne'uyemiekaku, kepauka Ramatsiku ne'aye'aximekaku, taheima mieme hekɨariya ne'aurie waɨkawa kaniukuxawatɨre.  
\v 7 Kwiepa nekaniukaweni. Meta xeime nekaniu'enieni mɨpaɨ netikɨhɨaweme: “Tsauru, Tsauru titayari penetiuweiya”.  
\v 8 Netsɨ mɨpaɨ nekatinita'iwawiya: “¿Ti'aitame kemɨ'ane pepɨhɨkɨ?” Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ kanetiniuta'eiya: “Netsɨ Ketsutsi natsaretitanaka nekanihɨkɨtɨni pemɨnetsi'uweiya”.  
\v 9 Nehamatɨa memu'uwakai hekɨariya me'uxeiyaka mekaniutimamani. Matsi mepɨka'i'eni kemɨ'ane mɨnetsikɨhɨawekai.  
\v 10 Ne mɨpaɨ nekatinita'iwawiya: “¿Ti'aitame kereuyewetse yanemɨtiyurienikɨ?” Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ kanetiniutahɨawe: “Kenanukukexi, Ramatsikutsie kenemie. Manari yapepɨtitahɨawarieni naime kemɨti'aitsie yapemɨtikayanikɨ”.  
\v 11 Nepɨtauruxiekai xawatɨriyakɨ. Mɨkɨ nehamatɨa memuhukai menetsi'ahanatɨ, Ramatsikutsie mekaneni'atɨani.   
\p
\v 12 »Hikɨ xewitɨ 'Ananiyaxi mɨtitewa mana peyeikakai, tewi 'aixɨa mɨtikamie 'inɨari niukiyaritsie. Yunaitɨ huriyutsixi mana memɨtamakai 'aixɨa mepɨte'imaikai.  
\v 13 Hikɨ nehetsɨa nuaka, ne'aurie 'utikeka, mɨpaɨ kanetiniutahɨawe: “Ne'iwa Tsauru, kenanutanieri”. 'Anari kwitɨwa nekananutaniere meta nehaunieretɨ nepatɨa.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨta kaniutayɨni: “Tatutsima wakakaɨyari matɨari paitɨ kamenanayexeiya yapemɨretimanikɨ ketita mɨtinake, mɨkɨ Heitserie mexeiya pemɨxeiyakɨ meta niukieya pemɨ'enienikɨ 'utaniukame.  
\v 15 'Ekɨ kepemɨtiunierixɨ meta kepemɨtiu'enaxɨ yunaime teɨteri pekatiniwatahekɨatɨamɨkɨ.  
\v 16 Hikɨtsɨari, ¿tita 'akuxi petitakwewie? Kenanukukexi, keneuka'ɨwa, meta 'axapemɨtiuyurikɨ keneu'ahauxina pehehɨawetɨ kemɨ'ane mɨhɨkɨ”.   
\p
\v 17 »Hikɨ Kerutsareme nenuaka, mexi'akuxi tuki kuraruyarita neyunenewiekai, heinɨtsi hepaɨ 'anekame nekaniuxeiya,  
\v 18 meta Ti'aitame nekaniuxeiya mɨpaɨ netikɨhɨaweme: “Kene'akumexɨitɨa, Kerutsareme kenayeye'a, 'aniuki mepɨkatanaki'erieni nehepaɨtsita kepemɨtihekɨata”.  
\v 19 Netsɨ mɨpaɨ nekatinita'eiya: “Ti'aitame, mɨkɨ mekatenimaika tukiteta ne kenemɨtitahakekai newaranutaxɨrɨwatɨ newatiwayatɨ mɨkɨ yuri memɨte'eriekai 'ahetsie,  
\v 20 meta kepauka 'Etsitewani xuriyaya mutaxɨri 'ahepaɨtsita mɨtihekɨatakai, ne mana nepuwekai ne'iyari ya'anekaku meta wa'ixurikite ne'ihɨtɨ mɨkɨ memimienikekai”.  
\v 21 Matsi Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ kanetiniutahɨawe: “Kenemie, ne 'ateewa paitɨ nekamenanunɨ'amɨkɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi wahetsɨa”».   
\s1 Papuru Xumatsie kiekame  
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ teɨteri yumɨiretɨ Papuru mekani'eniekaitɨni kepaukari mɨkɨ niuki mutaxa, 'ana karima meputihiwaxɨ mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Kwiepa ke'umaweni. 'Aixɨa pɨka'ane mɨkɨ tewi 'ayenieretɨ muyeikani».   
\p
\v 23 Me'utihiwatɨ yu'ixuriki teikɨ mehewiwiwatɨ meta tumuanari teikɨ mehewiwiwatɨ,  
\v 24 kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame katiniuta'aita Papuru kuyaxi wakiita manuhanienikɨ.  
\p —Tepita'inɨata 'ariwatsini 'ikuwaxɨayu, yanemɨretimanikɨ titayari mɨya memɨte'uhiwakai hepaɨtsitana.   
\p
\v 25 Kepauka me'ikuhɨayakaku karena kaunariyarikɨ, Papuru xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe mana 'utiwekaku:  
\p —¿Xeme 'aitsikatsie xetepitɨarie tewi Xumatsie kiekame xemukuwaxɨani 'itsɨkame ka'ita'iwawiyawekaku?   
\p
\v 26 Kuyaxi xeitsienituyari tiwa'aitɨwame 'u'enaka kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame hetsɨa kaneyani, mɨpaɨ katinitahekɨatɨani:  
\p —¿'Ekɨ kepetiyurieni? 'Ikɨ tewi Xumatsie kanikiekametɨni.   
\p
\v 27 Kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame Papuru hetsɨa kaniye'ani, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Yakenetineutahɨawi, ¿'ekɨ Xumatsie petikiekame?  
\p Papuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Huu, mɨkɨ nepɨhɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 28 Kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Karikɨ ne waɨkawa netininetuani kiekame nemayanikɨ.  
\p Papuru mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ne, matsi mana nuiwakame nekanihɨkɨtɨni.   
\p
\v 29 'Ayumieme hetsɨana memu'axɨakai me'ita'iwawiyake yapauka mekaneutayeixɨani. Kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame yaretimaika Papuru Xumatsie mɨkiekametɨkaikɨ, kanimakaitɨni mihɨakaikɨ.   
\s1 'Itsɨkate Papuru kememɨte'ita'iwawiyaxɨ  
\p
\v 30 Hikɨ 'uxa'arieka, kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame heitseriemekɨ katinimaimɨkɨkaitɨni ketitayari huriyutsixi memɨteniukixiekai Papuru hepaɨtsita. Kanixɨna meta katiniuta'aita memɨyukuxeɨrienikɨ mawari wewiwamete memɨtewa'aitɨa meta 'itsɨkate yunaitɨ. Hikɨ mana wahɨxie Papuru kani'atɨani.   
\c 23  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Papuru 'itsɨkate waxeiyatɨ, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ne'iwamarixi, ne'iyari 'aixɨa 'anekaku kanetsi'utate'akaku Kakaɨyari hɨxie nekaniuyeikani meripaitɨ hikɨ 'akuxi.   
\p
\v 2 Hikɨ 'Ananiyaxi mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame mɨkɨ 'auriena 'ahurawa memɨti'ukai katiniwaruta'aitɨani teniena memitawanikɨ.   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ Papuru mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kakaɨyari 'ekɨta pɨmatsiwani, yakɨ xeikɨa pepɨti'aitame. 'Ekɨ 'apekanakani 'aitsika kemɨkahaine peti'aitatɨ nemukuweiyaxɨanikɨ.   
\p
\v 4 Papuru 'aurie memuti'ukai mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Peti'awaɨri 'aku 'ekɨ Kakaɨyari mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame pemɨtatienikɨ.   
\p
\v 5 Papuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ne'iwama, 'atsinepɨkatimaikai mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame hɨkɨtɨme nepɨka'eriekai. 'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ pɨre'uxa: “'Axapepɨkarenutahɨaweni teɨteri wahetsiemieme manuyeka”.   
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ Papuru timaitɨ hixɨata me'atɨ tsarutseutsixi memɨhɨkɨtɨkai meta hixɨata me'atɨ paritseutsixi memɨhɨkɨtɨkai, 'itsɨkate wahɨxie mɨpaɨ katiniuhiwa:  
\p —Ne'iwamarixi ne paritseu nekanihɨkɨtɨni. Xepɨnetsixaneta nemɨta'ikwewakɨ yuri nemɨti'eriekɨ mɨkite kememɨte'anuku'uitɨarieni hepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 7 Mexi 'akuxi 'utaniuka, paritseutsixi meta tsarutseutsixi mekaniyutiniukimatɨkɨne, mana memuyuxeɨriekai hixɨata mekaniyutsana.  
\v 8 (Tsarutseutsixi mɨpaɨ meputiyuane kename mɨkite meka'anuku'uni, niuki tuayamete meta 'iyarite tixaɨtɨ mekatehɨkɨ, matsi paritseutsixi mɨpaɨ mekatenimaika 'ikɨ naimekɨ).   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ waɨkawamekɨ mekaniuyuxamɨrieni, hikɨ hipatɨ 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai paritseutsixi me'anuku'uka, mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani: «Tame tixaɨtɨ tepɨkate'ukaxei 'axati'anekame 'ikɨ tewi hepaɨtsita. Xɨaritsɨ 'iyari kanitahɨawe yanutsutɨni niuki tuayame».  
\v 10 Waɨkawari meha'akaku, kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame kanimakaitɨni kapa Papuru me'umienikɨ. Hikɨ kuyaxi katiniwaruta'aitɨani waɨriyarika me'ipitɨatɨ memenuhanakɨ, kuyaxi wakiita.   
\p
\v 11 'Uxa'arieka yɨwikɨta Ti'aitame Papuru 'auriena kaniuyuhekɨata mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Pepɨkamaka. Kerutsaremetsie kepemɨnetihekɨatakai, kaneuyewekata Xumatsie mɨpaɨ pemɨnetihekɨatanikɨ».   
\s1 Papuru kememɨtemienikekai  
\p
\v 12 Hikɨ tau 'anatineku, huriyutsixi hipatɨ mekaniyu'enieni. Mekaniyuhɨritɨani mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Tepɨkatekwani meta tepɨka'anuhareni kepaukake Papuru temɨmieni».  
\v 13 Huta tewiyari meyupaɨmetɨ mɨpaɨ mekateniyɨhɨritɨakaitɨni.  
\v 14 Mawari wewiwamete memɨhɨritɨariekai wahetsɨa meta 'ukirawetsixi wahetsɨa me'u'axɨaka mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Tame mɨpaɨ tepɨtetahɨritɨa, tixaɨtɨ tepɨkatekwaka Papuru temiemeke.  
\v 15 Hikɨ 'ayumieme xeme 'itsɨkate wahamatɨa yaxeketeneutahɨawi kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame xehetsɨa mewitɨnikɨ, 'aixɨa 'anemekɨ matsi xemɨtehetimanikɨ hepaɨtsitana. Tame kanuawekaku 'akuxi tekaniyuha'aritɨaka huyeta temeimienikɨ.   
\p
\v 16 Hikɨ Papuru matsuya kaniu'ena kememɨte'imienikekai. Mana nuaka kuyaxi wakiita heutahaka, Papuru katiniutaxatɨani.  
\v 17 Papuru yu'aurie xeime 'utakwewieka xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tewa'aitɨwamete, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Ikɨ temaikɨ kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame hetsɨa kenanuwitɨki. Mɨkɨ pɨrayexeiya mɨreitaxatɨanikɨ.   
\p
\v 18 Mɨkɨ kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame hetsɨa kaneiwitɨni. Mɨpaɨta katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Papuru manutahɨiya yu'aurie netsi'utahɨaweka pɨnetsi'utawawiri 'ahɨxie 'ikɨ temaikɨ nemɨ'atɨanikɨ. Pɨrayexeiya 'ahamatɨa.   
\p
\v 19 Kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame temaikɨ mamayatsie tiwiereka, yɨhɨkɨate yateewa mehekɨneka mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Ketita kuta perayexeiya?   
\p
\v 20 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Huriyutsixi mepɨtehekuxata, memetsitawawirienike 'uxa'a Papuru pemanuwitɨnikɨ 'itsɨkate wahetsɨa, yemekɨ memɨtemaikakɨ hepaɨtsitana.  
\v 21 'Ekɨ mɨkɨ pepɨkawa'enieka, huta tewiyari meyupaɨmetɨ teɨteri wahetsɨa miemete mepikwewie, mɨpaɨ meteyɨhɨritɨatɨ memɨkatekwakakɨ meta memɨkaharekakɨ me'imiemeke. Hikɨ mekaniyuha'aritɨaka mematsikwewietɨ pemɨ'awaɨriyakɨ.   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame temaikɨ kanenɨ'ani mɨpaɨ re'imaiyatɨ:  
\p —Xeime tɨma pepɨkaraxaxatɨwani 'ikɨ hepaɨtsita kepemɨnetiutaxatɨa.   
\s1 Papuru Perixi kuwexinaruri hetsɨa kemɨrenɨ'arie  
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨawame xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tewa'aitɨwamete yuhutame yu'aurie warutahɨaweka, mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani:  
\p —Huta tsienituyari kuyaxi xekeniwarukuha'aritɨa, kawayutsixi wahetsie memautayaxiwawe haika tewiyari heimana tamamata, meta huta tsienituyari tepɨakɨ memɨteheutamɨiwawe Tsetsareyatsie memɨyehukɨ tɨkarikɨ 'atanauka hurayari 'aye'ayu.  
\v 24 Kawayutsixi xekeniwaranuhapani, Papuru manutiyerɨnikɨ 'aixɨa reu'erietɨ meta'anikɨ Perixi kuwexinaruri hetsɨa.   
\p
\v 25 Meta xapatsie mɨpaɨ katineka'utɨirieni:   
\pmo
\v 26 Ne Kɨrauriyu Ritsiyaxi,  
\b  
\pm kuwexinaruri pemɨtɨrɨkaɨye Perixi:  
\b  
\pm Nepɨmatsiwaɨritɨa.   
\b  
\pm
\v 27 'Ikɨ tewi huriyutsixi mekaniwiya, 'ari mekanimienikekaitɨni, ne nekuyaxima wahamatɨa hetsiena nekaniutanuani, mɨpaɨ nemɨretimaikaikɨ Xumatsie mɨkiekamekɨ.  
\v 28 Ne nepɨtimaimɨkɨkai titayari memɨteniukixiekai hepaɨtsitana, nekaneiwitɨni huriyutsixi wa'itsɨkate wahetsɨa.  
\v 29 Nepɨwaretaxei meniukixiekame kemaine wa'aitsika hepaɨtsita. Tixaɨtɨ 'atsipɨkati'anekai hetsiena mɨrahɨiwani mɨmierienikɨ meta manutahɨiyanikɨ.  
\v 30 Mɨpaɨ netiutahɨawarieka 'ikɨ tewi memimienikekaikɨ, kwitɨwa nekaneinɨ'ani 'ahetsɨa. Nepɨtiwaruta'aitɨa mɨkɨ hepaɨtsitana memɨniukixie 'ahɨxie memitahɨawekɨ. Mɨpaɨ xeikɨa.   
\p
\v 31 Hikɨ kuyaxi kememɨte'uta'aitɨariekai, Papuru yɨwikɨta mekanewitɨni 'Anutipatɨritsie paitɨ.  
\v 32 'Uxa'arieka kawayutsixi wahetsie memutei mekaniwaruku'eirieni mɨkɨ hamatɨana memɨyehukɨ, kuyaxi yɨ'ɨkama memuhukai yukiita mekanakunuaxɨani.  
\v 33 Kepauka Tsetsareya paitɨ memuta'axɨa, kuwexinaruri xapa mekaniyetuirieni meta Papuru mekaniyetuani.  
\v 34 Perixi xapa 'akaterɨwaka, Papuru kaniuta'iwawiya kemɨ'ane kwieyaritsie mɨmiemetɨkai. Retimaika Tsiritsiyatsie mɨkiekametɨkaikɨ,  
\v 35 mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Kamɨtsɨ, nepɨmatsi'enieni me'axɨayu mɨkɨ 'ahepaɨtsita memɨniukixie». Katiniuta'aita Herurexi paratsiyuyata me'ɨwiyariekakɨ.   
\c 24  
\s1 Papuru Perixi hɨxie yuhetsiemieme kemɨtiutaniu  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'auxɨwi tukari 'anukamiekaku, mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame 'Ananiyaxi mɨtitewa mana kaninuani, hipame 'ukirawetsixi wahamatɨa meta xewitɨ Terituru titewatɨ mɨniukametɨkai mekaniu'axɨani. Kuwexinaruri hetsɨa memɨtetaxatakɨ Papuru hepaɨtsita.  
\v 2 Kepauka mɨxanetsie wahetsɨa mɨ'atɨarie, Terituru kanitsutɨani 'ixanetatɨ Perixi hɨxie, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Ekɨ Pemɨmariwe pekatanipitɨaka, timaiweme pemɨhɨkɨkɨ waɨkawa pekataniheitseritɨaka tateɨterima tahetsiemieme.  
\v 3 Neuxei Perixi pemɨtɨrɨkaɨye, naitsarie kwiepa pekanimariwani naime 'aixɨa kepemɨtiyuriene.  
\v 4 Matsi pemɨkawaɨripiekakɨ waɨkawa niukikɨ, 'ayumieme nepɨmetsiwawirie pemɨtatsi'enienikɨ 'etsiwa tepɨmatetaxatɨani 'aixɨa kepemɨtiuka'iyarikɨ.  
\v 5 'Ikɨ tewi tekanetaxeiya yunaime huriyutsixi waxamurieneme naitsarie kwiepa. Natsaretitanaka hetsie memɨtewiya katiniwa'aitɨwametɨni.  
\v 6 Meta tukita kaneutahakekaitɨni ka'itiyakame 'ayeitɨatɨ, 'ayumieme tekaniwiya.  
\v 7 Matsi Ritsiyaxi nuaka kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame mɨhɨkɨ, waɨriyarika kataniunawairieni.  
\v 8 Katatineta'aitɨani tame hepaɨtsitana temɨniukixie 'ahetsɨa temahukɨ. 'Ekɨta pe'ita'iwawiyame pekaniyɨweni pemɨretimani naime ketemɨteniukixie hepaɨtsitana.   
\p
\v 9 Meta huriyutsixi mekaniniukimakaitɨni, mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ kename naitɨ tiyuritɨkai.  
\v 10 Kepauka kuwexinaruri yumu'ukɨ 'i'inɨaritɨaku mɨtaniunikɨ, Papuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yanetimaitɨ 'ekɨ mɨixa wiyari kepemɨtiuyuri 'ena 'ikɨ teɨteri wakuwexinaruri pehɨkɨtɨtɨ, 'ayumieme 'aixɨa 'iyarikɨ nehetsiemieme nepɨtaniuni kemɨtikuxaxatsiwa nehepaɨtsita.  
\v 11 'Ekɨ pekaniyɨweni pemɨtimaikakɨ, tamamata heimana huta tukari pɨka'anukayeiwe 'akuxi kepauka Kerutsaremetsie nemeutiyunixɨ neyutanenewienike.  
\v 12 Netsixanetamete tukita mepɨkanetsi'utaxei 'axanetikuxatame, tukite 'etsimɨpepeta meta xaɨtsie kiekaritsie.  
\v 13 Mepɨkayɨwawe memitseiriyani yuniuki kememɨteniukixie nehepaɨtsita hikɨ.  
\v 14 Mɨpaɨ nepɨmatitahekɨatɨanikeyu: ne 'ikɨ huye ne'uweiyatɨ nepɨti'uximaya tatutsima wakakaɨyari hetsiemieme, tsepanetɨ netsixanetamete 'ikɨ huye xaɨtsie tiwiyakame memɨxata, yanepɨra'eriwa 'inɨari niukiyari kemɨti'ɨkita meta yuri nepɨti'erie naitɨ kemɨraka'utɨarie Kakaɨyari niukametemama waxapayaritsie.  
\v 15 Kakaɨyari hetsie nepɨta'ikwewa 'ikɨ teɨteri kememɨteta'ikwewa wahepaɨ, kename me'anuku'uitɨarieni yamemɨtekahu meta yamemɨkatekahu.  
\v 16 'Ikɨ naime hepaɨtsita yanekatiniyurieneni ne'iyari kanetsi'utate'akaku, Kakaɨyari hɨxie meta teɨteri wahepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 17 »Hikɨ ne tumini nekaniuxeɨrieni neteɨterima Kerutsareme kiekatari wahetsiemieme, yapaɨmexɨa wiyari mɨpaɨ nekatiniyurienekaitɨni. Manaketa 'imikieri ne'a'ɨtɨ nekaninuani.  
\v 18 'Itiya mawariyari newewiekaku hipatɨ huriyutsixi 'atsiyatari mekanenetaxeiya tukita. Yumɨiretɨ teɨteri 'amepɨka'u'uwakai ne'aurie, nepɨkawaxamuriekai.  
\v 19 Memɨnetsi'uxei hipatɨ huriyutsixi 'Atsiya kiekatari mepɨyɨakai, neuyeweka mɨkɨ memɨ'axɨani 'ahɨxie, meta peuyewetse yamemɨtiyuanikɨ kememɨnetexaneta, xɨkatsɨ nehetsiemieme mete'ayexeiyani.  
\v 20 Hikɨtsɨ, 'ena yameke'utiyuaneni tita memɨte'ukaxei nehetsie mɨkatiheitserie kepauka ne 'itsɨkate wahɨxie nemuwekai,  
\v 21 tita memɨte'ukaxei xeime neniukitsie karima ne'utaniuku mɨkɨ wahɨxie mɨpaɨ ne'utaitɨ: “Mɨkite memanuku'uni mɨpaɨ yuri nemɨti'eriekɨ, 'ayumieme mɨkɨkɨ hikɨ xehɨxie nekanixeɨriyaka”».   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ Perixi heitseriemekɨ katinimaikaitɨni mɨkɨ huye hepaɨtsita. 'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Ritsiyaxi kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame nuayuke, xeniuki hepaɨtsita yanepɨtixetahɨawe.   
\p
\v 23 Xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame kaniuhɨritɨani mi'ɨwiyanikɨ, matsitsiere kanihɨritɨani mipitɨakakɨ yu'iwama wahamatɨa muyeikanikɨ meta mɨkɨ memiparewiekakɨ tita mɨreuyehɨwakɨ.   
\p
\v 24 Hikɨ yapaɨmexɨa tukari 'anukayaku, Perixi yɨ'ɨya hamatɨa Rutsira huriyu tewiyari mɨhɨkɨtɨkai mana nuaka. Papuru yu'aurie kaniutakwewieni, meta kani'enieni tikuxatame yuri kemɨti'erie Kɨritsitu Ketsutsi hetsie.  
\v 25 Tikuxatakaku tita mɨtiheitserie hepaɨtsita, tewi kemɨtiyɨnɨ'a hepaɨtsita meta tewi kemɨtita'iwawiyarieni 'uxa'atɨniwarie, Perixi kaniutimani, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Hikɨri mɨpaɨ xeikɨa kenemie. Kepaukaketa tukari nemɨhɨka nepɨmatitanɨ'airieni».  
\v 26 Perixi kanita'ikwewakaitɨni Papuru tumini 'i'ɨitɨanike 'erietɨ. 'Ayumieme mɨixa yu'aurie pitakwekwewiwakai, tikuxatatɨ hamatɨana.   
\p
\v 27 Huta wiyari 'anuyeyaku Perixi kaniuyupata, Purutsiyu Petsitu kuwexinaruri kanayani. Perixi huriyutsixi wanaki'atsitɨamɨtɨ, 'ayumieme Papuru katsariyanata kananutahɨani.   
\c 25  
\s1 Papuru Tsetsaxi hamatɨa kemɨtiutaxa  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Petsitu nuaka hakewa mehɨritɨariekai, hairieka tukari 'aye'aku, Tsetsareya heyeyaka Kerutsaremetsie kaninuani.  
\v 2 Mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete meta huriyutsixi wa'ukiyarima hɨxiena mekaniu'axɨani metehekɨatatɨ Papuru hepaɨtsita.  
\v 3 Mekanitawawirieni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «'Aixɨa petiuka'iyaritɨ Kerutsaremetsie Papuru kenanunɨ'a». Mɨkɨri yamepɨte'uxatakai huyeta kememɨte'imienikekai.  
\v 4 Petsitu mɨpaɨ katiniuta'ani: «Papuru Tsetsareya paitɨ kananutahɨiyaka, ne yareutewitɨ mana nepɨyemie.  
\v 5 Xetsata miemete memanuyetei nehamatɨa mekehekɨne, mɨkɨ yamekehetiyuani hepaɨtsitana, xɨkatsɨ kwinimieme 'axatiuyurieni».   
\p
\v 6 Mɨixa pɨka'uyuri huriyutsixi watsata 'uyeikatɨ, 'atahaika tukari yatɨni tamamata tukari xeikɨa puyuri. Manaketa Tsetsareyatsie kaneyani. 'Uxa'arieka mɨrewa'aitatsie, Papuru mɨ'atɨarienikɨ katiniuta'aita.  
\v 7 Mana mɨkɨ nuaku 'auriena mekaniyukuxeɨrieni huriyutsixi, Kerutsaremetsie memakanexɨa, waɨkawa tɨrɨkawimekɨ 'axamekaniutiyuanekaitɨni memɨniukixienikɨ hepaɨtsitana. Mepɨyutatexi tixaɨ mepɨkate'ukaxei yuniukikɨ.   
\p
\v 8 Papuru yuhetsie nuatɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —'Atsinepɨkatiuyuri 'axati'anemekɨ huriyutsixi wa'inɨari niukiyari hepaɨtsita, watuki meta Tsetsaxi hepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 9 Petsitu wanaki'aritɨamɨtɨ huriyutsixi Papuru mɨpaɨ katiniuta'eiya:  
\p —¿Peti'awaɨriya Kerutsareme pemɨyemie mana pemɨta'iwawiyarienikɨ nehɨxie 'ikɨ xanetsika hepaɨtsita?   
\p
\v 10 Papuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ne Tsetsaxi 'uwenieya hɨxie nekaniuweni nemɨta'iwawiyarienikɨ. Mana xeikɨa temɨta'iwawiyarienikɨ xɨka 'axanetiuyurieni. 'Axanepɨkawaruyuri huriyutsixi, heitseriemekɨ 'ekɨ kepemɨtimate.  
\v 11 'Axa xɨka netiuyurienike, tixaɨ xɨka netiuyurienike kemɨreuyewetse nemɨmɨnikɨ, nepɨkaneku'imawa nemɨmɨnikɨ. Metsɨ xɨka katiyuritɨni 'ikɨ kememɨteniukixie nehepaɨtsita, xewitɨ pɨkayɨwe mɨkɨ wahetsɨa mɨnetsiyetuanikɨ wanaki'aritɨamɨtɨ. Tsetsaxi hɨxie nekanitaniumɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 12 Hikɨ Petsitu 'imawamete wahamatɨa tiutaxataka meri mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Tsetsaxi hetsɨa 'aku petimie. Hikɨ, Tsetsaxi hetsɨa pekaniyemieni.   
\s1 Papuru 'Akɨripa meta Werenitse wahɨxie kemɨti'atɨarie  
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ mɨixa tukari 'anukayaku, kwiepa ti'aitame 'Akɨripa mɨtitewa meta Werenitse hamatɨa Petsitu Tsetsareya paitɨ mekaneiku'iwata.  
\v 14 Yapaɨmexɨa tukari mana mepuyuri. Petsitu ti'aitame katinikuxaxatɨwakaitɨni Papuru hepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Xewitɨ tewi 'uwa puku'eiriwaxɨ Perixi menutahɨa.  
\v 15 Kerutsaremetsie neheta'aku, hepaɨtsitana mekateniutahekɨata mawari wewiwamete memɨhɨritɨarie, huriyutsixi wa'ukiyarima, menetsiwawirietɨ manutahɨiyanikɨ.  
\v 16 Netsɨ mɨpaɨ nekatiniwaruta'eiya, xumatari tayeiyari mɨpaɨ pɨka'ane, tewi tepɨka'iyetuani, hɨxiena meka'axɨawawekaku 'akuxi mɨkɨ hepaɨtsitana memɨniukixie, kayɨwekaku 'akuxi yuhetsiemieme mɨtaniuni waniukixiya hepaɨtsita.  
\v 17 'Uwa me'u'axɨaku, 'ayumieme 'anepɨkareuterixɨ. 'Uxa'arieka 'itsɨkame 'uwenieyatsie nemɨra'aitatsie ne'ayerɨka, nekatiniuta'aita mɨkɨ tewi mɨ'atɨarienikɨ.  
\v 18 Me'anuku'uka memɨtiniunikɨ, 'ixanetamete tixaɨtɨ 'axati'anekame mepɨkate'ukaxei hetsiena, ne kenemɨtita'ikwewakai.  
\v 19 Matsi xeikɨa niuki mekanixɨatɨakaitɨni tita memɨte'ayexeiya hepaɨtsita xeime Ketsutsi mɨmɨkikai hepaɨtsita, Papuru 'ayeniereme mɨxatakai, mɨkɨkɨ pɨta mekaniniukixiekaitɨni hepaɨtsitana.  
\v 20 Netsɨ 'atsinepɨkatimaikai 'ikɨ niuki hepaɨtsita. 'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ nekatinitahɨawe, ¿peti'awaɨriya Kerutsaremetsie pemɨyemie mana pemeta'iwawiyarienikɨ 'ikɨ hepaɨtsita?  
\v 21 Papuru kaneniutawawirieni nemi'ɨwiyanikɨ, ti'aitame 'Aukutsitu mi'enienike. 'Ayumieme nekatiniwaruta'aitɨani memi'ɨwiyanikɨ Tsetsaxi hetsɨa Xumatsie ne'enunɨ'ayuke.   
\p
\v 22 'Akɨripa Petsitu mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Netatsiere mɨkɨ tewi nekani'eniemɨkɨ.  
\p Petsitu mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Karikɨ 'ekɨ 'uxa'a pekani'eniemɨkɨ.   
\s1 Papuru yuhetsiemieme 'Akɨripa hɨxie kemɨtiutaniu  
\r (Nɨ'a 26:12-18 – Nɨ'a 9:3-8, 22:6-11)  
\p
\v 23 'Uxa'arieka 'Akɨripa Werenitse hamatɨa mekaniu'axɨani 'aixɨa mete'uyukemaritɨaka mariwemekɨ. Mana mɨrayutixexeɨritɨre mekaneutahaxɨani xeimiriyari kuyaxi tewa'aitɨwamete wahamatɨa, meta kiekatari memɨmatiwa wahamatɨa. Petsitu katiniuta'aita Papuru mawitɨkienikɨ.  
\v 24 Hikɨ Petsitu mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ti'aitame 'Akɨripa, meta xeme yunaitɨ tahamatɨa xemuyuxeɨrie, manari 'ikɨ tewi xekanixeiyani kemɨ'ane hepaɨtsita waɨriyarika xemɨnetsi'upitɨa yunaitɨ teɨteri huriyutsixi Kerutsaremetsie, mɨpaɨ mete'uhiwatɨ kename 'aixɨa ka'ane mayeniereni.  
\v 25 Ne tixaɨtɨ nepɨkatiukaxei kemɨtiuyuri kemɨreuyewetse mɨmierienikɨ. Mɨkɨtsɨ 'Aukutsitu yamɨtiutahɨawixɨkɨ, ne yanepɨtimaikai Xuma nemenunɨ'anikɨ.  
\v 26 Niuki mɨheitserie nepɨkahexeiya ti'aitame nemititi'utɨirienikɨ. 'Ayumieme nekani'atɨani xehetsɨa, meta 'ahetsɨa ti'aitame 'Akɨripa, pe'ita'iwawiyame tixaɨtɨ nemɨrexeiyanikɨ nemɨtiti'utɨanikɨ.  
\v 27 Timaiweme hepaɨ nepɨkayɨnikeyu xɨka xeime nehenɨ'anike hɨakame, nekatihekɨatatɨ ketitakɨ mɨtiniukimarie.   
\c 26  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'Akɨripa Papuru mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Pekanipitɨarieka 'ahetsiemieme pemɨtaniunikɨ.  
\p Papuru yumamakɨ waru'inɨaritɨaka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:   
\p
\v 2 —Neuxei ti'aitame 'Akɨripa, nepɨnetemawie 'ahɨxie nemɨtaniunikɨ hikɨ naime huriyutsixi kememɨneteniukima hepaɨtsita.  
\v 3 Huriyutsixi naime wayeiyari meta mɨkɨ niuki kememɨtexɨatɨa pekatinimaika. 'Ayumieme nepɨmatsiwawirie pemɨnetsi'enienikɨ petinewietɨ.   
\p
\v 4 »Yunaitɨ huriyutsixi mekatenimaika kenemɨtiuyeikakai nunutsiyari, neteɨterima watsata temaikɨyari paitɨ meta Kerutsaremetsie.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ matɨari paitɨ memɨnetsimaikai xɨka metehekɨatanike, mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanenikeyu ne kenemɨtikuyeikakai paritseutsixi wahetsie netiwiyatɨ. Paritseutsixi tita temɨtehayexeiyatsie yemekɨ yamepɨtekahu.  
\v 6 Hikɨ nepɨxanetsie yuri neti'erietɨ kenemɨtita'ikwewa meta Kakaɨyari tatutsima kemɨtiwarutahɨawekai meye'atɨanikɨ.  
\v 7 Yunaitɨ tateɨterima tamamata heimana huta nuiwarite temɨhɨkɨ tukarikɨ meta tɨkarikɨ 'uximayatsikaya te'eyexeiyatɨ kwini mieme tenitakwewieka Kakaɨyari. Neuxei ti'aitame, ne yuri kenemɨti'erie mɨpaɨ netita'ikwewatɨ, 'ayumieme huriyutsixi nehepaɨtsita mepɨniukixie.  
\v 8 ¿Ketitayari xeme xekateyɨwawe yuri xemɨte'erieka kename Kakaɨyari mɨkite waranuku'uitɨani?   
\p
\v 9 »Neri heuyewekame nepɨ'eriekai waɨkawa 'axanemiyurienikɨ kemɨ'ane Ketsutsi natsaretitanaka mɨhɨkɨ.  
\v 10 Mɨpaɨ yaxeikɨa nekatiniyurienekaitɨni Kerutsaremetsie. Yumɨireme Kakaɨyari teɨterimama katsariyanata nepɨwaranutaxɨrɨwakai, mawari wewiwamete memɨhɨritɨarie heitserie menetsi'upitɨaku. Ne yanera'eriwakaku mepɨtakwikwiwakai.  
\v 11 Naime tukiteta mɨixa nepɨwaranutaxɨrɨwakai, waɨriyarika nepɨwapitɨakai 'axamemɨtiyuanikɨ Ketsutsi hepaɨtsita. Waɨkawa newahekatɨ nekaniwataweweiyakaitɨni hipame kiekaritetsie.   
\p
\v 12 »Hikɨ mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete heitserie menetsi'upitɨaku kememɨtehɨritɨariekai Ramatsikutsie nekaneyani.  
\v 13 Hikɨ tuka mana ne'uyemiekaku, neuxei ti'aitame, mexi'akuxi huyeta ne'uyemietɨ nekanixeiya hekɨariya taheima mieme, tau reuyeta tixawatɨme ne'aurie kaniukuhekɨare meta nehamatɨa memuhukai.  
\v 14 Tanaitɨ kwiepa tepatixɨri, meta ne xeime nepɨ'eni mɨpaɨ netikɨhɨaweme 'arameutsixi waniukikɨ: “Tsauru, Tsauru, ¿ketitayari penetiuweiya?” Pepɨtiuka'eniwa pemɨka'awaɨriyakɨ, pemɨti'amemiwakɨ pe'anatseiwatɨ titsewemekɨ.  
\v 15 Netsɨ mɨpaɨ nekatinita'iwawiya: “¿Ti'aitame kepepɨpaikɨ?” Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya: “Netsɨ Ketsutsi nekanihɨkɨtɨni pemɨnetsi'uweiya.  
\v 16 Hikɨri kenanukukexi, meta keneneu'eni. 'Ayumieme hikɨ nepɨnehekɨataxɨ 'ahɨxie, pemanayexeiyariekɨ ti'uximayatame pemayanikɨ, meta pemɨtihekɨatanikɨ nehetsiemieme kepemɨnetiuxei meta kenemɨmatitahekɨatɨani 'akuxi.  
\v 17 'Ateɨterima watsata nepɨmatsixɨna meta memɨkahuriyutsixi watsata, nekamenanunɨ'amɨkɨ  
\v 18 meheunenieretɨ memakɨnekɨ, yɨriya meku'eirieme hekɨariyatsie memɨtewiyanikɨ, kauyumarie tɨrɨkariyaya meku'eirieme Kakaɨyari hetsie memɨtewiyanikɨ, tita 'axamemɨteyurie memɨteheuyehɨwiyarienikɨ nehetsie yuri mete'erietɨ, wahetsie mɨtinakenikɨ tita memɨtetanaki'erieni mɨkɨ nemɨwarupataxɨ nehetsiemieme”.   
\p
\v 19 »Neuxeitsɨ ti'aitame 'Akɨripa, yanetikamietɨ nepatɨa kenemɨtixei taheima mieme.  
\v 20 Nekanitsutɨani Ramatsiku kiekatari wahetsɨa meri, kwitɨwa Kerutsareme meta naitsarie Kureya kwieyaritsie, yaxeikɨata memɨkahuriyutsi watsata nekatiniwahekɨatɨakaitɨni memɨtehayewanikɨ 'axakememɨteyurie Kakaɨyari hetsie memɨtewiyanikɨ, yameteyurietɨ kememɨte'uhayewaxɨ wahetsie mɨmatsiɨkɨnikɨ.  
\v 21 'Ayumieme mɨkɨkɨ huriyutsixi tukita menetsi'uwiyaka meta mekanenimiekukaitɨni.  
\v 22 Matsi Kakaɨyari kaneniparewieka hikɨ 'akuxi, mɨpaɨ nekatiniyuwaɨriyani netiwahekɨatɨatɨ teɨteri 'ukirawetsixi meta tɨɨri yunaime. Kakaɨyari niukametemama meta Muitsexi kememutiyua yamɨtiyɨnikekaikɨ:  
\v 23 Kɨritsitu mɨtikwinekɨ heuyewekai, kename mɨkɨ meri 'anukukeka mɨkite watsata, watahekɨatɨanikekai yuteɨterima meta memɨkahuriyutsixi hekɨariya hepaɨtsita».   
\p
\v 24 Merikɨtsɨ Papuru mɨpaɨ 'utayɨku yuhetsie nuatɨ, Petsitu karima mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Papuru pepɨka'uka'iyariri. Waɨkawa 'ɨkitɨarikakɨ pɨmatsiheuyehɨa.   
\p
\v 25 Papuru mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Matsi ne 'aixɨa nepɨtinekɨhɨawe Petsitu pemɨmariwe. Kenemɨtikuxata kaniyuritɨni meta timaiweme niukieya pɨhɨkɨ.  
\v 26 Ti'aitame 'ikɨ naime pɨtimate, 'ayumieme nekamatɨ yanekatinikuxatani. 'Ikɨ kenemɨtikuxata hikɨke pɨkamieme, 'awie pɨkatiuxatsie.  
\v 27 Neuxei ti'aitame 'Akɨripa, ¿'ekɨ yuri peti'erie Kakaɨyari niukametemama waniukitsie? Ne nekatinimaika yuri pekatini'erieka.   
\p
\v 28 'Akɨripa Papuru mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ariri Kɨritsitiyanu penerayeitɨanikeyu.   
\p
\v 29 Papuru mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kakaɨyari nenewieri nepupitɨa, tsepa 'etsimɨtipaɨme yatɨni mɨtiwaɨkawa, 'ekɨri meta yunaitɨ xemɨnetsi'enie hikɨ, xɨkatɨma nehepaɨ xe'anenetɨ xehakɨneke, 'ikɨ tepɨa xeikɨa xekahexeiyatɨ kɨmana nemɨhɨa.   
\p
\v 30 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ 'utayɨku, ti'aitame kananukekeni meta kuwexinaruri, Werenitse meta wahamatɨa mematekai mekananuku'uni.  
\v 31 Me'anuyekɨneka yunaitɨ yamekateniyɨkɨhɨawekaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —'Ikɨ tewi 'atsipɨkatiuyuri pɨkaheuyewetse mɨmɨerinikɨ meta manutahɨiyanikɨ.   
\p
\v 32 'Akɨripa Petsitu mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ikɨ tewi pɨyɨwenikeyu mɨxɨnarieni, xɨka Tsetsaxi ka'utahɨaweke xeikɨa.   
\c 27  
\s1 Papuru Xumatsie kemɨrenɨ'arie  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ kepauka Petsitu yamɨtiuyuma temɨyehukɨ kanuwa 'amɨpa 'Itariya paitɨ, Papuru meta hipatɨ pɨretsutsixi wahamatɨa mekaniyetuiyani. Xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame Kuriyu mɨtitewakai hetsɨa, 'Aukutsitu kuyaximama mɨwara'iniekai.  
\v 2 Kanuwa 'amɨpa 'Aruramitiyu pɨmiemetɨkai. 'Atsiya kwieyaritsie tetsita kaniuyeyeikakaitɨni. Mana te'akayaxeka tekanekɨne. Tahamatɨata kaneyani 'Aritsitariku tetsarunika kiekame Matseruniya kwieyaritsie mɨmiemetɨkai.   
\p
\v 3 'Uxa'arieka Tsiruni tekaneta'axɨani. Kuriyu Papuru waɨkawa naki'erietɨ. Kanipitɨani yuhamikuma wahetsɨa meta'anikɨ mɨkɨ memiparewiekakɨ.  
\v 4 Tsiruni temɨyekɨ, Tsipɨre warita tekaniuyekɨne tahepa meuye'ekakaikɨ.  
\v 5 Haramara 'utɨa tekaniuyekɨne Tsiritsiya meta Pamɨpiriya. Mana tekaneta'axɨani Mira Ritsiya kwieyaritsie.  
\v 6 Xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame kanuwa 'amɨpa mana kaniuxeiya 'Arekanitɨriya mieme 'Itariyatsie mɨyemiekai, mɨkɨtsie tekaneutiyaxe.  
\v 7 Mɨixa tukari mana tepuhukai tepɨka'ayekɨniwawekai. Haweri mieme tekaneta'axɨani Kɨniru hɨxie. 'Eka mɨkatatsipitɨakaikɨ, mana teyekɨneka. Kɨreta hetɨa tekaniuyehukaitɨni, hɨri manukaniere Tsarimuna mɨrakutewa 'aurie tekaniuyekɨne.  
\v 8 Mana haweri mieme xeikɨa tekananuyenexɨani, 'ariketa hatetsita 'Aixɨa Mɨtiuku'ane mɨrakutewatsie tekaneta'axɨani. Mana Ratseya kiekariyari kanehurakaitɨni.   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ mɨixa tukari tekaneuyehɨani, kanuwa 'amɨpa kanikweriwa'anekaitɨni, manutiyakaikɨ huriyutsixi wahakiya. Papuru mɨpaɨ katiwaraye'eritɨani, mɨpaɨ tiwakɨhɨawetɨ:  
\v 10 «Neuxei, mɨpaɨ nepɨtimate, xɨka te'uhuni kanuwa 'amɨpatsie meta xe'ikate pɨreuyeweni, meta tame tepɨtatɨmaiyarieni».  
\v 11 Xeitsienituyari tiwa'aitɨwame Papuru kemainekai pɨka'u'eni, matsi pɨta kanuwa 'amɨpa mɨkuyuitɨwa meta kanuwa kutsiyarieya kaniwaru'enieni.  
\v 12 Mɨrati'ikapiwa pɨkuhahautɨrekai. 'Ayumieme yumɨiretɨ mepuyu'eni memɨyehukɨ, Penitse paitɨ memɨye'axɨanikɨ, mana memɨtitenikɨ muhaɨtɨtsie. Penitsi katinakutewaka hake mɨrati'ikapiwa Kɨretatsie, tatsutɨa meta ta'utata paye'eka tahepa.   
\s1 Wiyeri mɨtɨrɨkaɨye haramaratsie kemɨtiwarutayuitɨwakai  
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ tatsutɨa hepatsie 'eka kanatineni ketemɨtehu, kememɨteku'eriwakai tiu'ekame mepɨ'eriekai. Kanuwa mukuhana me'anatihanaka mekanekɨne, Kɨreta 'aurie mekaniuyekɨne.  
\v 14 Yareutewikaku karima 'eka pitsutɨa tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ, Tayeta Mieme titewatɨ, kwie 'esimɨyewatsie paitɨ mayene.  
\v 15 Hikɨ kanuwa 'amɨpa pɨkayɨwekai 'ekakɨ, tepɨkayɨwawekai temuhunikɨ tahepa maye'ekakaikɨ, te'ihayewaku 'eka mɨtɨrɨkaɨye katane'enitsitɨani.  
\v 16 Kwie hapa mɨyema hetɨa Kɨraura mɨrakutewa tekanakunexɨani, haweri mieme xeikɨa kanuwa 'etsimɨpe temɨwiyakɨ tepɨyɨwawekai.  
\v 17 Me'enatihanaka mekanenakahɨaxɨani kaunarikɨ mɨtatseirekɨ. Mekanimamakaitɨni Tsirite xiekariyaritsie mete'utawaxɨanikɨ, mɨtikuhapatɨka mekaxɨrieka, mɨpaɨ me'anetɨ kanuwa 'amɨpatsie mekaniu'enixɨaximekaitɨni.  
\v 18 Witari yemekɨ pɨtatsi'utayuitɨwakai. 'Uxa'arieka yu'ika kanuwatsie mekananatixɨrieni.  
\v 19 Hairieka tukaritsie tamamakɨ kanuwa 'amɨpa piiniteya tekatenanatixɨrieni.  
\v 20 Mɨixa tukari tau meta xurawetsixi tepɨkawaruxei, witari tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ pɨkatihayewakai, kataneuyexɨrieni ketemɨteta'ikwewakai temɨtawikwenikɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Hikɨ mɨixa tukariri tekatekwakaku, 'ana Papuru wahixɨapa 'utakeka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Neuxei, xɨka xenetsi'u'enienike yanemainekaitsie Kɨretatsie temɨkaheyekɨnekɨ, mɨpaɨ hikɨ tepɨkateheuyehɨanikekai meta tepɨkate'uka'eniwanikekai.  
\v 22 Hikɨtsɨari nekaxenaye'eritɨwani xemuyuwaɨriyanikɨ, xewitɨ xeme yutukari pɨkatatɨmaiya, kanuwa 'amɨpa xeikɨa tepɨtatɨmaiya.  
\v 23 Tɨkarikɨ Kakaɨyari niukieya tuayame kaneyuhekɨata nehɨxie kemɨ'ane hetsie nemɨtiwiya meta nemɨti'uximayatsirie,  
\v 24 mɨpaɨ kanetiniutahɨawe: “Papuru, pepɨkamaka. Kaneuyeweka Tsetsaxi hɨxie pemɨtakenikɨ, meta Kakaɨyari pɨmatsi'upitɨa watukari yunaime 'ahamatɨa memuhu kanuwa 'amɨpatsie”.  
\v 25 'Ayumieme nepaine, xekeneyuwaɨriyani. Kakaɨyari hetsie ne yuri nepɨti'erie mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨnikɨ kenemɨtiutahɨawarie.  
\v 26 Matsi xeikɨa tame kwie hapa mɨyematsie tepɨtixɨriyani».   
\s1 Kanuwa 'amɨpa kemɨtiuta'unixɨ  
\p
\v 27 Hikɨ tamamata heimana nauka tɨkariyari 'anukamiekaku 'eka mɨtɨrɨkaɨye, haramara 'Aruriyatiku mɨrakutewa hepa katane'enitsitɨani, tɨkari hixɨapa kanuwa nɨ'awamete kwiepa heukahurame mepɨ'eriekai.  
\v 28 Kaunari hapa mekaneukawiwieni, mekaniti'inɨata xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana 'atahuta meturuyari kaneukatewakaitɨni. Yame'ahutɨ hutariekata mekaneikawiwieni, xeitewiyari heimana 'atahuta meturuyari kaneukatewakaitɨni.  
\v 29 Mekanimamakaitɨni tetetsie me'anutatenike me'erietɨ. Naukame mekaneukaxɨrieni tiyuhapaname kɨtsapana mehewɨtɨaka, meta mekaniyutanenewieni mɨkahekɨarekɨ.  
\v 30 Kanuwa 'amɨpa nɨ'awamete mekatenikuwautɨwekaitɨni kememɨteyuta'unakɨ kanuwatsie, tenɨ'awamete kanuwa 'etsimɨpepe mekaneukatuani haramaratsie mɨwatawikweitsitɨanikɨ, mɨtikuhapatɨka kanuwa hɨxie memeukaxɨrɨwani hepaɨ mekateniyuriekaitɨni.  
\v 31 Papuru mɨpaɨ katiniwaraye'eritɨani xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame meta kuyaxi: «'Ikɨ xɨka kanuwatsie mekayuhayewa, xeme xepɨkatawikweni».  
\v 32 'Ayumieme kuyaxi kanuwa 'etsimɨpepe kaunariyari mekanaxitexɨani, hapa paitɨ kaneukaxɨrieni.   
\p
\v 33 Kahekɨarirɨmekakuri, kepauka Papuru yunaime kaniwatuikakaitɨni memɨtekwanikɨ: «Hikɨri tamamata heimana nauka tukari xepuyurie xekatekwatɨ.  
\v 34 'Ayumieme nepɨxewawirie, xemɨtekwanikɨ, kaneuyeweka xemayenenierenikɨ, nixewitɨ xeme xeikɨpayari yumu'utsie pɨkatatɨmaiya».  
\v 35 Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka paa 'uti'ɨka Kakaɨyari pamɨpariyutsi kaniupitɨani yunaime wahɨxie. Kanititara, kanitsutɨani 'ikwatɨ.  
\v 36 Yunaitɨ mɨkɨta mekaniuyuwaɨriya, memitikwanikɨ.  
\v 37 Kanuwa 'amɨpatsie temɨyetekai huta tsienituyari heimana haika tewiyari heimana tamamata heimana 'ataxewi teɨteri tekanitapaɨmekaitɨni.  
\v 38 Te'utihuxakari 'ikwaikɨ, kanuwa tekana'exanariya tɨriku haramaratsie teheukaxɨrieka.   
\p
\v 39 Hikɨ kepauka mukuhekɨarixɨ, kwie mepɨkamaiwawekai, matsi kwie mekaniuxeiya 'ahakuyeukame, hakewa kanuwa memeye'atɨanikekai xɨka meyɨwawenike.  
\v 40 Mɨtikuhapatɨka mekanaxitexɨani, haramaratsie mekaneikaxɨrieni, 'inɨ'awame kaunariyari mekaniuxɨna. Karɨpa 'etsimɨyewa metixɨraka, kwiepa mekaniuyenexɨaximekaitɨni.  
\v 41 Matsi kanuwa xiekaripa kananutateni. Muwa kwiepa mekanatinexɨani. Tsurieya kwiepa kaneuhani, mana kaniyuhayewa kaniutseni, kɨtsapana kanita'unikekaitɨni tɨrɨkariyakɨ.  
\v 42 Hikɨ kuyaxi mekaniwakwikukaitɨni hipame pɨretsutsixi, xewitɨ 'uhauximetɨ mɨkatawikwenikɨ.  
\v 43 Matsi xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame Papuru pɨwikweitsitɨamɨkɨkai, 'ayumieme kaniwaruta'imaiya mɨpaɨ memɨkateyuriekakɨ. Katiniwaruta'aitɨani mana memeukatsunaxɨanikɨ meri memahauwawekai, kwiepa memɨtinexɨanikɨ,  
\v 44 hipatɨta kɨyexitetsie hipatɨta kanuwa tarimeyaritsie mehawɨtɨ mekaneutanexɨani. Mɨpaɨ tete'uhauxɨaka teyunaitɨ 'aixɨa teteheu'erietɨ teputawikwei kwiepa paitɨ.   
\c 28  
\s1 Papuru Maritatsie kemɨtiuyeikakai  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ te'utawikweka, 'anake tekatenetimani kwie hapa mɨyemakai Marita katinitewakaitɨni.  
\v 2 Teɨteri mana kiekatari yemekɨ 'aixɨa mekateniu'iyarikaitɨni tahepaɨtsita. Me'atinaika, mekatani'iniekaitɨni 'ahurawa temukɨnekɨ, mɨwiyekaikɨ meta muhaɨtɨkaikɨ.  
\v 3 Hikɨ Papuru nekukɨ'eni, taipa menutixɨrienikɨ. Kuu tai makatɨ yuta'unake, mamayatsie kanitakeni.  
\v 4 Teɨteri mana kiekatari me'ixeiyatɨ kuu mamayatsie hawiekame, mɨpaɨ mekateniyukɨhɨawekaitɨni yunaitɨ: «Xɨari 'ikɨ tewi tiyumiekame pɨhɨkɨ, tsepanetɨ haramaratsie mutawikwei, heitserie pɨkapitɨarie 'ayenieretɨ mɨyuhayewanikɨ».  
\v 5 Matsi Papuru yumama kaniutatsike, kuu taipa kaneuweni, mɨkɨ 'atsipɨka'uyɨ pɨkatiukwinixɨ.  
\v 6 Mɨkɨ teɨteri mepikwewiekai mɨpaɨ meteku'eriwatɨ: «Tietɨtsɨ tahaimɨkɨ, yatɨni yapauka mɨmɨkɨ». Yamekateneutere me'itaxeiyatɨ 'atsipɨka'uyɨ, 'ayumieme yɨkɨ pɨta mekateniuyɨhɨawe, mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani: «Xɨari 'ikɨ kanikakaɨyaritɨni».  
\v 7 Hikɨ mana hurawa kwie kanikumakaitɨni, Pupiriyu naitɨ kwie haramara hixɨapa mɨyema katinipinieyatɨkaitɨni. Mɨkɨ yukie 'aixɨa tatixeiyatɨ kataniutanaki'erieni hikɨ haika tukari mana tekanikutekaitɨni hetsɨana.  
\v 8 Pupiriyu paapaya hɨiyakɨ meta hakwitsikɨ tikuyetɨ yu'itaritsie kanikakateitɨni. Papuru kaneikuxeiya, meta kaniyutanenewieni heimana 'utimetɨ 'ana mɨkɨ 'aixɨa reu'erietɨ kanayani.  
\v 9 Mɨyatiuyɨku, hipatɨta tekwikwikate haramara hixɨapa kwie mɨyematsie memɨtamakai mekani'axekaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'aixɨa meteheu'erietɨ mepakɨkakai.  
\v 10 Mɨkɨ waɨkawa 'aixɨa metatexeiyatɨ metatenimikwakaitɨni, meta teyehuximekaku mepɨtateyetuiri ketita temɨteheuyehɨakai.   
\s1 Papuru Xumatsie kemɨreta'a  
\p
\v 11 Hikɨ haika metseri te'uyurieka haramara hixɨapa kwie mɨyematsie, kanuwa 'amɨpatsie teyetekaku kaniukuhaɨtɨre. 'Arekanitɨriya miemetsie, kakaɨyarixi memuyuhuta wa'ɨkiyari mamakai.  
\v 12 Tsirakutsa teheta'axɨaka, haika tukari mana tekaniuyurieni.  
\v 13 Manata temɨyekɨ, Rekiyu tekaniye'axɨani. Xeitukari 'anukayaku, tatsɨtɨa 'eka kanatineni, meta hutarieka tukaritsie Putehuri tekaneta'axɨani.  
\v 14 Mana ta'iwamarixi tekaniwaretaxeiya, mɨkɨ mepɨtatsi'uta'ini 'atahuta tukari temɨyurienikɨ wahetsɨa. 'Imatɨrieka Xumatsie tekaniuta'axɨani.  
\v 15 Ta'iwamarixi Xuma kiekatari, mete'utamarieka tahepaɨtsita ketemeyɨkai, mɨrayutixexeɨritɨre paitɨ 'Apiyu huyeyari 'utɨma meta Haikatɨ mɨti'u mɨtiuyehipitɨretsie me'ayenexɨaka mekatananunake. Papuru waruxeiyaka, Kakaɨyari pamɨpariyutsi kaniupitɨani, meta waɨkawa kaniyuwaɨriyakaitɨni.  
\v 16 Kepauka Xumatsie temu'axɨa, Papuru kaniupitɨarieni yuxaɨtame kiita mayekanikɨ, xeime kuya hamatɨa mi'ɨwiyanikɨ.   
\s1 Papuru Xumatsie kemɨtikuxatakai  
\p
\v 17 Merikɨtsɨ hairieka tukaritsie Papuru huriyutsixi wa'ukiyarima yuhetsɨa kaniwaruta'inieni. Me'u'axɨaku mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei 'iwamarixi, tsepanetɨ 'atsinemɨkatiuyuri teɨteri wahepaɨtsita, tatutsima wayeiyari hepaɨtsita neka'uxiwa'atɨ, Kerutsaremetsie nehɨatɨ nepɨyetuiya xumatari wahetsɨa.  
\v 18 Mɨkɨ menetsi'uta'iwawiyaka mekanenixɨnakukaitɨni, ne 'axanemɨkatiuyuriekaikɨ nemɨmierienikɨ.  
\v 19 Huriyutsixi neniuki hepaɨtsita memɨniukixiekai, 'ayumieme waɨriyarika Tsetsaxi hetsɨa nekaniye'ani, tsepanetɨ neteɨterima wahepaɨtsita tixaɨtɨ nemɨkarayexeiyakai.  
\v 20 Hikɨ 'ayumieme nekanixe'uta'inieni temɨtaxeiyaxɨanikɨ meta xehamatɨa nemɨtitaxatakɨ. Mɨpaɨ yuri nemɨti'eriekɨ 'Ixaheri teɨteriyari kememɨteta'ikwewa 'ayumieme tepɨakɨ hikɨ nekanihɨaka.   
\p
\v 21 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'eiya:  
\p —Tame xapate tepɨka'anuhuriwawe Kureyatsie mieme 'ahepaɨtsita tikuxatame, meta xewitɨ ta'iwa pɨkanuawe 'axatatihekɨatɨatɨ yanɨtsɨtɨni 'axatikuxatatɨ 'ahepaɨtsita.  
\v 22 Matsi tekani'eniekuni kepemɨtiku'eriwa, mɨkɨtsie memɨtewiya wahepaɨtsita 'ikɨ xeikɨa tepɨtemate, naitsarie 'axamekatenikuxaxatsiwani.   
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ xeitukari mekananayexeiya Papuru hetsɨa memɨyukuxeɨrienikɨ, 'ana yumɨiretɨ mekaniu'axɨani kiitana mɨwayekatsie. Ximeripaitɨ 'itsutɨaka taikaike katiniutahayewa, tiwakuxaxatɨwatɨ meta tiwahekɨatɨatɨ kemɨreuyewetse Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku hepaɨtsita, yuri tiwa'eritɨamɨtɨ Ketsutsi hetsie, Muitsexi 'inɨarieyakɨ, meta Kakaɨyari niukametemama waxapayaritsie mɨkɨkɨ yuniuki tseiriyatɨ.  
\v 24 Hipatɨ yuri mekatenita'eririeni kemɨtikuxatakai, hipatɨta yuri mepɨkate'uta'eri.  
\v 25 Yunaitɨ yaxeikɨa meteyɨkɨhɨawetɨ mepɨkaheutayeixɨa, mekanitakɨkakaitɨni kepauka 'imatɨrieka Papuru mɨpaɨ mutayɨ: «Yurikɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata 'aixɨa kaniutayɨni, Kitsariyaxi Kakaɨyari niukameya mɨpaɨ tatutsima tiwarutahɨaweku:   
\q1
\v 26 »“'Ikɨ teɨteri wahetsɨa kenemie, mɨpaɨ ketiniwaretahɨawi:  
\q1 ‘Tsepanetɨ waɨkawa xemɨ'enana, matsi xepɨkaheitimaitɨkɨne,  
\q2 tsepanetɨ waɨkawa xemeuneniere, matsi tixaɨtɨ xepɨkatexeiya’.   
\q1
\v 27 'Ikɨ teɨteri wa'iyari mɨtsetse'ikɨ,  
\q2 yunakata mepeukanatɨka,  
\q2 meta yuhɨxita mepakɨkɨpe.  
\q1 Xɨka mɨpaɨ meka'anenenike, mepeunenierenikeyu,  
\q2 mepeu'enanakakeyu,  
\q2 yu'iyaritsie mepɨtemaiwawenikeyu,  
\q1 meta nehetsɨa mepɨ'axɨanikeyu, ne 'aixɨa meteheu'eriekame nepɨwarayeitɨawe”.   
\m
\v 28 »'Ayumieme xeme yaxeketenemaika, Kakaɨyari 'ikɨ wikweitsitɨarika kaneyenɨ'ani memɨkahuriyutsixi wahetsɨa, mɨkɨ hɨrixɨa mekani'eniekuni».   
\p
\v 29 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ 'utayɨku huriyutsixi mekanekɨne niuki waɨkawa mexɨatɨatɨ.   
\p
\v 30 Hikɨ huta wiyari kaniuyurieni muwa 'ayekaitɨ yɨkɨmana tiyutuatɨ. Yunaitɨ hetsɨana memɨ'axekai 'aixɨa katiniwaxeiyakaitɨni.  
\v 31 Kamatɨ katinikuxatakaitɨni kemɨreuyewetse Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku, meta katini'ɨkitakaitɨni Ti'aitame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu hepaɨtsita, xewitɨ ka'iku'imaiyakaku meta xeime kaheumakatɨ.   